 Angiv en nøgle og prøv igen."},com_error_no_base_url:{english:"No base URL found. Please provide one and try again.",translated:"Ingen base-URL fundet. Angiv en og prøv igen."},com_error_invalid_user_key:{english:"Invalid key provided. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"Ugyldig nøgle angivet. Angiv en nøgle og prøv igen."},com_error_expired_user_key:{english:"Provided key for {0} expired at {1}. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"Den angivne nøgle for {0} udløb den {1}. Angiv en nøgle og prøv igen."},com_error_token_balance_exceeded:{english:"You've reached your monthly usage limit. Please contact the team admin for assistance.",translated:"Du har nået din månedlige brugsgrænse. Kontakt teamadministratoren for hjælp."},com_error_token_balance_exceeded_license:{english:"You've reached the maximum tokens for your license. Please contact sales at {0} for further assistance.",translated:"Du har nået det maksimale antal tokens for din licens. Kontakt salg på {0} for yderligere hjælp."},com_error_token_balance_percent_used:{english:"You have used {0}% of your allotted tokens. Please contact {1} for further assistance.",translated:"Du har brugt {0}% af dine tildelte tokens. Kontakt {1} for yderligere hjælp."},com_error_license_expired:{english:"Your License is not available. Please contact support for further assistance.",translated:"Din licens er ikke tilgængelig. Kontakt support for yderligere hjælp."},com_restricted_invalid_ip_format:{english:"IPv6 addresses are not supported. Please use an IPv4 connection or contact support for further assistance.",translated:"IPv6-adresser understøttes ikke. Brug en IPv4-forbindelse eller kontakt support for yderligere hjælp."},com_error_tool_run:{english:"An error occurred while processing your request. Please try again.",translated:"Der opstod en fejl under behandlingen af din anmodning. Prøv igen."},com_files_upload_duplicate_success:{english:"File {0} was already uploaded successfully",translated:"Fil {0} blev allerede uploadet med succes"},com_files_no_results:{english:"No results.",translated:"Ingen resultater."},com_files_filter:{english:"Search files by name",translated:"Søg filer efter navn"},com_files_number_selected:{english:"{0} of {1} file(s) selected",translated:"{0} af {1} fil(er) valgt"},com_sidepanel_select_assistant:{english:"Select an Assistant",translated:"Vælg en Assistent"},com_sidepanel_parameters:{english:"Parameters",translated:"Parametre"},com_ui_create_assistant:{english:"Create Assistant",translated:"Opret Assistent"},com_ui_create_assistant_permission_needed:{english:"User needs create permissions to create an Assistant",translated:"Brugeren skal have oprettelsestilladelser for at oprette en Assistent"},com_sidepanel_assistant_builder:{english:"Assistants",translated:"Assistenter"},com_sidepanel_attach_files:{english:"File Manager",translated:"Filhåndtering"},com_sidepanel_manage_files:{english:"Manage Files",translated:"Administrer Filer"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_title:{english:"Consent",translated:"Samtykke"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_1:{english:"You are about to share this assistant with other team members. Before sharing this assistant, please review the key points below:",translated:"Du er ved at dele denne assistent med andre teammedlemmer. Før du deler denne assistent, bedes du gennemgå de vigtigste punkter nedenfor:"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_2:{english:"By proceeding, you confirm that you understand and accept these terms.",translated:"Ved at fortsætte bekræfter du, at du forstår og accepterer disse vilkår."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_1:{english:"Shared assistant should not contain sensitive or confidential data.",translated:"Delt assistent bør ikke indeholde følsomme eller fortrolige data."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_2:{english:"Shared assistants must not process sensitive or confidential data.",translated:"Delte assistenter må ikke behandle følsomme eller fortrolige data."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_3:{english:"Sharing implies accountability and responsibility for the content and access.",translated:"Deling indebærer ansvar og ansvarlighed for indholdet og adgangen."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_4:{english:" It is recommended to share with a specific team or closed group instead of everyone.",translated:"Det anbefales at dele med et specifikt team eller en lukket gruppe i stedet for alle."},com_button_accept:{english:"Accept",translated:"Accepter"},com_button_decline:{english:"Decline",translated:"Afslå"},com_assistants_capabilities:{english:"Knowledgebase",translated:"Vidensbase"},com_assistants_file_search:{english:"File Search",translated:"Fil Søgning"},com_assistants_file_search_description:{english:"Add files you need your assistant to search from when responding to questions in chat.",translated:"Tilføj her filer, som din assistent skal søge i, når den besvarer spørgsmål i chatten."},com_assistants_file_search_supported_label:{english:"Supported:",translated:"Understøttet:"},com_assistants_file_search_supported:{english:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts.",translated:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts."},com_assistants_file_search_tips_label:{english:"Tip:",translated:"Tip:"},com_assistants_file_search_tips:{english:"Ask your assistant to use the 'File Search Tool' every time it responds to users.",translated:"Bed din assistent om at bruge 'Fil Søgeværktøj' hver gang den svarer brugere."},com_assistants_file_search_info:{english:"Attaching vector stores for File Search is not yet supported. You can attach them from the Provider Playground or attach files to messages for file search on a thread basis.",translated:"Vedhæftning af vektorlagre til Fil Søgning understøttes endnu ikke. Du kan vedhæfte dem fra Provider Playground eller vedhæfte filer til beskeder for filsøgning på trådbasis."},com_assistants_file_search_fetch_error:{english:"Something went wrong when fetching files from the vector stores.",translated:"Noget gik galt ved hentning af filer fra vektorlagrene."},com_assistants_knowledge:{english:"Knowledgebase",translated:"Vidensbase"},com_assistants_knowledge_info:{english:"Upload files to your assistant, so it can use them to answer questions (i.e. CXNGPT User Guide)",translated:"Upload filer til din assistent, så den kan bruge dem til at besvare spørgsmål (f.eks. CXNGPT Brugervejledning)"},com_assistants_knowledge_disabled:{english:"Click Create to save your Assistant, then upload your files, and click Save.",translated:"Klik Opret for at gemme din Assistent, upload derefter dine filer, og klik Gem."},com_assistants_image_vision:{english:"Image Vision",translated:"Billedvision"},com_assistants_code_interpreter:{english:"Code Interpreter",translated:"Kodefortolker"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_description:{english:"Add files you need your assistant to use to analyze or transform data for every chat.",translated:"Tilføj her filer, som din assistent skal bruge til at analysere eller transformere data for hver chat."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported_label:{english:"Supported:",translated:"Understøttet:"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported:{english:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts, csv, jpeg, jpg, gif, png, tar, xlsx, xml, zip.",translated:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts, csv, jpeg, jpg, gif, png, tar, xlsx, xml, zip."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips_label:{english:"Tips:",translated:"Tips:"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips:{english:"Ask your assistant to use the 'Code Interpreter Tool' every time it responds to users.",translated:"Bed din assistent om at bruge 'Kodefortolker Værktøj' hver gang den svarer brugere."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_files_counter:{english:"{0} of {1} files uploaded",tra