hen fetching files from the vector stores.",com_assistants_knowledge:"Knowledgebase",com_assistants_knowledge_info:"Upload files to your assistant, so it can use them to answer questions (i.e. CXNGPT User Guide)",com_assistants_knowledge_disabled:"Click Create to save your Assistant, then upload your files, and click Save.",com_assistants_image_vision:"Image Vision",com_assistants_code_interpreter:"Code Interpreter",com_assistants_code_interpreter_description:"Add here files you need your assistant to use to analyse or transform data for every chat.",com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported_label:"Supported:",com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts, csv, jpeg, jpg, gif, png, tar, xlsx, xml, zip.",com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips_label:"Tips:",com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips:"Ask your assistant to use the 'Code Interpreter Tool' every time it responds to users.",com_assistants_code_interpreter_files_counter:"{0} of {1} files uploaded",com_assistants_code_interpreter_files:"The following files are only available for Code Interpreter:",com_assistants_retrieval:"Retrieval",com_assistants_search_name:"Search assistants by name",com_assistants_tools:"Tools",com_assistants_actions:"Actions",com_assistants_add_tools:"Add Tools",com_assistants_add_actions:"Add Actions",com_assistants_non_retrieval_model:"File search is not enabled on this model. Please select another model.",com_assistants_available_actions:"Available Actions",com_assistants_running_action:"Running action",com_assistants_completed_action:"Talked to {0}",com_assistants_completed_function:"Ran {0}",com_assistants_completed_with_file_search:"Used File Search",com_assistants_function_use:"Assistant used {0}",com_assistants_function_browsewbsite_error_100:"[error processing tool] Failed to fetch the contents of the given website. [100]",com_assistants_function_browsewbsite_error_101:"[error processing tool] Failed to fe