s, mais vous ne pouvez pas en ajouter ni en modifier."},com_ui_assistant_tools_codeexecutor:{english:"Running your code",translated:"Exécution de votre code"},com_ui_assistant_tools_rag_query:{english:"Searching the knowledge base",translated:"Recherche dans la base de connaissances"},com_ui_assistant_tools_voiceworx:{english:"Processing voice",translated:"Traitement de la voix"},com_ui_assistant_tools_memory_store:{english:"Saving to memory",translated:"Enregistrement en mémoire"},com_ui_assistant_tools_memory_delete:{english:"Removing from memory",translated:"Suppression de la mémoire"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_search_online:{english:"Finished searching the web",translated:"Recherche sur le web terminée"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_browse_website:{english:"Finished reviewing the webpage",translated:"Examen de la page web terminé"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_generate_image:{english:"Image generated",translated:"Image générée"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_calculate_math:{english:"Finished calculating",translated:"Calcul terminé"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_codeexecutor:{english:"Finished running your code",translated:"Exécution de votre code terminée"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_rag_query:{english:"Finished searching the knowledge base",translated:"Recherche dans la base de connaissances terminée"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_voiceworx:{english:"Finished processing voice input",translated:"Traitement de l'entrée vocale terminé"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_memory_store:{english:"Saved to memory",translated:"Enregistré en mémoire"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_memory_delete:{english:"Removed from memory",translated:"Supprimé de la mémoire"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_fallback:{english:"Finished: {0}",translated:"Terminé : {0}"},com_ui_still_working:{english:"still working...",translated:"toujours en cours..."},com_ui_file_ready:{english:"{0} is ready",translated:"{0} est prêt"},com_ui_file_ready_fallback:{english:"File is ready",translated:"Le fichier est prêt"},com_ui_file_processing_failed:{english:"{0} could not be processed",translated:"{0} n’a pas pu être traité"},com_ui_file_processing_failed_fallback:{english:"File could not be processed",translated:"Le fichier n’a pas pu être traité"},com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload:{english:"{0} could not be processed. Please re-upload the file.",translated:"{0} n’a pas pu être traité. Veuillez téléverser à nouveau le fichier."},com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload_fallback:{english:"File could not be processed. Please re-upload the file.",translated:"Le fichier n’a pas pu être traité. Veuillez téléverser à nouveau le fichier."},com_ui_file_processing:{english:"Processing...",translated:"Traitement..."},com_ui_file_processing_failed_status:{english:"Processing failed",translated:"Échec du traitement"},com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload_required:{english:"Failed - re-upload required",translated:"Échec - téléversement à nouveau requis"},com_ui_file_retry:{english:"Retry",translated:"Réessayer"},com_ui_file_retry_in:{english:"Retry in {0}s",translated:"Réessayer dans {0}s"},com_ui_file_indexing_retrying:{english:"Retrying file indexing...",translated:"Nouvelle tentative d’indexation du fichier..."},com_ui_file_retry_wait:{english:"Please wait {0}s before retrying",translated:"Veuillez attendre {0}s avant de réessayer"},com_ui_file_retries_exhausted_reupload:{english:"Maximum retries reached. Please re-upload the file.",translated:"Nombre maximal de tentatives atteint. Veuillez téléverser à nouveau le fichier."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_invalid_json:{english:"Invalid JSON file. File content does not match the expected format.",translated:"Fichier JSON invalide. Le contenu du fichier ne correspond pas au format attendu."}},Qv=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,comparisons:Zv,default:$v},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),ek={com_error_moderation:"Alama abun da aka aika ya samu matsala daga tsarinmu na tantancewa saboda bai dace da ka'idodin al'ummarmu ba. Ba za mu iya ci gaba da wannan batun ba. Idan kuna da wasu tambayoyi ko batutuwa da kuke son bincika, da fatan za a gyara sakonku, ko ku ƙirƙiri sabon tattaunawa.",com_error_no_user_key:"Ba a sami maɓalli ba. Da fatan za a bayar da maɓalli kuma a sake gwadawa.",com_error_no_base_url:"Ba a sami URL na asali ba. Da fatan za a bayar da ɗaya kuma a sake gwadawa.",com_error_invalid_user_key:"An bayar da maɓalli mara inganci. Da fatan za a bayar da maɓalli kuma a sake gwadawa.",com_error_expired_user_key:"Maɓallin da aka bayar don {0} ya ƙare a {1}. Da fatan za a bayar da maɓalli kuma a sake gwadawa.",com_error_token_balance_exceeded:"Kun kai iyakar amfani na wata. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai kula da ƙungiyar don taimako.",com_error_token_balance_exceeded_license:"Kun kai iyakar lambobin lasisin ku. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi tallace-tallace a {0} don ƙarin taimako.",com_error_token_balance_percent_used:"Kun yi amfani da {0}% na lambobin da aka ba ku. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi {1} don ƙarin taimako.",com_error_license_expired:"Lasisin ku ba ya nan. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi tallafi don ƙarin taimako.",com_restricted_invalid_ip_format:"Ba a tallafawa adireshin IPv6. Da fatan za a yi amfani da haɗin IPv4 ko tuntuɓi tallafi don ƙarin taimako.",com_error_tool_run:"An samu kuskure yayin sarrafa buƙatarku. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa.",com_files_upload_duplicate_success:"An riga an loda fayil {0} nasara",com_files_no_results:"Babu sakamako.",com_files_filter:"Bincika fayiloli ta suna",com_files_number_selected:"{0} daga cikin {1} fayil(oli) an zaɓa",com_sidepanel_select_assistant:"Zaɓi Mataimaki",com_sidepanel_parameters:"Sigogi",com_ui_create_assistant:"Ƙirƙiri Mataimaki",com_ui_create_assistant_permission_needed:"Mai amfani yana buƙatar izinin ƙirƙira don ƙirƙirar Mataimaki",com_sidepanel_assistant_builder:"Mataimaka",com_sidepanel_attach_files:"Mai Gudanar da Fayiloli",com_sidepanel_manage_files:"Sarrafa Fayiloli",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_title:"Yarda",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_1:"Kuna gab da raba wannan mataimaki tare da sauran membobin ƙungiya. Kafin raba wannan mataimaki, da fatan za a duba mahimman abubuwan da ke ƙasa:",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_2:"Ta hanyar ci gaba, kuna tabbatar da cewa kun fahimta kuma kun yarda da waɗannan sharuɗɗan.",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_1:"Bai kamata a raba mataimaki da ke dauke da bayanai masu mahimmanci ko na sirri ba.",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_2:"Mataimakan da aka raba bai kamata su sarrafa bayanai masu mahimmanci ko na sirri ba.",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_3:"Raba yana nufin daukar alhakin abun ciki da samun dama.",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_4:"Ana ba da shawarar raba wa takamaiman ƙungiya ko rukunin rufe maimakon kowa.",com_button_accept:"Karɓa",com_button_decline:"Ki",com_assistants_capabilities:"Bayanan Ilimi",com_assistants_file_search:"Binciken Fayil",com_assistants_file_search_description:"Sanya nan fayilolin da kake son mataimakinka ya bincika lokacin amsa tambayoyi a hira.",com_assistants_file_search_supported_label:"Ana goyan bayan:",com_assistants_file_search_supported:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts.",com_assistants_file_search_tips_label:"Shawara:",com_assistants_file_search_tips:"Ka tambayi mataimakinka ya yi amfani da 'Kayan Binciken Fayil' duk lokacin da yake amsawa ga masu amfani.",com_assistants_file_search_info:"Ba a goyan bayan haɗa shagunan vector don Binciken Fayil ba tukuna. Za ka iya haɗa su daga Dandalin Mai Ba da sabis ko haɗa fayiloli zuwa saƙonni don binciken fayil a kan tushe na zaren.",com_assistants_file_search_fetch_error:"An samu matsala lokacin da ake ɗauko fayiloli daga shagunan vector.",com_assistants_knowledge:"Bayanan Ilimi",com_assistants_knowledge_info:"Loda fayiloli zuwa mataimakinka, don ya iya amfani da su don amsa tambayoyi (misali, Jagorar Mai Amfani C