a fatan za a shigar da nau'in fayil da ake goyan baya.",com_ui_assistant_image_failed_load:"An kasa ɗora hoto",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_supported_type:"A halin yanzu, JPEG, JPG, PNG, da WEBP kawai ake tallafawa.",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_size_limit:"Girman fayil ya wuce {0} MB.",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_total_size_limit:"Jimillar girman fayiloli ba zai wuce {0} MB ba.",com_ui_assistant_file_validation_error:"An samu kuskure yayin tantance fayil.",com_ui_assistant_file_processing_error:"An samu kuskure yayin sarrafa fayil.",com_ui_assistants:"Mataimaka",com_ui_assistants_category_ix_customer:"Taimakon Studio",com_ui_assistants_category_kbot:"Ilmi",com_ui_assistants_uncategorized:"Ba a tsara ba",com_ui_attachment:"Haɗi",com_ui_assistants_output:"Fitar da Mataimaka",com_ui_delete:"Goge",com_ui_create:"Ƙirƙira",com_ui_share:"Raba",com_ui_copy_link:"Kwafi hanyar haɗi",com_ui_update_link:"Sabunta hanyar haɗi",com_ui_create_link:"Ƙirƙiri hanyar haɗi",com_ui_share_link_to_chat:"Raba hanyar haɗi zuwa hira",com_ui_share_error:"An samu kuskure wajen raba hanyar haɗin hira",com_ui_share_create_message:"Sunan ka da duk saƙonnin da ka ƙara bayan rabawa za su kasance masu zaman kansu.",com_ui_share_created_message:"An ƙirƙiri hanyar haɗi ta jama'a zuwa hirarka. Sarrafa hirarrakin da aka raba a baya a kowane lokaci ta hanyar Saituna.",com_ui_share_update_message:"Sunan ka, umarnin al'ada, da duk saƙonnin da ka ƙara bayan rabawa za su kasance masu zaman kansu.",com_ui_share_updated_message:"An sabunta hanyar haɗi ta jama'a zuwa hirarka. Sarrafa hirarrakin da aka raba a baya a kowane lokaci ta hanyar Saituna.",com_ui_shared_link_not_found:"Ba a sami hanyar haɗin da aka raba ba",com_ui_delete_conversation:"Goge hira?",com_ui_delete_conversation_confirm:"Wannan zai goge",com_ui_delete_assistant_confirm:"Ka tabbata kana son goge wannan Mataimaki? Ba za a iya dawo da shi ba.",com_ui_rename:"Sake suna",com_ui_more_options:"Ƙarin zaɓuɓɓuka",com_ui_preview:"Dubawa",com_ui_upload:"Loda",com_ui_upload_delay:'Loda "{0}" yana ɗaukar lokaci fiye da yadda aka zata. Da fatan za a jira yayin da fayil ɗin ke kammala ƙididdiga don dawowa.',com_ui_privacy_policy:"Manufar sirri",com_ui_terms_of_service:"Ka'idojin sabis",com_ui_use_micrphone:"Yi amfani da makirufo",com_ui_min_tags:"Ba za a iya cire ƙarin ƙima ba, ana buƙatar aƙalla {0}.",com_ui_max_tags:"Adadin mafi yawa da aka yarda shine {0}, ana amfani da ƙima na baya-bayan nan.",com_auth_error_login:"Ba za a iya shiga tare da bayanan da aka bayar ba. Da fatan za a duba bayanan shiga ku sake gwadawa.",com_auth_error_login_rl:"Kun wuce adadin yawan yunkurin shiga da aka yarda. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa a cikin mintuna 15.",com_auth_error_login_ban:"An dakatar da asusunku na ɗan lokaci saboda keta ka'idojin sabis ɗinmu.",com_auth_error_login_server:"An samu kuskure a cikin uwar garke. Da fatan za a jira 'yan mintuna kaɗan kuma sake gwadawa.",com_auth_sign_in:"Shiga",com_endpoint_system_message:"Sakon Tsari",com_endpoint_message:"Sako",com_endpoint_messages:"Sako-sako",com_endpoint_message_not_appendable:"Gyara sakon ka ko Sake ƙirƙira.",com_endpoint_default_blank:"tsoho: babu",com_endpoint_default_false:"tsoho: ƙarya",com_endpoint_default_creative:"tsoho: kirkira",com_endpoint_default_empty:"tsoho: fanko",com_endpoint_default_with_num:"tsoho: {0}",com_endpoint_context:"Mahallin",com_endpoint_tone_style:"Salon Sauti",com_endpoint_token_count:"Adadin Token",com_endpoint_output:"Fitarwa",com_endpoint_context_tokens:"Mafi Girman Tokens na Mahallin",com_endpoint_context_info:`Adadin mafi girman tokens da za a iya amfani da su don mahallin. Yi amfani da wannan don sarrafa yawan tokens da ake aikawa kowane buƙata.
  Idan ba a fayyace ba, za a yi amfani da tsoffin tsarin da aka sani bisa girman mahallin samfuran. Saita ƙima mafi girma na iya haifar da kurakurai da/ko tsadar token mai yawa.`,com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_placeholder:"Saita umarnin al'ada ko mahallin. Za a yi watsi idan babu komai.",com_endpoint_instructions_assistants_placeholder:"Ya maye gurbin umarnin mataimaki. Wannan yana da amfani don gyara halayya a kowace gudu.",com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_assistants_placeholder:"Sanya karin umarni ko mahallin a saman manyan umarnin Mataimaki. Ana watsi da shi idan babu komai.",com_endpoint_custom_name:"Sunan Al'ada",com_endpoint_prompt_prefix:"Umarnin Al'ada",com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_assistants:"Karin Umarnin",com_endpoint_instructions_assistants:"Maye Gurbin Umarnin",com_endpoint_temperature:"Zazzabi",com_endpoint_default:"tsoho",com_endpoint_top_p:"Mafi P",com_endpoint_top_k:"Mafi K",com_endpoint_max_output_tokens:"Mafi Yawan Fitar da Alamu",com_endpoint_stop:"Tsayar da Jerin",com_endpoint_stop_placeholder:"Raba ƙima ta danna `Enter`",com_endpoint_openai_max_tokens:"Filin `max_tokens` na zaɓi, yana wakiltar mafi yawan adadin alamun da za a iya samarwa a cikin cikar tattaunawa.\n\nJimlar tsawon alamun shigarwa da alamun da aka samar yana iyakance da tsawon mahallin samfuran. Kuna iya fuskantar kurakurai idan wannan adadin ya wuce mafi yawan alamun mahallin.",com_endpoint_openai_temp:"Mafi girma = mafi bazuwar, yayin da ƙananan ƙima = mafi mai da hankali da ƙayyadadden. Muna ba da shawarar canza wannan ko Mafi P amma ba duka ba.",com_endpoint_openai_max:"Mafi yawan alamun da za a samar. Jimlar tsawon alamun shigarwa da alamun da aka samar yana iyakance da tsawon mahallin samfurin.",com_endpoint_openai_topp:"Madadin samfurin tare da zazzabi, wanda ake kira samfurin nucleus, inda samfurin ke la'akari da sakamakon alamun tare da yawan yiwuwar top_p. Don haka 0.1 yana nufin kawai alamun da ke kunshe da mafi yawan yawan yiwuwar 10% ake la'akari da su. Muna ba da shawarar canza wannan ko zazzabi amma ba duka ba.",com_endpoint_openai_freq:"Lamba tsakanin 0 da 2.0. Kyawawan ƙima suna hukunta sababbin alamun bisa ga yawan su a cikin rubutun har yanzu, suna rage yiwuwar samfurin don maimaita layi ɗaya daidai.",com_endpoint_openai_pres:"Lamba tsakanin 0 da 2.0. Kyawawan ƙima suna hukunta sababbin alamun bisa ga ko sun bayyana a cikin rubutun har yanzu, suna ƙara yiwuwar samfurin don magana akan sabbin batutuwa.",com_endpoint_openai_resend_files:"Sake aika duk fayilolin da aka makala a baya. Lura: wannan zai ƙara farashin alamu kuma kuna iya fuskantar kurakurai tare da da yawa makaloli.",com_endpoint_openai_detail:'Matsayin warwarewa don buƙatun hangen nesa. "Low" ya fi arha kuma ya fi sauri, "High" ya fi cikakken bayani kuma ya fi tsada, kuma "Auto" zai zaɓi ta atomatik tsakanin biyun bisa ga ƙudurin hoto.',com_endpoint_openai_stop:"Har zuwa jerin 4 inda API zai daina samar da ƙarin alamun.",com_endpoint_openai_custom_name_placeholder:"Sanya sunan al'ada don iXHello",com_endpoint_openai_prompt_prefix_placeholder:"Sanya umarnin al'ada don haɗawa a cikin Saƙon Tsari. Tsoho: babu",com_endpoint_frequency_penalty:"Hukuncin Maimaitawa",com_endpoint_presence_penalty:"Hukuncin Kasancewa",com_endpoint_plug_use_functions:"Yi Amfani da Ayyuka",com_endpoint_plug_resend_files:"Sake Tura Fayiloli",com_endpoint_plug_image_detail:"Cikakken Hoton",com_endpoint_plug_skip_completion:"Tsallake Cikawa",com_endpoint_plug_set_custom_instructions_for_gpt_placeholder:"Saita umarnin al'ada don haɗawa a cikin Saƙon Tsari. Na asali: babu",com_endpoint_import:"Shigo",com_endpoint_set_custom_name:"Saita suna na al'ada, idan zaka iya samun wannan saitin",com_endpoint_preset_delete_confirm:"Ka tabbata kana son share wannan saitin?",com_endpoint_preset_import:"An Shigo da Saiti!",com_endpoint_preset_import_error:"An samu kuskure yayin shigo da saitin ka. Da fatan a sake gwadawa.",com_endpoint_preset_save_error:"An samu kuskure yayin adana saitin ka. Da fatan a sake gwadawa.",