_type_csv:"csv (.csv)",com_ui_error_empty_agent_response:"Ba a sami amsa ba. Da fatan za a sake aika sakonku. Idan matsalar ta ci gaba bayan sake loda shafin da sake gwadawa, da fatan za a tuntubi tallafi.",com_ui_back_to_chat:"Komawa Zuwa Tattaunawa",com_assistants_guardrail_moderation:"Tsarin Kula da Guardrail",com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_enabled_info:"An kunna tsarin kula da guardrail don wannan mataimaki. Za a duba abun ciki da manufofin kula.",com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_disabled_info:"Kashe tsarin kula da guardrail yana cire duba abun ciki don wannan mataimaki. Kai ke da alhakin bin manufofin abun ciki na ƙungiyar ku. Ana yin cikakken rikodin da sa ido kan ayyuka.",com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_off_reason_placeholder:"Da fatan a bayyana dalilin kasuwancin ku na kashe tsarin kula da guardrail (ana buƙata).",com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_reason_required:"Da fatan a bayar da dalili na kashe tsarin kula da guardrail.",com_assistants_allow_model_switching:"Bada izinin masu amfani su canza samfurin a cikin hira",com_ui_feedback_good:"Amsa mai kyau",com_ui_feedback_bad:"Amsa mara kyau",com_ui_feedback_comments:"Sharhi",com_ui_feedback_comments_optional:"Sharhi (zabi)",com_ui_feedback_placeholder:"Gaya mana ƙari game da ƙwarewar ka...",com_ui_feedback_submit:"Aika",com_ui_feedback_error:"Ba mu iya aika ra'ayinka ba",com_ui_feedback_reason_incorrect:"Ba daidai ba",com_ui_feedback_reason_not_relevant:"Ba da alaƙa ba",com_ui_feedback_reason_outdated:"Ya tsufa",com_ui_feedback_reason_not_enough_detail:"Ba isassun cikakkun bayanai ba",com_ui_feedback_reason_other:"Sauran",com_ui_model_recommended:"Shawarar",com_ui_model_legacy:"Tsoho — don Allah sabunta",com_ui_model_legacy_invalid:"Ba a tallafawa wannan samfurin ba. Da fatan za a zaɓi sabon samfurin.",com_nav_setting_memory:"Ƙwaƙwalwa",com_nav_memory_description:"Sarrafa bayanan sirri da mataimaki ke tunawa a cikin tattaunawarku.",com_nav_memory_add_placeholder:"Ƙara sabon ƙwaƙwalwa…",com_nav_m