tunani da damar multimodal.","modelConfig.gpt5.description":"Babban samfurin OpenAI na gaba.","modelConfig.gpt5Mini.description":"GPT-5 mai sauƙi — mai inganci da sauri don ayyukan yau da kullum.","modelConfig.gpt41.description":"OpenAI GPT-4.1 — ingantaccen bin umarni da tunani.","modelConfig.gpt41Mini.description":"Ƙaramar GPT-4.1 — mai sauri da arha don ayyuka masu sauƙi.","modelConfig.gpt4o.description":"Mafi ƙwarewa samfurin GPT-4, an inganta don sauri da farashi.","modelConfig.gpt4oMini.description":"GPT-4o mai sauƙi — mai sauri da arha don ayyuka masu sauƙi.","modelConfig.gemini31Pro.description":"Google Gemini 3.1 Pro (Preview) — samfurin Gemini mafi ƙarfi tare da mahallin 1M.","modelConfig.gemini3Flash.description":"Google Gemini 3 Flash (Preview) — sauri da inganci tare da mahallin 1M.","modelConfig.gemini31FlashLite.description":"Google Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite — samfurin haske mai ƙarancin jinkiri tare da mahallin 1M.","modelConfig.voiceworx.description":"Samfurin mataimaki mai daidaitawa da murya na ciki.","modelConfig.auto.description":"Auto yana zaɓar mafi kyawun ƙirar don buƙatar ku bisa ƙarfi da aiki.",com_ui_model_coming_soon:"Na Tafe Ba Da Jimawa Ba",com_assistants_owners:"Owners",com_assistants_owner_added:"Owner added successfully",com_assistants_owner_removed:"Owner removed successfully",com_assistants_owner_last_owner_error:"Cannot remove the last owner of an assistant",com_assistants_owner_email_placeholder:"Add owner by email",com_ui_add:"Add",com_ui_you:"you",com_assistants_add_owners:"Add owners",com_assistants_owner_search_placeholder:"Search by name or email (min. 3 characters)",com_assistants_owner_search_hint:"Type at least 3 characters to search",com_assistants_owner_no_results:"No users found",com_assistants_owner_discard_warning:"Unsaved changes will be discarded. Are you sure?",com_assistants_owners_saved:"Owners updated successfully",com_assistants_save_owners:"Save owners",com_assistants_pending_additions:"Pending additions",com_ui_saving:"Saving...",com_ui_discard:"Discard",com_ui_keep_editing:"Keep editing",com_ui_undo:"Undo",com_assistants_auto_weight_title:"Zaɓuɓɓukan jagorantarwa ta atomatik",com_assistants_auto_weight_description:"Daidaita yadda mai jagorantarwa ta atomatik ke daidaita musayar daidaito wajen zaɓar samfurin kowane juyi. Ana daidaita nauyi — daidaiton dangi ne yake da muhimmanci.",com_assistants_auto_weight_cost:"Farashi",com_assistants_auto_weight_cost_helper:"Ba fifiko ga samfura masu rahusa da ƙananan kuɗin token.",com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy:"Daidaito",com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy_helper:"Ba fifiko ga samfura masu ƙarfi don tunani mai rikitarwa.",com_assistants_auto_weight_speed:"Sauri",com_assistants_auto_weight_speed_helper:"Ba fifiko ga samfura masu sauri, masu ƙarancin jinkiri.",com_assistants_auto_weight_reset:"Mayar da tsoffin saituna",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_timeout_error:"Lokacin loda fayil ya ƙare. Da fatan a sake gwadawa cikin ƴan mintuna.",com_error_assistant_not_available:"Wani abu ya faru ba daidai ba. Ga takamaiman saƙon kuskuren da muka samu: An sami kuskure yayin sarrafa buƙatarku. Mataimakin ba ya samuwa kuma. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi Admin.",com_ui_code:"Lambar",com_ui_assistant_share:"Raba",com_ui_assistant_share_link_copied:"An kwafi hanyar haɗi",com_ui_assistant_no_access:"Ba ka da damar shiga wannan mataimaki",com_ui_copy_to_clipboard_error:"An kasa kwafe mahaɗin zuwa allo na kwafi",com_ui_preview_incomplete:"Bayanan gani ba su samuwa ba — ƙirƙirar abun ciki bai kammala ba.",com_ui_view_code:"Duba lamba",com_ui_preview_invalid:"Babu samfoti — abun ciki ba daidai ba ne.",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_timeout_retrying:"Lodawa na ɗaukar lokaci fiye da yadda aka zata - ana sake gwadawa ({0}/{1})...",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_connection_retrying:"Matsalar haɗi - ana sake gwadawa ({0}/{1})...",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_connection_failed:"Lodawa ta gaza - da fatan za a duba haɗinka sannan a sake gwadawa",com_ui_assistant_tools_codeexecutor:"Ana gudanar da lambar ku",com_ui_assistant_tools_rag_query:"Ana binciken tushen ilmi",com_ui_assistant_tools_voiceworx:"Ana sarrafa murya",com_ui_assistant_tools_memory_store:"Ana adanawa a ƙwaƙwalwa",com_ui_assistant_tools_memory_delete:"Ana cirewa daga ƙwaƙwalwa",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_search_online:"An gama binciken yanar gizo",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_browse_website:"An gama duba shafin yanar gizo",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_generate_image:"An ƙirƙiri hoto",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_calculate_math:"An gama lissafi",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_codeexecutor:"An gama gudanar da lambar ku",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_rag_query:"An gama binciken tushen ilmi",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_voiceworx:"An gama sarrafa shigarwar murya",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_memory_store:"An adana a ƙwaƙwalwa",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_memory_delete:"An cire daga ƙwaƙwalwa",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_fallback:"An gama: {0}",com_ui_still_working:"har yanzu ana aiki...",com_assistants_pii_entity_phone:"Lambar Waya",com_assistants_pii_entity_email:"Adireshin Imel",com_assistants_pii_entity_credit_card:"Katunan Kiredit",com_assistants_pii_entity_ssn:"Lambar SSN",com_assistants_memory_enabled:"Ƙwaƙwalwa",com_assistants_memory_enabled_info:"An kunna ƙwaƙwalwa don wannan mataimaki. Mataimakin na iya adanawa da tuna bayanai a tsakanin tattaunawa.",com_assistants_memory_disabled_info:"An kashe ƙwaƙwalwa don wannan mataimaki. Ba za a adana ko tuna wani bayani a tsakanin tattaunawa ba.",com_assistants_memory_enabled_off_reason_placeholder:"Da fatan a bayyana dalilin kasuwancinku na kashe ƙwaƙwalwa (ana buƙata).",com_assistants_memory_enabled_reason_required:"Da fatan a bayar da dalili na kashe ƙwaƙwalwa.",com_nav_memory_team_disabled:"An kashe ƙwaƙwalwa don ƙungiyarku. Kuna iya duba da share ƙwaƙwalwar da ake da ita, amma ba za ku iya ƙara ko gyara sababbi ba.",com_ui_file_ready:"{0} ya shirya",com_ui_file_ready_fallback:"Fayil ya shirya",com_ui_file_processing_failed:"Ba a iya sarrafa {0} ba",com_ui_file_processing_failed_fallback:"Ba a iya sarrafa fayil ba",com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload:"Ba a iya sarrafa {0} ba. Da fatan za a sake loda fayil ɗin.",com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload_fallback:"Ba a iya sarrafa fayil ba. Da fatan za a sake loda fayil ɗin.",com_ui_file_processing:"Ana sarrafawa...",com_ui_file_processing_failed_status:"Sarrafawa ya gaza",com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload_required:"Ya gaza - ana buƙatar sake loda fayil",com_ui_file_retry:"Sake gwadawa",com_ui_file_retry_in:"Sake gwadawa cikin {0}s",com_ui_file_indexing_retrying:"Ana sake gwada yin fihirisar fayil...",com_ui_file_retry_wait:"Da fatan a jira {0}s kafin sake gwadawa",com_ui_file_retries_exhausted_reupload:"An kai iyakar sake gwadawa. Da fatan a sake loda fayil ɗin.",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_invalid_json:"Fayil ɗin JSON mara inganci. Abun cikin fayil ɗin bai dace da tsarin da ake tsammani ba."},ak={com_error_moderation:{english:"It appears that the content submitted has been flagged by our moderation system for not aligning with our community guidelines. We're unable to proceed with this specific topic. If you have any other questions or topics you'd like to explore, please edit your message, or create a new conversation.",translated:"Alama abun da aka aika ya samu matsala daga tsarinmu na tantancewa saboda bai dace da ka'idodin al'ummarmu ba. Ba za mu iya ci gaba da wannan batun ba. Idan kuna da wasu tambayoyi ko batutuwa da kuke son bincika, da fatan za a gyara sakonku, ko ku ƙirƙiri sabon tattaunawa."},com_error_no_user_key:{english:"No key found. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"Ba a sami maɓalli ba. Da fatan za a bayar da maɓalli kuma a sake gwadawa."},com_error_no_base_url:{english:"No base URL found. Please provide one and try again.",translated:"Ba a sami URL na asali ba. Da fatan za a bayar da ɗaya kuma a sake gwadawa."},com_error_invalid_user_key:{english:"Invalid key provided. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"An bayar da maɓalli mara inganci. Da fatan za a bayar da maɓalli kuma a sake gwadawa."},com_error_expired_user_key:{english:"Provided key for {0} expired at {1}. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"Maɓallin da aka bayar don {0} ya ƙare a {1}. Da fatan za a bayar da maɓalli kuma a sake gwadawa."},com_error_token_balance_exceeded:{english:"You've reached your monthly usage limit. Please contact the team admin for assistance.",translated:"Kun kai iyakar amfani na wata. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai kula da ƙungiyar don taimako."},com_error_token_balance_exceeded_license:{english:"You've reached the maximum tokens for your license. Please contact sales at {0} for further assistance.",translated:"Kun kai iyakar lambobin lasisin ku. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi tallace-tallace a {0} don ƙarin taimako."},com_error_token_balance_percent_used:{english:"You have used {0}% of your allotted tokens. Please contact {1} for further assistance.",translated:"Kun yi amfani da {0}% na lambobin da aka ba ku. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi {1} don ƙarin taimako."},com_error_license_expired:{english:"Your License is not available. Please contact support for further assistance.",translated:"Lasisin ku ba ya nan. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi tallafi don ƙarin taimako."},com_restricted_invalid_ip_format:{english:"IPv6 addresses are not supported. Please use an IPv4 connection or contact support for further assistance.",translated:"Ba a tallafawa adireshin IPv6. Da fatan za a yi amfani da haɗin IPv4 ko tuntuɓi tallafi don ƙarin taimako."},com_error_tool_run:{english:"An error occurred while processing your request. Please try again.",translated:"An samu kuskure yayin sarrafa buƙatarku. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa."},com_files_upload_duplicate_success:{english:"File {0} was already uploaded successfully",translated:"An riga an loda fayil {0} nasara"},com_files_no_results:{english:"No results.",translated:"Babu sakamako."},com_files_filter:{english:"Search files by name",translated:"Bincika fayiloli ta suna"},com_files_number_selected:{english:"{0} of {1} file(s) selected",translated:"{0} daga cikin {1} fayil(oli) an zaɓa"},com_sidepanel_select_assistant:{english:"Select an Assistant",translated:"Zaɓi Mataimaki"},com_sidepanel_parameters:{english:"Parameters",translated:"Sigogi"},com_ui_create_assistant:{english:"Create Assistant",translated:"Ƙirƙiri Mataimaki"},com_ui_create_assistant_permission_needed:{english:"User needs create permissions to create an Assistant",translated:"Mai amfani yana buƙatar izinin ƙirƙira don ƙirƙirar Mataimaki"},com_sidepanel_assistant_builder:{english:"Assistants",translated:"Mataimaka"},com_sidepanel_attach_files:{english:"File Manager",translated:"Mai Gudanar da Fayiloli"},com_sidepanel_manage_files:{english:"Manage Files",translated:"Sarrafa Fayiloli"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_title:{english:"Consent",translated:"Yarda"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_1:{english:"You are about to share this assistant with other team members. Before sharing this assistant, please review the key points below:",translated:"Kuna gab da raba wannan mataimaki tare da sauran membobin ƙungiya. Kafin raba wannan mataimaki, da fatan za a duba mahimman abubuwan da ke ƙasa:"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_2:{english:"By proceeding, you confirm that you understand and accept these terms.",translated:"Ta hanyar ci gaba, kuna tabbatar da cewa kun fahimta kuma kun yarda da waɗannan sharuɗɗan."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_1:{english:"Shared assistant should not contain sensitive or confidential data.",translated:"Bai kamata a raba mataimaki da ke dauke da bayanai masu mahimmanci ko na sirri ba."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_2:{english:"Shared assistants must not process sensitive or confidential data.",translated:"Mataimakan da aka raba bai kamata su sarrafa bayanai masu mahimmanci ko na sirri ba."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_3:{english:"Sharing implies accountability and responsibility for the content and access.",translated:"Raba yana nufin daukar alhakin abun ciki da samun dama."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_4:{english:" It is recommended to share with a specific team or closed group instead of everyone.",translated:"Ana ba da shawarar raba wa takamaiman ƙungiya ko rukunin rufe maimakon kowa."},com_button_accept:{english:"Accept",translated:"Karɓa"},com_button_decline:{english:"Decline",translated:"Ki"},com_assistants_capabilities:{english:"Knowledgebase",translated:"Bayanan Ilimi"},com_assistants_file_search:{english:"File Search",translated:"Binciken Fayil"},com_assistants_file_search_description:{english:"Add files you need your assistant to search from when responding to questions in chat.",translated:"Sanya nan fayilolin da kake son mataimakinka ya bincika lokacin amsa tambayoyi a hira."},com_assistants_file_search_supported_label:{english:"Supported:",translated:"Ana goyan bayan:"},com_assistants_file_search_supported:{english:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts.",translated:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts."},com_assistants_file_search_tips_label:{english:"Tip:",translated:"Shawara:"},com_assistants_file_search_tips:{english:"Ask your assistant to use the 'File Search Tool' every time it responds to users.",translated:"Ka tambayi mataimakinka ya yi amfani da 'Kayan Binciken Fayil' duk lokacin da yake amsawa ga masu amfani."},com_assistants_file_search_info:{english:"Attaching vector stores for File Search is not yet supported. You can attach them from the Provider Playground or attach files to messages for file search on a thread basis.",translated:"Ba a goyan bayan haɗa shagunan vector don Binciken Fayil ba tukuna. Za ka iya haɗa su daga Dandalin Mai Ba da sabis ko haɗa fayiloli zuwa saƙonni don binciken fayil a kan tushe na zaren."},com_assistants_file_search_fetch_error:{english:"Something went wrong when fetching files from the vector stores.",translated:"An samu matsala lokacin da ake ɗauko fayiloli daga shagunan vector."},com_assistants_knowledge:{english:"Knowledgebase",translated:"Bayanan Ilimi"},com_assistants_knowledge_info:{english:"Upload files to your assistant, so it can use them to answer questions (i.e. CXNGPT User Guide)",translated:"Loda fayiloli zuwa mataimakinka, don ya iya amfani da su don amsa tambayoyi (misali, Jagorar Mai Amfani CXNGPT)"},com_assistants_knowledge_disabled:{english:"Click Create to save your Assistant, then upload your files, and click Save.",translated:"Danna Create don ajiye Mataimakinka, sannan loda fayilolinka, kuma danna Ajiye."},com_assistants_image_vision:{english:"Image Vision",translated:"Hangen Hoto"},com_assistants_code_interpreter:{english:"Code Interpreter",translated:"Mai Fassara Lamba"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_description:{english:"Add files you need your assistant to use to analyze or transform data for every chat.",translated:"Sanya nan fayilolin da kake son mataimakinka ya yi amfani da su don nazari ko sauya bayanai ga kowane hira."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported_label:{english:"Supported:",translated:"Ana goyan bayan:"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported:{english:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts, csv, jpeg, jpg, gif, png, tar, xlsx, xml, zip.",translated:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts, csv, jpeg, jpg, gif, png, tar, xlsx, xml, zip."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips_label:{english:"Tips:",translated:"Shawara:"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips:{english:"Ask your assistant to use the 'Code Interpreter Tool' every time it responds to users.",translated:"Ka tambayi mataimakinka ya yi amfani da 'Kayan Fassara Lamba' duk lokacin da yake amsawa ga masu amfani."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_files_counter:{english:"{0} of {1} files uploaded",translated:"{0} daga cikin {1} fayiloli an loda"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_files:{english:"The following files are only available for Code Interpreter:",translated:"Wadannan fayiloli suna samuwa ne kawai don Mai Fassarawa na Lamba:"},com_assistants_retrieval:{english:"Retrieval",translated:"Dawo da"},com_assistants_search_name:{english:"Search assistants by name",translated:"Nemo mataimaka ta suna"},com_assistants_tools:{english:"Tools",translated:"Kayan aiki"},com_assistants_actions:{english:"Actions",translated:"Ayyuka"},com_assistants_add_tools:{english:"Add Tools",translated:"Kara Kayan Aiki"},com_assistants_add_actions:{english:"Add Actions",translated:"Kara Ayyuka"},com_assistants_non_retrieval_model:{english:"File search is not enabled on this model. Please select another model.",translated:"Binciken fayil bai kunna akan wannan samfurin ba. Da fatan za a zaɓi wani samfurin."},com_assistants_available_actions:{english:"Available Actions",translated:"Ayyuka Masu Samuwa"},com_assistants_running_action:{english:"Running action",translated:"Gudanar da aiki"},com_assistants_completed_action:{english:"Talked to {0}",translated:"Magana da {0}"},com_assistants_completed_function:{english:"Ran {0}",translated:"Gudanar da {0}"},com_assistants_completed_with_file_search:{english:"Used File Search",translated:"An yi Amfani da Binciken Fayil"},com_assistants_function_use:{english:"Assistant used {0}",translated:"Mataimaki ya yi amfani da {0}"},com_assistants_function_browsewbsite_error_100:{english:"[error processing tool] Failed to fetch the contents of the given website. [100]",translated:"[kuskuren sarrafa kayan aiki] An kasa samo abun ciki na gidan yanar gizon da aka bayar. [100]"},com_assistants_function_browsewbsite_error_101:{english:"[error processing tool] Failed to fetch the contents of the given website. [101]",translated:"[kuskuren sarrafa kayan aiki] An kasa samo abun ciki na gidan yanar gizon da aka bayar. [101]"},com_assistants_domain_info:{english:"Assistant sent this info to {0}",translated:"Mataimaki ya aika wannan bayani zuwa {0}"},com_assistants_delete_permission_title:{english:"Deleting only allowed with private Assistants",translated:"Ana ba da izinin sharewa ne kawai tare da Mataimaka masu zaman kansu"},com_assistants_delete_actions_success:{english:"Successfully deleted Action from Assistant",translated:"An sami nasarar share Aiki daga Mataimaki"},com_assistants_update_actions_success:{english:"Successfully created or updated Action",translated:"An sami nasarar ƙirƙira ko sabunta Aiki"},com_assistants_update_actions_error:{english:"There was an error creating or updating the action.",translated:"An samu kuskure wajen ƙirƙira ko sabunta aikin."},com_assistants_delete_actions_error:{english:"There was an error deleting the action.",translated:"An samu kuskure wajen share aikin."},com_assistants_actions_info:{english:"Let your Assistant retrieve information or take actions via API's",translated:"Bari Mataimakinka ya dawo da bayani ko ya dauki matakai ta API's"},com_assistants_name_placeholder:{english:"Name your assistant (i.e. Email Generator)",translated:"Sanya wa mataimakinka suna (misali Mai Kirkirar Imel)"},com_assistants_instructions_placeholder:{english:"Provide your assistant with specific, detailed, comprehensive guidelines to direct its behavior (i.e. Goal, Role, Actions, Audience, Style, Rules, Task, Template, Example)",translated:"Bayar da cikakkun umarni ga mataimaki (misali: Manufa, Matsayi, Ayyuka, Masu sauraro, Salo, Dokoki, Aiki, Tsari, Misali)"},com_assistants_description_placeholder:{english:"Describe concisely what your assistant can do (i.e. Generate emails from template)",translated:"Bayyana a taƙaice abin da mataimaki zai iya yi (misali: Ƙirƙiri imel daga tsari)"},com_assistants_actions_disabled:{english:"You need to create an assistant before adding actions.",translated:"Dole ne ku ƙirƙiri mataimaki kafin ƙara ayyuka."},com_assistants_update_success:{english:"Successfully updated",translated:"An sabunta nasara"},com_assistants_update_error:{english:"There was an error updating your assistant.",translated:"An samu kuskure wajen sabunta mataimaki."},com_assistants_create_success:{english:"Successfully created",translated:"An ƙirƙiri nasara"},com_assistants_create_error:{english:"There was an error creating your assistant.",translated:"An samu kuskure wajen ƙirƙirar mataimaki."},com_assistants_loading:{english:"Loading assistants...",translated:"Ana loda mataimaka..."},com_assistants_pii_redaction_reason_required:{english:"Please provide a reason for enabling PII.",translated:"Da fatan za a bayar da dalili don kunna PII."},com_assistants_settings_and_privacy:{english:"Settings & Privacy",translated:"Saituna & Sirri"},com_assistants_pii_redaction:{english:"PII Redaction",translated:"Goge PII"},com_assistants_pii_redaction_enabled_info:{english:"PII redaction is enabled for this assistant's model calls by default.",translated:"Goge PII yana kunnawa ta tsohuwa don kiran samfurin wannan mataimaki."},com_assistants_pii_redaction_disabled_info:{english:"Allowing PII disables redaction for this assistant’s model calls. You are responsible for complying with your organization’s data policies. Activity is fully logged and monitored.",translated:"Kunna PII yana kashe gogewa don kiran samfurin wannan mataimaki. Kai ne ke da alhakin bin dokokin bayanan ƙungiyarka. Ana yin cikakken rikodi da sa ido akan ayyuka."},com_assistants_pii_redaction_off_reason_placeholder:{english:"Please explain your reason for enabling PII (required).",translated:"Da fatan za a bayyana dalilin ku na kunna PII (ana buƙata)."},com_ui_min_length_error:{english:"Minimum length is {0} characters.",translated:"Mafi ƙarancin tsawo shine {0} haruffa."},com_ui_max_length_error:{english:"Maximum length is {0} characters.",translated:"Mafi girman tsawo shine {0} haruffa."},com_ui_date_today:{english:"Today",translated:"Yau"},com_ui_date_yesterday:{english:"Yesterday",translated:"Jiya"},com_ui_date_previous_7_days:{english:"Previous 7 days",translated:"Kwanaki 7 da suka gabata"},com_ui_date_previous_30_days:{english:"Previous 30 days",translated:"Kwanaki 30 da suka gabata"},com_ui_date_january:{english:"January",translated:"Janairu"},com_ui_date_february:{english:"February",translated:"Fabrairu"},com_ui_date_march:{english:"March",translated:"Maris"},com_ui_date_april:{english:"April",translated:"Afirilu"},com_ui_date_may:{english:"May",translated:"Mayu"},com_ui_date_june:{english:"June",translated:"Yuni"},com_ui_date_july:{english:"July",translated:"Yuli"},com_ui_date_august:{english:"August",translated:"Agusta"},com_ui_date_september:{english:"September",translated:"Satumba"},com_ui_date_october:{english:"October",translated:"Oktoba"},com_ui_date_november:{english:"November",translated:"Nuwamba"},com_ui_date_december:{english:"December",translated:"Disamba"},com_ui_field_required:{english:"This field is required",translated:"Wannan filin yana da buƙata"},com_ui_download_error:{english:"Error downloading file. The file may have been deleted.",translated:"Kuskure wajen sauke fayil. Wataƙila an share fayil ɗin."},com_ui_attach_error_type:{english:"Unsupported file type for endpoint:",translated:"Nau'in fayil ɗin ba a goyan baya ba don wannan wuri:"},com_ui_attach_error_openai:{english:"Cannot attach Assistant files to other endpoints",translated:"Ba za a iya haɗa fayilolin Mataimaki zuwa wasu wurare ba"},com_ui_attach_error_size:{english:"File size limit exceeded for endpoint:",translated:"An wuce iyakar girman fayil don wannan wuri:"},com_ui_attach_error:{english:"Cannot attach file. Create or select a conversation, or try refreshing the page.",translated:"Ba za a iya haɗa fayil ba. Ƙirƙiri ko zaɓi tattaunawa, ko gwada sabunta shafin."},com_ui_examples:{english:"Examples",translated:"Misalai"},com_ui_new_chat:{english:"New chat",translated:"Sabon tattaunawa"},com_ui_conversations:{english:"Chats",translated:"Tattaunawa"},com_ui_conversations_placeholder:{english:"Start a conversation...",translated:"Fara tattaunawa..."},com_ui_new_conversation:{english:"New Chat",translated:"Sabon Tattaunawa"},com_ui_assistant_library:{english:"Assistant Library",translated:"Mataimakin Laburare"},com_ui_kbot_assistants:{english:"Knowledge",translated:"Ilmi"},com_ui_assistant_search:{english:"Search for an assistant",translated:"Nemo mataimaki"},com_ui_assistant_default_category:{english:"General",translated:"Janar"},com_ui_assistant_featured:{english:"Featured",translated:"Fitattu"},com_ui_assistant_no_matches:{english:"No assistants match the search criteria.",translated:"Babu mataimaki da ya dace da ka'idodin bincike."},com_ui_assistant_empty_results:{english:"No assistants found.",translated:"Ba a sami mataimaki ba."},com_ui_example_quantum_computing:{english:"Explain quantum computing in simple terms",translated:"Bayyana lissafin kwamfuta na quantum a sauƙaƙe"},com_ui_example_10_year_old_b_day:{english:"Got any creative ideas for a 10 year old's birthday?",translated:"Kuna da wasu ra'ayoyi masu kirkira don ranar haihuwar yaro mai shekaru 10?"},com_ui_example_http_in_js:{english:"How do I make an HTTP request in Javascript?",translated:"Ta yaya zan yi buƙatar HTTP a cikin Javascript?"},com_ui_category_placeholder:{english:"Search a category",translated:"Nemo rukuni"},com_ui_tool_placeholder:{english:"Search a tool",translated:"Nemo kayan aiki"},com_ui_capabilities:{english:"Capabilities",translated:"Iyawa"},com_ui_capability_remember:{english:"Remembers what user said earlier in the conversation",translated:"Yana tuna abin da mai amfani ya faɗa a baya a cikin tattaunawa"},com_ui_capability_correction:{english:"Allows user to provide follow-up corrections",translated:"Yana ba mai amfani damar bayar da gyare-gyare na ci gaba"},com_ui_capability_decline_requests:{english:"Trained to decline inappropriate requests",translated:"An horar da shi don ƙin buƙatun da ba su dace ba"},com_ui_limitations:{english:"Limitations",transl