as dan paling padat — ideal untuk tugas throughput tinggi.","modelConfig.gpt53Chat.description":"GPT-5.3 — penaakulan dipertingkat dan keupayaan multimodal.","modelConfig.gpt5.description":"Model generasi seterusnya utama OpenAI.","modelConfig.gpt5Mini.description":"GPT-5 ringan — cekap dan pantas untuk tugas harian.","modelConfig.gpt41.description":"OpenAI GPT-4.1 — peningkatan pengikut arahan dan penaakulan.","modelConfig.gpt41Mini.description":"GPT-4.1 padat — lebih pantas dan murah untuk tugas mudah.","modelConfig.gpt4o.description":"Model GPT-4 paling berkemampuan, dioptimumkan untuk kelajuan dan kos.","modelConfig.gpt4oMini.description":"GPT-4o ringan — lebih pantas dan murah untuk tugas mudah.","modelConfig.gemini31Pro.description":"Google Gemini 3.1 Pro (Pratonton) — model Gemini paling berkuasa dengan konteks 1M.","modelConfig.gemini3Flash.description":"Google Gemini 3 Flash (Pratonton) — pantas dan cekap dengan konteks 1M.","modelConfig.gemini31FlashLite.description":"Google Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite — model ringan berlatensi rendah dengan konteks 1M.","modelConfig.voiceworx.description":"Model pembantu dioptimumkan suara dalaman.","modelConfig.auto.description":"Auto memilih model terbaik untuk permintaan anda berdasarkan kapasiti dan prestasi.",com_ui_model_coming_soon:"Akan Datang",com_assistants_owners:"Owners",com_assistants_owner_added:"Owner added successfully",com_assistants_owner_removed:"Owner removed successfully",com_assistants_owner_last_owner_error:"Cannot remove the last owner of an assistant",com_assistants_owner_email_placeholder:"Add owner by email",com_ui_add:"Add",com_ui_you:"you",com_assistants_add_owners:"Add owners",com_assistants_owner_search_placeholder:"Search by name or email (min. 3 characters)",com_assistants_owner_search_hint:"Type at least 3 characters to search",com_assistants_owner_no_results:"No users found",com_assistants_owner_discard_warning:"Unsaved changes will be discarded. Are you sure?",com_assistants_owners_saved:"Own