mwa kwa msaidizi huyu. Hakuna taarifa zitakazohifadhiwa au kukumbukwa katika mazungumzo mbalimbali.",com_assistants_memory_enabled_off_reason_placeholder:"Tafadhali eleza sababu yako ya kibiashara ya kuzima kumbukumbu (inahitajika).",com_assistants_memory_enabled_reason_required:"Tafadhali toa sababu ya kuzima kumbukumbu.",com_nav_memory_team_disabled:"Kumbukumbu imezimwa kwa timu yako. Unaweza kuona na kufuta kumbukumbu zilizopo, lakini huwezi kuongeza au kuhariri mpya.",com_ui_file_ready:"{0} iko tayari",com_ui_file_ready_fallback:"Faili iko tayari",com_ui_file_processing_failed:"{0} haikuweza kuchakatwa",com_ui_file_processing_failed_fallback:"Faili haikuweza kuchakatwa",com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload:"{0} haikuweza kuchakatwa. Tafadhali pakia faili tena.",com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload_fallback:"Faili haikuweza kuchakatwa. Tafadhali pakia faili tena.",com_ui_file_processing:"Inachakata...",com_ui_file_processing_failed_status:"Uchakataji umeshindikana",com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload_required:"Imeshindikana - pakia tena inahitajika",com_ui_file_retry:"Jaribu tena",com_ui_file_retry_in:"Jaribu tena baada ya {0}s",com_ui_file_indexing_retrying:"Inajaribu tena kuorodhesha faili...",com_ui_file_retry_wait:"Tafadhali subiri {0}s kabla ya kujaribu tena",com_ui_file_retries_exhausted_reupload:"Idadi ya juu ya majaribio imefikiwa. Tafadhali pakia faili tena.",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_invalid_json:"Faili ya JSON si sahihi. Maudhui ya faili hayalingani na muundo unaotarajiwa."},ab={com_error_moderation:{english:"It appears that the content submitted has been flagged by our moderation system for not aligning with our community guidelines. We're unable to proceed with this specific topic. If you have any other questions or topics you'd like to explore, please edit your message, or create a new conversation.",translated:"Inaonekana maudhui yaliyowasilishwa yamewekewa alama na mfumo wetu wa usimamizi kwa kutokulingana na miongozo ya jamii yetu. Hatuwezi kuendelea na mada hii maalum. Ikiwa una maswali au mada zingine unazotaka kuchunguza, tafadhali hariri ujumbe wako, au unda mazungumzo mapya."},com_error_no_user_key:{english:"No key found. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"Hakuna ufunguo uliopatikana. Tafadhali toa ufunguo na ujaribu tena."},com_error_no_base_url:{english:"No base URL found. Please provide one and try again.",translated:"Hakuna URL msingi iliyopatikana. Tafadhali toa moja na ujaribu tena."},com_error_invalid_user_key:{english:"Invalid key provided. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"Ufunguo uliotolewa si sahihi. Tafadhali toa ufunguo na ujaribu tena."},com_error_expired_user_key:{english:"Provided key for {0} expired at {1}. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"Ufunguo uliotolewa kwa {0} uliisha muda {1}. Tafadhali toa ufunguo na ujaribu tena."},com_error_token_balance_exceeded:{english:"You've reached your monthly usage limit. Please contact the team admin for assistance.",translated:"Umefikia kikomo cha matumizi ya mwezi. Tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi wa timu kwa msaada."},com_error_token_balance_exceeded_license:{english:"You've reached the maximum tokens for your license. Please contact sales at {0} for further assistance.",translated:"Umefikia kiwango cha juu cha tokeni kwa leseni yako. Tafadhali wasiliana na mauzo kwa {0} kwa msaada zaidi."},com_error_token_balance_percent_used:{english:"You have used {0}% of your allotted tokens. Please contact {1} for further assistance.",translated:"Umetumia {0}% ya tokeni ulizopewa. Tafadhali wasiliana na {1} kwa msaada zaidi."},com_error_license_expired:{english:"Your License is not available. Please contact support for further assistance.",translated:"Leseni yako haipatikani. Tafadhali wasiliana na msaada kwa msaada zaidi."},com_restricted_invalid_ip_format:{english:"IPv6 addresses are not supported. Please use an IPv4 connection or contact support for further assistance.",translated:"Anwani za IPv6 hazitambuliwi. Tafadhali tumia muunganisho wa IPv4 au wasiliana na msaada kwa msaada zaidi."},com_error_tool_run:{english:"An error occurred while processing your request. Please try again.",translated:"Hitilafu imetokea wakati wa kushughulikia ombi lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena."},com_files_upload_duplicate_success:{english:"File {0} was already uploaded successfully",translated:"Faili {0} tayari ilipakiwa kwa mafanikio"},com_files_no_results:{english:"No results.",translated:"Hakuna matokeo."},com_files_filter:{english:"Search files by name",translated:"Tafuta faili kwa jina"},com_files_number_selected:{english:"{0} of {1} file(s) selected",translated:"{0} ya {1} faili zimechaguliwa"},com_sidepanel_select_assistant:{english:"Select an Assistant",translated:"Chagua Msaidizi"},com_sidepanel_parameters:{english:"Parameters",translated:"Vigezo"},com_ui_create_assistant:{english:"Create Assistant",translated:"Unda Msaidizi"},com_ui_create_assistant_permission_needed:{english:"User needs create permissions to create an Assistant",translated:"Mtumiaji anahitaji ruhusa za kuunda ili kuunda Msaidizi"},com_sidepanel_assistant_builder:{english:"Assistants",translated:"Wasidizi"},com_sidepanel_attach_files:{english:"File Manager",translated:"Meneja wa Faili"},com_sidepanel_manage_files:{english:"Manage Files",translated:"Dhibiti Faili"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_title:{english:"Consent",translated:"Idhini"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_1:{english:"You are about to share this assistant with other team members. Before sharing this assistant, please review the key points below:",translated:"Unakaribia kushiriki msaidizi huyu na wanachama wengine wa timu. Kabla ya kushiriki msaidizi huyu, tafadhali kagua mambo muhimu hapa chini:"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_2:{english:"By proceeding, you confirm that you understand and accept these terms.",translated:"Kwa kuendelea, unathibitisha kuwa unaelewa na kukubali masharti haya."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_1:{english:"Shared assistant should not contain sensitive or confidential data.",translated:"Msaidizi anayeshirikiwa hapaswi kuwa na data nyeti au ya siri."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_2:{english:"Shared assistants must not process sensitive or confidential data.",translated:"Msaidizi anayeshirikiwa hapaswi kuchakata data nyeti au ya siri."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_3:{english:"Sharing implies accountability and responsibility for the content and access.",translated:"Kushiriki kunamaanisha uwajibikaji na jukumu kwa maudhui na ufikiaji."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_4:{english:" It is recommended to share with a specific team or closed group instead of everyone.",translated:"Inashauriwa kushiriki na timu maalum au kikundi kilichofungwa badala ya kila mtu."},com_button_accept:{english:"Accept",translated:"Kubali"},com_button_decline:{english:"Decline",translated:"Kataa"},com_assistants_capabilities:{english:"Knowledgebase",translated:"Msingi wa Maarifa"},com_assistants_file_search:{english:"File Search",translated:"Utafutaji wa Faili"},com_assistants_file_search_description:{english:"Add files you need your assistant to search from when responding to questions in chat.",translated:"Ongeza hapa faili unazohitaji msaidizi wako kutafuta wakati wa kujibu maswali kwenye mazungumzo."},com_assistants_file_search_supported_label:{english:"Supported:",translated:"Inayoungwa mkono:"},com_assistants_file_search_supported:{english:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts.",translated:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts."},com_assistants_file_search_tips_label:{english:"Tip:",translated:"Kidokezo:"},com_assistants_file_search_tips:{english:"Ask your assistant to use the 'File Search Tool' every time it responds to users.",translated:"Muulize msaidizi wako kutumia 'Zana ya Utafutaji wa Faili' kila wakati anapojibu watumiaji."},com_assistants_file_search_info:{english:"Attaching vector stores for File Search is not yet supported. You can attach them from the Provider Playground or attach files to messages for file search on a thread basis.",translated:"Kuambatisha maduka ya vekta kwa Utafutaji wa Faili bado hakijaungwa mkono. Unaweza kuyaambatisha kutoka kwenye Uwanja wa Mtoa Huduma au ambatisha faili kwenye ujumbe kwa utafutaji wa faili kwa msingi wa uzi."},com_assistants_file_search_fetch_error:{english:"Something went wrong when fetching files from the vector stores.",translated:"Kuna tatizo lilitokea wakati wa kufetch faili kutoka kwenye maduka ya vekta."},com_assistants_knowledge:{english:"Knowledgebase",translated:"Msingi wa Maarifa"},com_assistants_knowledge_info:{english:"Upload files to your assistant, so it can use them to answer questions (i.e. CXNGPT User Guide)",translated:"Pakia faili kwa msaidizi wako, ili aweze kuzitumia kujibu maswali (mfano: Mwongozo wa Mtumiaji wa CXNGPT)"},com_assistants_knowledge_disabled:{english:"Click Create to save your Assistant, then upload your files, and click Save.",translated:"Bonyeza Unda kuhifadhi Msaidizi wako, kisha pakia faili zako, na bonyeza Hifadhi."},com_assistants_image_vision:{english:"Image Vision",translated:"Maono ya Picha"},com_assistants_code_interpreter:{english:"Code Interpreter",translated:"Mfasiri wa Nambari"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_description:{english:"Add files you need your assistant to use to analyze or transform data for every chat.",translated:"Ongeza hapa faili unazohitaji msaidizi wako kutumia kuchambua au kubadilisha data kwa kila mazungumzo."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported_label:{english:"Supported:",translated:"Inayoungwa mkono:"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported:{english:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts, csv, jpeg, jpg, gif, png, tar, xlsx, xml, zip.",translated:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts, csv, jpeg, jpg, gif, png, tar, xlsx, xml, zip."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips_label:{english:"Tips:",translated:"Vidokezo:"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips:{english:"Ask your assistant to use the 'Code Interpreter Tool' every time it responds to users.",translated:"Muulize msaidizi wako kutumia 'Zana ya Mfasiri wa Nambari' kila wakati anapojibu watumiaji."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_files_counter:{english:"{0} of {1} files uploaded",translated:"{0} kati ya {1} faili zimepakiwa"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_files:{english:"The following files are only available for Code Interpreter:",translated:"Faili zifuatazo zinapatikana tu kwa Code Interpreter:"},com_assistants_retrieval:{english:"Retrieval",translated:"Upataji"},com_assistants_search_name:{english:"Search assistants by name",translated:"Tafuta wasaidizi kwa jina"},com_assistants_tools:{english:"Tools",translated:"Zana"},com_assistants_actions:{english:"Actions",translated:"Vitendo"},com_assistants_add_tools:{english:"Add Tools",translated:"Ongeza Zana"},com_assistants_add_actions:{english:"Add Actions",translated:"Ongeza Vitendo"},com_assistants_non_retrieval_model:{english:"File search is not enabled on this model. Please select another model.",translated:"Utafutaji wa faili haujawezeshwa kwenye mfano huu. Tafadhali chagua mfano mwingine."},com_assistants_available_actions:{english:"Available Actions",translated:"Vitendo Vinavyopatikana"},com_assistants_running_action:{english:"Running action",translated:"Inakimbia kitendo"},com_assistants_completed_action:{english:"Talked to {0}",translated:"Aliongea na {0}"},com_assistants_completed_function:{english:"Ran {0}",translated:"Imeendesha {0}"},com_assistants_completed_with_file_search:{english:"Used File Search",translated:"Imetumia Utafutaji wa Faili"},com_assistants_function_use:{english:"Assistant used {0}",translated:"Msaidizi alitumia {0}"},com_assistants_function_browsewbsite_error_100:{english:"[error processing tool] Failed to fetch the contents of the given website. [100]",translated:"[kosa la kuchakata zana] Imeshindwa kupata maudhui ya tovuti iliyotolewa. [100]"},com_assistants_function_browsewbsite_error_101:{english:"[error processing tool] Failed to fetch the contents of the given website. [101]",translated:"[kosa la kuchakata zana] Imeshindwa kupata maudhui ya tovuti iliyotolewa. [101]"},com_assistants_domain_info:{english:"Assistant sent this info to {0}",translated:"Msaidizi alituma taarifa hii kwa {0}"},com_assistants_delete_permission_title:{english:"Deleting only allowed with private Assistants",translated:"Kufuta kunaruhusiwa tu kwa Wasaidizi wa kibinafsi"},com_assistants_delete_actions_success:{english:"Successfully deleted Action from Assistant",translated:"Kitendo kimefutwa kwa mafanikio kutoka kwa Msaidizi"},com_assistants_update_actions_success:{english:"Successfully created or updated Action",translated:"Imefanikiwa kuunda au kusasisha Kitendo"},com_assistants_update_actions_error:{english:"There was an error creating or updating the action.",translated:"Kulikuwa na kosa katika kuunda au kusasisha kitendo."},com_assistants_delete_actions_error:{english:"There was an error deleting the action.",translated:"Kulikuwa na kosa katika kufuta kitendo."},com_assistants_actions_info:{english:"Let your Assistant retrieve information or take actions via API's",translated:"Mruhusu Msaidizi wako kupata taarifa au kuchukua hatua kupitia API's"},com_assistants_name_placeholder:{english:"Name your assistant (i.e. Email Generator)",translated:"Mpe jina msaidizi wako (mf. Mzalishaji wa Barua Pepe)"},com_assistants_instructions_placeholder:{english:"Provide your assistant with specific, detailed, comprehensive guidelines to direct its behavior (i.e. Goal, Role, Actions, Audience, Style, Rules, Task, Template, Example)",translated:"Toa mwongozo maalum, wa kina, wa kuelekeza tabia ya msaidizi wako (mfano. Lengo, Jukumu, Hatua, Hadhira, Mtindo, Sheria, Kazi, Kiolezo, Mfano)"},com_assistants_description_placeholder:{english:"Describe concisely what your assistant can do (i.e. Generate emails from template)",translated:"Eleza kwa ufupi kile msaidizi wako anaweza kufanya (mfano. Tengeneza barua pepe kutoka kwa kiolezo)"},com_assistants_actions_disabled:{english:"You need to create an assistant before adding actions.",translated:"Unahitaji kuunda msaidizi kabla ya kuongeza vitendo."},com_assistants_update_success:{english:"Successfully updated",translated:"Imefanikiwa kusasishwa"},com_assistants_update_error:{english:"There was an error updating your assistant.",translated:"Kulikuwa na hitilafu katika kusasisha msaidizi wako."},com_assistants_create_success:{english:"Successfully created",translated:"Imefanikiwa kuundwa"},com_assistants_create_error:{english:"There was an error creating your assistant.",translated:"Kulikuwa na hitilafu katika kuunda msaidizi wako."},com_assistants_loading:{english:"Loading assistants...",translated:"Inapakia wasaidizi..."},com_assistants_pii_redaction_reason_required:{english:"Please provide a reason for enabling PII.",translated:"Tafadhali toa sababu ya kuwezesha PII."},com_assistants_settings_and_privacy:{english:"Settings & Privacy",translated:"Mipangilio & Faragha"},com_assistants_pii_redaction:{english:"PII Redaction",translated:"Ufutaji wa PII"},com_assistants_pii_redaction_enabled_info:{english:"PII redaction is enabled for this assistant's model calls by default.",translated:"Ufutaji wa PII umewezeshwa kwa simu za modeli za msaidizi huyu kwa chaguo-msingi."},com_assistants_pii_redaction_disabled_info:{english:"Allowing PII disables redaction for this assistant’s model calls. You are responsible for complying with your organization’s data policies. Activity is fully logged and monitored.",translated:"Kuruhusu PII kunalemaza ufutaji kwa simu za modeli za msaidizi huyu. Unawajibika kwa kufuata sera za data za shirika lako. Shughuli zote zinarekodiwa na kufuatiliwa."},com_assistants_pii_redaction_off_reason_placeholder:{english:"Please explain your reason for enabling PII (required).",translated:"Tafadhali eleza sababu yako ya kuwezesha PII (inahitajika)."},com_ui_min_length_error:{english:"Minimum length is {0} characters.",translated:"Urefu wa chini ni herufi {0}."},com_ui_max_length_error:{english:"Maximum length is {0} characters.",translated:"Urefu wa juu ni herufi {0}."},com_ui_date_today:{english:"Today",translated:"Leo"},com_ui_date_yesterday:{english:"Yesterday",translated:"Jana"},com_ui_date_previous_7_days:{english:"Previous 7 days",translated:"Siku 7 zilizopita"},com_ui_date_previous_30_days:{english:"Previous 30 days",translated:"Siku 30 zilizopita"},com_ui_date_january:{english:"January",translated:"Januari"},com_ui_date_february:{english:"February",translated:"Februari"},com_ui_date_march:{english:"March",translated:"Machi"},com_ui_date_april:{english:"April",translated:"Aprili"},com_ui_date_may:{english:"May",translated:"Mei"},com_ui_date_june:{english:"June",translated:"Juni"},com_ui_date_july:{english:"July",translated:"Julai"},com_ui_date_august:{english:"August",translated:"Agosti"},com_ui_date_september:{english:"September",translated:"Septemba"},com_ui_date_october:{english:"October",translated:"Oktoba"},com_ui_date_november:{english:"November",translated:"Novemba"},com_ui_date_december:{english:"December",translated:"Desemba"},com_ui_field_required:{english:"This field is required",translated:"Sehemu hii inahitajika"},com_ui_download_error:{english:"Error downloading file. The file may have been deleted.",translated:"Hitilafu katika kupakua faili. Faili inaweza kuwa imefutwa."},com_ui_attach_error_type:{english:"Unsupported file type for endpoint:",translated:"Aina ya faili isiyoungwa mkono kwa mwisho:"},com_ui_attach_error_openai:{english:"Cannot attach Assistant files to other endpoints",translated:"Haiwezi kuambatisha faili za Msaidizi kwa miisho mingine"},com_ui_attach_error_size:{english:"File size limit exceeded for endpoint:",translated:"Kikomo cha ukubwa wa faili kimezidi kwa mwisho:"},com_ui_attach_error:{english:"Cannot attach file. Create or select a conversation, or try refreshing the page.",translated:"Haiwezi kuambatisha faili. Unda au chagua mazungumzo, au jaribu kuburudisha ukurasa."},com_ui_examples:{english:"Examples",translated:"Mifano"},com_ui_new_chat:{english:"New chat",translated:"Mazungumzo mapya"},com_ui_conversations:{english:"Chats",translated:"Mazungumzo"},com_ui_conversations_placeholder:{english:"Start a conversation...",translated:"Anza mazungumzo..."},com_ui_new_conversation:{english:"New Chat",translated:"Mazungumzo Mapya"},com_ui_assistant_library:{english:"Assistant Library",translated:"Maktaba ya Msaidizi"},com_ui_kbot_assistants:{english:"Knowledge",translated:"Maarifa"},com_ui_assistant_search:{english:"Search for an assistant",translated:"Tafuta msaidizi"},com_ui_assistant_default_category:{english:"General",translated:"Jumla"},com_ui_assistant_featured:{english:"Featured",translated:"Inayopendekezwa"},com_ui_assistant_no_matches:{english:"No assistants match the search criteria.",translated:"Hakuna wasaidizi wanaolingana na vigezo vya utafutaji."},com_ui_assistant_empty_results:{english:"No assistants found.",translated:"Hakuna wasaidizi waliopatikana."},com_ui_example_quantum_computing:{english:"Explain quantum computing in simple terms",translated:"Eleza kompyuta ya quantum kwa maneno rahisi"},com_ui_example_10_year_old_b_day:{english:"Got any creative ideas for a 10 year old's birthday?",translated:"Una mawazo ya ubunifu kwa siku ya kuzaliwa ya mtoto wa miaka 10?"},com_ui_example_http_in_js:{english:"How do I make an HTTP request in Javascript?",translated:"Ninawezaje kufanya ombi la HTTP katika Javascript?"},com_ui_category_placeholder:{english:"Search a category",translated:"Tafuta kategoria"},com_ui_tool_placeholder:{english:"Search a tool",translated:"Tafuta zana"},com_ui_capabilities:{english:"Capabilities",translated:"Uwezo"},com_ui_capability_remember:{english:"Remembers what user said earlier in the conversation",translated:"Hukumbuka kile mtumiaji alisema awali katika mazungumzo"},com_ui_capability_correction:{english:"Allows user to provide follow-up corrections",translated:"Inaruhusu mtumiaji kutoa marekebisho ya kufuatilia"},com_ui_capability_decline_requests:{english:"Trained to decline inappropriate requests",translated:"Imefundishwa kukataa maombi yasiyofaa"},com_ui_limitations:{english:"Limitations",translated:"Mapungufu"},com_ui_limitation_incorrect_info:{english:"May occasionally generate incorrect information",translated:"Inaweza kutoa taarifa zisizo sahihi mara kwa mara"},com_ui_limitation_harmful_biased:{english:"May occasionally produce harmful instructions or biased content",translated:"Inaweza kutoa maagizo yenye madhara au yaliyopendelea mara kwa mara"},com_ui_limitation_limited_2021:{english:"Limited knowledge of world and events after 2021",translated:"Ujuzi mdogo wa dunia na matukio baada ya 2021"},com_ui_on:{english:"On",translated:"Washa"},com_ui_off:{english:"Off",translated:"Zima"},com_ui_yes:{english:"Yes",translated:"Ndio"},com_ui_no:{english:"No",translated:"Hapana"},com_ui_ascending:{english:"Asc",translated:"Kupanda"},com_ui_descending:{english:"Desc",translated:"Kushuka"},com_ui_show_all:{english:"Show All",translated:"Onyesha Yote"},com_ui_name:{english:"Name",translated:"Jina"},com_ui_date:{english:"Date",translated:"Tarehe"},com_ui_storage:{english:"Storage",translated:"Hifadhi"},com_ui_context:{english:"Context",translated:"Muktadha"},com_ui_size:{english:"Size",translated:"Ukubwa"},com_ui_host:{english:"Host",translated:"Mwenyeji"},com_ui_update:{english:"Update",translated:"Sasisha"},com_ui_authentication:{english:"Authentication",translated:"Uthibitishaji"},com_ui_instructions:{english:"Instructions",translated:"Maelekezo"},com_ui_description:{english:"Description",translated:"Maelezo"},com_ui_category:{english:"Category",translated:"Kategoria"},com_ui_category_tooltip:{english:"Assign a business category to help filter and organize assistants by function.",translated:"Weka kategoria ya biashara kusaidia kuchuja na kupanga wasaidizi kwa kazi."},com_ui_error:{english:"Error",translated:"Hitilafu"},com_ui_error_connection:{english:"Error connecting to server, try refreshing the page.",translated:"Hitilafu ya kuunganisha na seva, jaribu kuburudisha ukurasa."},com_ui_select:{english:"Select",translated:"Chagua"},com_ui_select_placeholder:{english:"Select options",translated:"Chagua chaguo"},com_ui_remove:{english:"Remove",translated:"Ondoa"},com_ui_input:{english:"Input",translated:"Ingizo"},com_ui_close:{english:"Close",translated:"Funga"},com_ui_model:{english:"Model",translated:"Mfano"},com_ui_name_empty_error:{english:"The assistant name field cannot be empty. Please enter a valid name.",translated:"Sehemu ya jina la msaidizi haiwezi kuwa tupu. Tafadhali ingiza jina sahihi."},com_ui_smart_prefix_error:{english:"Smart Prefix was used for General Assistants, Please use a different name.",translated:"Kiambishi Smart kilitumika kwa Wasaidizi wa Jumla, Tafadhali tumia jina tofauti."},com_ui_description_empty_error:{english:"The description field cannot be empty. Please enter a valid description.",translated:"Sehemu ya maelezo haiwezi kuwa tupu. Tafadhali ingiza maelezo sahihi."},com_ui_instructions_empty_error:{english:"The instructions field cannot be empty. Please enter valid instructions.",translated:"Sehemu ya maelekezo haiwezi kuwa tupu. Tafadhali ingiza maelekezo sahihi."},com_ui_category_empty_error:{english:"The category field cannot be empty. Please select a category.",translated:"Sehemu ya kategoria haiwezi kuwa tupu. Tafadhali chagua kategoria."},com_ui_duplicate_assistant_error:{english:"A duplicate assistant name has been detected. Please choose a unique name.",translated:"Jina la msaidizi linalofanana limegunduliwa. Tafadhali chagua jina la kipekee."},com_ui_shared_with_empty_error:{english:"The shared with field cannot be empty. Please select a shared with option.",translated:"Sehemu ya kushiriki na haiwezi kuwa tupu. Tafadhali chagua chaguo la kushiriki na."},com_ui_shared_with:{english:"Shared With",translated:"Imeshirikiwa Na"},com_ui_shared_with_tooltip_1:{english:"Private – Only you can access and view this assistant.",translated:"Binafsi – Ni wewe tu unaweza kufikia na kuona msaidizi huyu."},com_ui_shared_with_tooltip_2:{english:"Share only with Team – This assistant will be visible and accessible to your team members.",translated:"Shiriki tu na Timu – Msaidizi huyu utaonekana na kupatikana kwa wanachama wa timu yako."},com_ui_shared_with_team:{english:"Team",translated:"Timu"},com_ui_shared_with_team_tooltip:{english:"Select the team this assistant belongs to. Only teams you are a member of will appear here.",translated:"Chagua timu ambayo msaidizi huyu anahusiana nayo. Ni timu ambazo wewe ni mwanachama pekee zitaonekana hapa."},com_ui_shared_with_team_empty_error:{english:"The team field cannot be empty. Please select a team.",translated:"Sehemu ya timu haiwezi kuwa tupu. Tafadhali chagua timu."},com_assistants_team_shared_locked:{english:"This assistant is locked for editing because it is team-shared.",translated:"Msaidizi huyu amefungwa kwa uhariri kwa sababu anashirikiwa na timu."},com_ui_share_retrieve_error:{english:"Error loading shared links.",translated:"Hitilafu katika kupakia viungo vilivyoshirikiwa."},com_ui_name_profanity_error:{english:"Your Assistant name contains offensive words and could not be sent. Please update your Assistant name.",translated:"Jina la Msaidizi wako lina maneno ya matusi na haliwezi kutumwa. Tafadhali sasisha jina la Msaidizi wako."},com_ui_description_profanity_error:{english:"Your Description contains offensive words and could not be sent. Please update your Description.",translated:"Maelezo yako yana maneno ya matusi na hayawezi kutumwa. Tafadhali sasisha Maelezo yako."},com_ui_instructions_profanity_error:{english:"Your Instructions contains offensive words and could not be sent. Please update your Instructions.",translated:"Maelekezo yako yana maneno ya matusi na hayawezi kutumwa. Tafadhali sasisha Maelekezo yako."},com_ui_select_search_model:{english:"Search model by name",translated:"Tafuta mfano kwa jina"},com_ui_select_search_plugin:{english:"Search plugin by name",translated:"Tafuta programu-jalizi kwa jina"},com_ui_use_prompt:{english:"Use prompt",translated:"Tumia mwongozo"},com_ui_prev:{english:"Prev",translated:"Iliyopita"},com_ui_next:{english:"Next",translated:"Inayofuata"},com_ui_stop:{english:"Stop",translated:"Acha"},com_ui_upload_files:{english:"Upload files",translated:"Pakia faili"},com_ui_prompt_templates:{english:"Prompt Templates",translated:"Violezo vya Mwongozo"},com_ui_hide_prompt_templates:{english:"Hide Prompt Templates",translated:"Ficha Violezo vya Mwongozo"},com_ui_showing:{english:"Showing",translated:"Inaonyesha"},com_ui_of:{english:"of",translated:"ya"},com_ui_entries:{english:"Entries",translated:"Kumbukumbu"},com_ui_none_selected:{english:"None selected",translated:"Hakuna iliyochaguliwa"},com_ui_upload_success:{english:"Successfully uploaded file",translated:"Faili imepakiwa kwa mafanikio"},com_ui_upload_error:{english:"There was an error uploading your file",translated:"Kulikuwa na hitilafu katika kupakia faili yako"},com_ui_upload_invalid:{english:"Invalid file for upload. Must be an image not exceeding 2 MB",translated:"Faili batili kwa kupakia. Lazima iwe picha isiyozidi 2 MB"},com_ui_thinking:{english:"Thinking",translated:"Inafikiria"},com_ui_analyzing_request:{english:"Understanding your question",translated:"Inachambua ombi lako"},com_ui_processing:{english:"Putting it together",translated:"Inachakata"},com_ui_working_on_it:{english:"Almost ready",translated:"Inashughulikia"},com_ui_cancel:{english:"Cancel",translated:"Ghairi"},com_ui_save:{english:"Save",translated:"Hifadhi"},com_user_message:{english:"You",translated:"Wewe"},com_ui_read_aloud:{english:"Read aloud",translated:"Soma kwa sauti"},com_ui_copied:{english:"Copied!",translated:"Imenakiliwa!"},com_ui_copy_code:{english:"Copy code",translated:"Nakili msimbo"},com_ui_copy_to_clipboard:{english:"Copy to clipboard",translated:"Nakili kwenye ubao wa kunakili"},com_ui_copied_to_clipboard:{english:"Copied to clipboard",translated:"Imenakiliwa kwenye ubao wa kunakili"},com_ui_mention:{english:"Mention an endpoint, assistant, or preset to quickly switch to it",translated:"Taja mwisho, msaidizi, au kigezo ili kubadili haraka"},com_ui_regenerate:{english:"Regenerate",translated:"Tengeneza tena"},com_ui_edit:{english:"Edit",translated:"Hariri"},com_ui_all:{english:"all",translated:"yote"},com_ui_clear:{english:"Clear",translated:"Futa"},com_ui_import_conversation:{english:"Import",translated:"Ingiza"},com_ui_nothing_found:{english:"Nothing found",translated:"Hakuna kilichopatikana"},com_ui_go_to_conversation:{english:"Go to conversation",translated:"Nenda kwenye mazungumzo"},com_ui_import_conversation_info:{english:"Import conversations from a JSON file",translated:"Ingiza mazungumzo kutoka faili ya JSON"},com_ui_import_conversation_success:{english:"Conversations imported successfully",translated:"Mazungumzo yameingizwa kwa mafanikio"},com_ui_import_conversation_error:{english:"There was an error importing your conversations",translated:"Kulikuwa na hitilafu katika kuingiza mazungumzo yako"},com_ui_import_conversation_file_type_error:{english:"Unsupported import type",translated:"Aina ya uingizaji haijaungwa mkono"},com_ui_confirm_action:{english:"Confirm Action",translated:"Thibitisha Kitendo"},com_ui_avatar:{english:"Avatar",translated:"Avatar"},com_ui_unknown:{english:"Unknown",translated:"Haijulikani"},com_ui_result:{english:"Result",translated:"Matokeo"},com_ui_image_gen:{english:"Image Gen",translated:"Picha Gen"},com_ui_assistant:{english:"Assistant",translated:"Msaidizi"},com_ui_assistant_deleted:{english:"Successfully deleted assistant",translated:"Msaidizi umefutwa kwa mafanikio"},com_ui_assistant_delete_error:{english:"There was an error deleting the assistant",translated:"Kulikuwa na hitilafu katika kufuta msaidizi"},com_ui_assistant_duplicate_file_upload:{english:"Duplicate file detected.",translated:"Faili rudufu imegunduliwa."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_error:{english:"An error occurred while uploading the file.",translated:"Hitilafu ilitokea wakati wa kupakia faili."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_endpoint_undefined:{english:"An error occurred while uploading the file: Endpoint is undefined",translated:"Hitilafu ilitokea wakati wa kupakia faili: Endpoint haijafafanuliwa"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_not_empty:{english:"Empty files are not allowed.",translated:"Faili tupu haziruhusiwi."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_count_error:{english:"You can only upload up to {0} files at a time.",translated:"Unaweza kupakia hadi faili {0} kwa wakati mmoja."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_section_count_error:{english:"You can only upload up to {0} files in this section.",translated:"Unaweza kupakia hadi faili {0} katika sehemu hii."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_section_response_error:{english:"The upload limit has been reached for {0}",translated:"Kikomo cha upakiaji kimefikiwa kwa {0}"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_type_unknown:{english:"Unable to determine file type for: {0}",translated:"Haiwezekani kubaini aina ya faili kwa: {0}"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_unsupported_type:{english:"File type not supported. Please upload a supported file format.",translated:"Aina ya faili haijaungwa mkono. Tafadhali pakia umbizo la faili linaloungwa mkono."},com_ui_assistant_image_failed_load:{english:"Failed to load image",translated:"Imeshindwa kupakia picha"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_supported_type:{english:"Currently, only JPEG, JPG, PNG, and WEBP files are supported.",translated:"Hivi sasa, faili za JPEG, JPG, PNG, na WEBP pekee ndizo zinazoungwa mkono."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_size_limit:{english:"File size exceeds {0} MB.",translated:"Ukubwa wa faili unazidi {0} MB."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_total_size_limit:{english:"The total size of the files cannot exceed {0} MB.",translated:"Jumla ya ukubwa wa faili haziwezi kuzidi {0} MB."},com_ui_assistant_file_validation_error:{english:"An error occurred while validating the file.",translated:"Hitilafu ilitokea wakati wa kuthibitisha faili."},com_ui_assistant_file_processing_error:{english:"An error occurred while processing the file.",translated:"Hitilafu ilitokea wakati wa kuchakata faili."},com_ui_assistants:{english:"Assistants",translated:"Wasidizi"},com_ui_assistants_category_ix_customer:{english:"Studio Assistance",translated:"Msaada wa Studio"},com_ui_assistants_category_kbot:{english:"Knowledge",translated:"Maarifa"},com_ui_assistants_uncategorized:{english:"Uncategorized",translated:"Haijapangwa"},com_ui_attachment:{english:"Attachment",translated:"Kiambatisho"},com_ui_assistants_output:{english:"Assistants Output",translated:"Matokeo ya Wasaidizi"},com_ui_delete:{english:"Delete",translated:"Futa"},com_ui_create:{english:"Create",translated:"Unda"},com_ui_share:{english:"Share",translated:"Shiriki"},com_ui_copy_link:{english:"Copy link",translated:"Nakili kiungo"},com_ui_update_link:{english:"Update link",translated:"Sasisha kiungo"},com_ui_create_link:{english:"Create link",translated:"Unda kiungo"},com_ui_share_link_to_chat:{english:"Share link to chat",translated:"Shiriki kiungo kwenye gumzo"},com_ui_share_error:{english:"There was an error sharing the chat link",translated:"Kulikuwa na hitilafu katika kushiriki kiungo cha gumzo"},com_ui_share_create_message:{english:"Your name and any messages you add after sharing stay private.",translated:"Jina lako na ujumbe wowote unaoongeza baada ya kushiriki hubaki faragha."},com_ui_share_created_message:{english:"A public link to your chat has been created. Manage previously shared chats at any time via Settings.",translated:"Kiungo cha umma kwa gumzo lako kimeundwa. Dhibiti gumzo zilizoshirikiwa awali wakati wowote kupitia Mipangilio."},com_ui_share_update_message:{english:"Your name, custom instructions, and any messages you add after sharing stay private.",translated:"Jina lako, maelekezo maalum, na ujumbe wowote unaoongeza baada ya kushiriki hubaki faragha."},com_ui_share_updated_message:{english:"A public link to your chat has been updated. Manage previously shared chats at any time via Settings.",translated:"Kiungo cha umma kwa gumzo lako kimesasishwa. Dhibiti gumzo zilizoshirikiwa awali wakati wowote kupitia Mipangilio."},com_ui_shared_link_not_found:{english:"Shared link not found",translated:"Kiungo kilichoshirikiwa hakijapatikana"},com_ui_delete_conversation:{english:"Delete chat?",translated:"Futa gumzo?"},com_ui_delete_conversation_confirm:{english:"This will delete",translated:"Hii itafuta"},com_ui_delete_assistant_confirm:{english:"Are you sure you want to delete this Assistant? This cannot be undone.",translated:"Una uhakika unataka kufuta Msaidizi huyu? Hii haiwezi kubatilishwa."},com_ui_rename:{english:"Rename",translated:"Badilisha jina"},com_ui_more_options:{english:"More",translated:"Zaidi"},com_ui_preview:{english:"Preview",translated:"Onyesha awali"},com_ui_upload:{english:"Upload",translated:"Pakia"},com_ui_upload_delay:{english:'Uploading "{0}" is taking more time than anticipated. Please wait while the file finishes indexing for retrieval.',translated:'Kupakia "{0}" kunachukua muda zaidi ya ilivyotarajiwa. Tafadhali subiri faili ikamilishe kuorodheshwa kwa urejeshaji.'},com_ui_privacy_policy:{english:"Privacy policy",translated:"Sera ya faragha"},com_ui_terms_of_service:{english:"Terms of service",translated:"Masharti ya huduma"},com_ui_use_micrphone:{english:"Use microphone",translated:"Tumia kipaza sauti"},com_ui_min_tags:{english:"Cannot remove more values, a minimum of {0} are required.",translated:"Huwezi kuondoa zaidi, kiwango cha chini ni {0}."},com_ui_max_tags:{english:"Maximum number allowed is {0}, using latest values.",translated:"Idadi ya juu inayoruhusiwa ni {0}, ukitumia thamani za hivi karibuni."},com_auth_error_login:{english:"Unable to login with the information provided. Please check your credentials and try again.",translated:"Imeshindikana kuingia na taarifa ulizotoa. Tafadhali angalia maelezo yako na ujaribu tena."},com_auth_error_login_rl:{english:"You have exceeded the number of allowed login attempts. Please try again in 15 minutes.",translated:"Umezidi idadi ya majaribio ya kuingia. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika 15."},com_auth_error_login_ban:{english:"Your account has been temporarily banned due to violations of our service.",translated:"Akaunti yako imezuiwa kwa muda kutokana na uvunjaji wa huduma zetu."},com_auth_error_login_server:{english:"There was an internal server error. Please wait a few moments and try again.",translated:"Kulikuwa na hitilafu ya seva ya ndani. Tafadhali subiri kidogo na ujaribu tena."},com_auth_sign_in:{english:"Login",translated:"Ingia"},com_endpoint_system_message:{english:"System Message",translated:"Ujumbe wa Mfumo"},com_endpoint_message:{english:"Message",translated:"Ujumbe"},com_endpoint_messages:{english:"Messages",translated:"Ujumbe"},com_endpoint_message_not_appendable:{english:"Edit your message or Regenerate.",translated:"Hariri ujumbe wako au Tengeneza upya."},com_endpoint_default_blank:{english:"default: blank",translated:"chaguo-msingi: tupu"},com_endpoint_default_false:{english:"default: false",translated:"chaguo-msingi: si kweli"},com_endpoint_default_creative:{english:"default: creative",translated:"chaguo-msingi: ubunifu"},com_endpoint_default_empty:{english:"default: empty",translated:"chaguo-msingi: tupu"},com_endpoint_default_with_num:{english:"default: {0}",translated:"chaguo-msingi: {0}"},com_endpoint_context:{english:"Context",translated:"Muktadha"},com_endpoint_tone_style:{english:"Tone Style",translated:"Mtindo wa Toni"},com_endpoint_token_count:{english:"Token count",translated:"Idadi ya alama"},com_endpoint_output:{english:"Output",translated:"Matokeo"},com_endpoint_context_tokens:{english:"Max Context Tokens",translated:"Alama za Muktadha za Juu"},com_endpoint_context_info:{english:`The maximum number of tokens that can be used for context. Use this for control of how many tokens are sent per request.
  If unspecified, will use system defaults based on known models' context size. Setting higher values may result in errors and/or higher token cost.`,translated:`Idadi ya juu ya alama zinazoweza kutumika kwa muktadha. Tumia hii kudhibiti idadi ya alama zinazotumwa kwa ombi.
  Ikiwa haijatajwa, itatumia chaguo-msingi za mfumo kulingana na ukubwa wa muktadha wa mifano inayojulikana. Kuweka thamani za juu kunaweza kusababisha hitilafu na/au gharama ya juu ya alama.`},com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_placeholder:{english:"Set custom instructions or context. Ignored if empty.",translated:"Weka maagizo au muktadha maalum. Inapuuzwa ikiwa tupu."},com_endpoint_instructions_assistants_placeholder:{english:"Overrides the instructions of the assistant. This is useful for modifying the behavior on a per-run basis.",translated:"Inabadilisha maagizo ya msaidizi. Hii ni muhimu kwa kubadilisha tabia kwa kila mzunguko."},com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_assistants_placeholder:{english:"Set additional instructions or context on top of the Assistant's main instructions. Ignored if empty.",translated:"Weka maagizo ya ziada au muktadha juu ya maagizo kuu ya Msaidizi. Inapuuzwa ikiwa tupu."},com_endpoint_custom_name:{english:"Custom Name",translated:"Jina Maalum"},com_endpoint_prompt_prefix:{english:"Custom Instructions",translated:"Maagizo Maalum"},com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_assistants:{english:"Additional Instructions",translated:"Maagizo ya Ziada"},com_endpoint_instructions_assistants:{english:"Override Instructions",translated:"Badilisha Maagizo"},com_endpoint_temperature:{english:"Temperature",translated:"Joto"},com_endpoint_default:{english:"default",translated:"chaguo-msingi"},com_endpoint_top_p:{english:"Top P",translated:"Juu P"},com_endpoint_top_k:{english:"Top K",translated:"Juu K"},com_endpoint_max_output_tokens:{english:"Max Output Tokens",translated:"Tokeni za Juu za Matokeo"},com_endpoint_stop:{english:"Stop Sequences",translated:"Mfuatano wa Kusitisha"},com_endpoint_stop_placeholder:{english:"Separate values by pressing `Enter`",translated:"Tenganisha thamani kwa kubonyeza `Enter`"},com_endpoint_openai_max_tokens:{english:"Optional `max_tokens` field, representing the maximum number of tokens that can be generated in the chat completion.\n    \n    The total length of input tokens and generated tokens is limited by the models context length. You may experience errors if this number exceeds the max context tokens.",translated:"Sehemu ya hiari ya `max_tokens`, inayowakilisha idadi ya juu ya tokeni ambazo zinaweza kuzalishwa katika kukamilisha mazungumzo.\n\nUrefu wa jumla wa tokeni za ingizo na zilizozalishwa unazuiliwa na urefu wa muktadha wa modeli. Unaweza kupata makosa ikiwa nambari hii inazidi tokeni za muktadha wa juu."},com_endpoint_openai_temp:{english:"Higher values = more random, while lower values = more focused and deterministic. We recommend altering this or Top P but not both.",translated:"Thamani za juu = nasibu zaidi, wakati thamani za chini = makini na za uhakika. Tunapendekeza kubadilisha hii au Juu P lakini si zote mbili."},com_endpoint_openai_max:{english:"The max tokens to generate. The total length of input tokens and generated tokens is limited by the model's context length.",translated:"Tokeni za juu za kuzalisha. Urefu wa jumla wa tokeni za ingizo na zilizozalishwa unazuiliwa na urefu wa muktadha wa modeli."},com_endpoint_openai_topp:{english:"An alternative to sampling with temperature, called nucleus sampling, where the model considers the results of the tokens with top_p probability mass. So 0.1 means only the tokens comprising the top 10% probability mass are considered. We recommend altering this or temperature but not both.",translated:"Njia mbadala ya sampuli na joto, inayoitwa sampuli ya nucleus, ambapo modeli inazingatia matokeo ya tokeni na uwezekano wa juu_p. Kwa hivyo 0.1 inamaanisha tokeni zinazojumuisha 10% ya juu ya uwezekano zinazingatiwa. Tunapendekeza kubadilisha hii au joto lakini si zote mbili."},com_endpoint_openai_freq:{english:"Number between 0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on their existing frequency in the text so far, decreasing the model's likelihood to repeat the same line verbatim.",translated:"Nambari kati ya 0 na 2.0. Thamani chanya zinadhibiti tokeni mpya kulingana na marudio yao katika maandishi hadi sasa, kupunguza uwezekano wa modeli kurudia mstari huo huo."},com_endpoint_openai_pres:{english:"Number between 0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on whether they appear in the text so far, increasing the model's likelihood to talk about new topics.",translated:"Nambari kati ya 0 na 2.0. Thamani chanya zinadhibiti tokeni mpya kulingana na kama zinaonekana katika maandishi hadi sasa, kuongeza uwezekano wa modeli kuzungumza juu ya mada mpya."},com_endpoint_openai_resend_files:{english:"Resend all previously attached files. Note: this will increase token cost and you may experience errors with many attachments.",translated:"Tuma tena faili zote zilizowekwa awali. Kumbuka: hii itaongeza gharama ya tokeni na unaweza kupata makosa na viambatisho vingi."},com_endpoint_openai_detail:{english:'The resolution for Vision requests. "Low" is cheaper and faster, "High" is more detailed and expensive, and "Auto" will automatically choose between the two based on the image resolution.',translated:'Azimio kwa maombi ya Maono. "Chini" ni nafuu na haraka, "Juu" ni ya kina na ghali, na "Otomatiki" itachagua moja kwa moja kati ya hizo mbili kulingana na azimio la picha.'},com_endpoint_openai_stop:{english:"Up to 4 sequences where the API will stop generating further tokens.",translated:"Hadi mfuatano 4 ambapo API itasitisha kuzalisha tokeni zaidi."},com_endpoint_openai_custom_name_placeholder:{english:"Set a custom name for iXHello",translated:"Weka jina maalum kwa iXHello"},com_endpoint_openai_prompt_prefix_placeholder:{english:"Set custom instructions to include in System Message. Default: none",translated:"Weka maagizo maalum ya kujumuisha katika Ujumbe wa Mfumo. Chaguo-msingi: hakuna"},com_endpoint_frequency_penalty:{english:"Frequency Penalty",translated:"Adhabu ya Marudio"},com_endpoint_presence_penalty:{english:"Presence Penalty",translated:"Adhabu ya Uwepo"},com_endpoint_plug_use_functions:{english:"Use Functions",translated:"Tumia Kazi"},com_endpoint_plug_resend_files:{english:"Resend Files",translated:"Tuma Faili Tena"},com_endpoint_plug_image_detail:{english:"Image Detail",translated:"Maelezo ya Picha"},com_endpoint_plug_skip_completion:{english:"Skip Completion",translated:"Ruka Kukamilisha"},com_endpoint_plug_set_custom_instructions_for_gpt_placeholder:{english:"Set custom instructions to include in System Message. Default: none",translated:"Weka maagizo maalum ya kujumuisha katika Ujumbe wa Mfumo. Chaguo-msingi: hakuna"},com_endpoint_import:{english:"Import",translated:"Ingiza"},com_endpoint_set_custom_name:{english:"Set a custom name, in case you can find this preset",translated:"Weka jina maalum, endapo unaweza kupata kiolezo hiki"},com_endpoint_preset_delete_confirm:{english:"Are you sure you want to delete this preset?",translated:"Una uhakika unataka kufuta kiolezo hiki?"},com_endpoint_preset_import:{english:"Preset Imported!",translated:"Kiolezo Kimeingizwa!"},com_endpoint_preset_import_error:{english:"There was an error importing your preset. Please try again.",translated:"Kulikuwa na hitilafu katika kuingiza kiolezo chako. Tafadhali jaribu tena."},com_endpoint_preset_save_error:{english:"There was an error saving your preset. Please try again.",translated:"Kulikuwa na hitilafu katika kuhifadhi kiolezo chako. Tafadhali jaribu tena."},com_endpoint_preset_delete_error:{english:"There was an error deleting your preset. Please try again.",translated:"Kulikuwa na hitilafu katika kufuta kiolezo chako. Tafadhali jaribu tena."},com_endpoint_preset_default_removed:{english:"is no longer the default preset.",translated:"sio kiolezo chaguo-msingi tena."},com_endpoint_preset_default_item:{english:"Default:",translated:"Chaguo-msingi:"},com_endpoint_preset_default_none:{english:"No default preset active.",translated:"Hakuna kiolezo chaguo-msingi kinachotumika."},com_endpoint_preset_title:{english:"Preset",translated:"Kiolezo"},com_endpoint_preset_saved:{english:"Saved!",translated:"Imehifadhiwa!"},com_endpoint_preset_default:{english:"is now the default preset.",translated:"sasa ni kiolezo chaguo-msingi."},com_endpoint_preset:{english:"preset",translated:"kiolezo"},com_endpoint_presets:{english:"presets",translated:"vielelezo"},com_endpoint_preset_selected_title:{english:"Active!",translated:"Kinachotumika!"},com_endpoint_preset_name:{english:"Preset Name",translated:"Jina la Kiolezo"},com_endpoint:{english:"Endpoint",translated:"Mwisho"},com_endpoint_examples:{english:" Presets",translated:"Vielelezo"},com_endpoint_export:{english:"Export",translated:"Hamisha"},com_endpoint_export_share:{english:"Export/Share",translated:"Hamisha/Shiriki"},com_endpoint_assistant:{english:"Assistant",translated:"Msaidizi"},com_endpoint_use_active_assistant:{english:"Use Active Assistant",translated:"Tumia Msaidizi Anayefanya Kazi"},com_endpoint_save_as_preset:{english:"Save As Preset",translated:"Hifadhi Kama Kiolezo"},com_endpoint_presets_clear_warning:{english:"Are you sure you want to clear all presets? This is irreversible.",translated:"Una uhakika unataka kufuta violezo vyote? Hii haiwezi kubadilishwa."},com_endpoint_no_presets:{english:"No presets yet, use the settings button to create one",translated:"Hakuna violezo bado, tumia kitufe cha mipangilio kuunda moja"},com_endpoint_my_preset:{english:"My Preset",translated:"Kiolezo Changu"},com_endpoint_agent_model:{english:"Agent Model (Recommended: GPT-3.5)",translated:"Mfano wa Wakala (Inapendekezwa: GPT-3.5)"},com_endpoint_completion_model:{english:"Completion Model (Recommended: GPT-4)",translated:"Mfano wa Kukamilisha (Inapendekezwa: GPT-4)"},com_endpoint_func_hover:{english:"Enable use of Plugins as OpenAI Functions",translated:"Wezesha matumizi ya Programu kama Kazi za OpenAI"},com_endpoint_skip_hover:{english:"Enable skipping the completion step, which reviews the final answer and generated steps",translated:"Wezesha kuruka hatua ya kukamilisha, ambayo inakagua jibu la mwisho na hatua zilizotengenezwa"},com_endpoint_assistant_placeholder:{english:"Please select an Assistant and start a new chat",translated:"Tafadhali chagua Msaidizi na anza mazungumzo mapya"},com_endpoint_config_placeholder:{english:"Set your Key in the Header menu to chat.",translated:"Weka Kitufe chako kwenye menyu ya Kichwa ili kuzungumza."},com_nav_welcome_assistant:{english:"Please Select an Assistant",translated:"Tafadhali Chagua Msaidizi"},com_nav_welcome_message:{english:"Welcome to iXHello",translated:"Karibu kwenye iXHello"},com_nav_text_to_speech:{english:"Text to Speech",translated:"Maandishi hadi Sauti"},com_nav_automatic_playback:{english:"Autoplay Latest Message",translated:"Cheza Ujumbe wa Hivi Punde Moja kwa Moja"},com_nav_speech_to_text:{english:"Speech to Text",translated:"Sauti hadi Maandishi"},com_nav_profile_picture:{english:"Profile Picture",translated:"Picha ya Wasifu"},com_nav_change_picture:{english:"Change picture",translated:"Badilisha picha"},com_show_agent_settings:{english:"Show Agent Settings",translated:"Onyesha Mipangilio ya Wakala"},com_show_completion_settings:{english:"Show Completion Settings",translated:"Onyesha Mipangilio ya Kukamilisha"},com_hide_examples:{english:"Hide Examples",translated:"Ficha Mifano"},com_show_examples:{english:"Show Examples",translated:"Onyesha Mifano"},com_nav_export_filename:{english:"Filename",translated:"Jina la faili"},com_nav_export_filename_placeholder:{english:"Set the filename",translated:"Weka jina la faili"},com_nav_export_type:{english:"Type",translated:"Aina"},com_nav_export_conversation:{english:"Export conversation",translated:"Hamisha mazungumzo"},com_nav_export:{english:"Export",translated:"Hamisha"},com_nav_shared_links:{english:"Shared links",translated:"Viungo vilivyoshirikiwa"},com_nav_shared_links_manage:{english:"Manage",translated:"Simamia"},com_nav_shared_links_empty:{english:"You have no shared links.",translated:"Huna viungo vilivyoshirikiwa."},com_nav_shared_links_name:{english:"Name",translated:"Jina"},com_nav_shared_links_date_shared:{english:"Date shared",translated:"Tarehe iliyoshirikiwa"},com_nav_source_chat:{english:"View source chat",translated:"Tazama mazungumzo asili"},com_nav_my_files:{english:"File Manager",translated:"Meneja wa Faili"},com_nav_admin_center:{english:"Admin Center",translated:"Kituo cha Utawala"},com_nav_theme:{english:"Theme",translated:"Mandhari"},com_nav_theme_system:{english:"System",translated:"Mfumo"},com_nav_theme_dark:{english:"Dark",translated:"Giza"},com_nav_theme_light:{english:"Light",translated:"Mwanga"},com_nav_user_name_display:{english:"Display username in messages",translated:"Onyesha jina la mtumiaji kwenye ujumbe"},com_nav_clear_all_chats:{english:"Clear all chats",translated:"Futa mazungumzo yote"},com_nav_confirm_clear:{english:"Confirm Clear",translated:"Thibitisha Kufuta"},com_nav_close_sidebar:{english:"Close sidebar",translated:"Funga upau wa pembeni"},com_nav_open_sidebar:{english:"Open sidebar",translated:"Fungua upau wa pembeni"},com_nav_send_message:{english:"Send message",translated:"Tuma ujumbe"},com_nav_log_out:{english:"Log out",translated:"Ondoka"},com_nav_user:{english:"USER",translated:"MTUMIAJI"},com_nav_archived_chats:{english:"Archived chats",translated:"Mazungumzo yaliyohifadhiwa"},com_nav_archived_chats_manage:{english:"Manage",translated:"Dhibiti"},com_nav_archived_chats_empty:{english:"You have no archived conversations.",translated:"Huna mazungumzo yaliyohifadhiwa."},com_nav_archive_name:{english:"Name",translated:"Jina"},com_nav_archive_created_at:{english:"DateCreated",translated:"Tarehe Iliyoanzishwa"},com_nav_clear_conversation:{english:"Clear conversations",translated:"Futa mazungumzo"},com_nav_clear_conversation_confirm_message:{english:"Are you sure you want to clear all conversations? This is irreversible.",translated:"Una uhakika unataka kufuta mazungumzo yote? Hili halibadiliki."},com_nav_help:{english:"Help",translated:"Msaada"},com_nav_user_guide:{english:"User Guide",translated:"Mwongozo wa Mtumiaji"},com_nav_settings:{english:"Settings",translated:"Mipangilio"},com_nav_search_placeholder:{english:"Search messages",translated:"Tafuta ujumbe"},com_nav_auto_send_text:{english:"Auto send text (after 3 sec)",translated:"Tuma maandishi kiotomatiki (baada ya sekunde 3)"},com_nav_audio_play_error:{english:"Error playing audio: {0}",translated:"Hitilafu katika kucheza sauti: {0}"},com_nav_audio_process_error:{english:"Error processing audio: {0}",translated:"Hitilafu katika kushughulikia sauti: {0}"},com_nav_engine:{english:"Engine",translated:"Injini"},com_nav_browser:{english:"Browser",translated:"Kivinjari"},com_nav_external:{english:"External",translated:"Nje"},com_nav_delete_cache_storage:{english:"Delete cache storage",translated:"Futa hifadhi ya akiba"},com_nav_voice_select:{english:"Voice",translated:"Sauti"},com_nav_setting_general:{english:"General",translated:"Jumla"},com_nav_setting_speech:{english:"Speech",translated:"Hotuba"},com_nav_language:{english:"Language",translated:"Lugha"},com_nav_lang_auto:{english:"Auto detect",translated:"Tambua kiotomatiki"},com_page_not_found:{english:"Page not found",translated:"Ukurasa haujapatikana"},com_something_went_wrong_error:{english:"Something went wrong",translated:"Kuna hitilafu"},com_unauthorized_access:{english:"Unauthorized access",translated:"Ufikiaji usioidhinishwa"},com_domain_restricted_access:{english:"Unauthorized access. Access is restricted to specific domains.",translated:"Ufikiaji usioidhinishwa. Ufikiaji umewekewa mipaka kwa vikoa maalum."},com_temporarily_banned:{english:"Your account has been temporarily banned due to violations of our service",translated:"Akaunti yako imezuiwa kwa muda kutokana na ukiukaji wa huduma zetu"},com_temporarily_restricted:{english:"You are restricted to access the app outside of network!",translated:"Umezuiliwa kufikia programu nje ya mtandao!"},com_support_ticket_text:{english:"Support Ticket",translated:"Tiketi ya Msaada"},com_help_dialog_Header:{english:"Need assistance?",translated:"Unahitaji msaada?"},com_help_dialog_text_1_1:{english:"Click",translated:"Bofya"},com_help_dialog_text_1_2:{english:"for detailed instructions",translated:"kwa maelekezo ya kina"},com_help_dialog_text_here:{english:"here",translated:"hapa"},com_help_dialog_text_2:{english:"For issues, fill out a",translated:"Kwa matatizo, jaza"},com_help_dialog_text_non_concentrix:{english:"For issues, contact",translated:"Kwa matatizo, wasiliana na"},com_help_dialog_text_ticket:{english:"ticket",translated:"tiketi"},com_help_dialog_text_3:{english:"Find the steps",translated:"Pata hatua"},com_status_ind_none:{english:"Operational",translated:"Inafanya kazi"},com_status_ind_minor:{english:"Minor Issues",translated:"Matatizo Madogo"},com_status_ind_major:{english:"Major Issues",translated:"Matatizo Makubwa"},com_status_ind_critical:{english:"Critical",translated:"Hatari"},com_status_ind_error:{english:"Error Fetching",translated:"Hitilafu ya Kupata"},com_chat_conversation_history_restricted:{english:"Please note that when you leave a chat or start a new chat, you will lose your conversation history.",translated:"Tafadhali kumbuka kuwa ukiondoka kwenye gumzo au kuanzisha gumzo jipya, utapoteza historia ya mazungumzo yako."},com_forbidden_access:{english:"Forbidden access",translated:"Ufikiaji umekatazwa"},com_login_page_use_policy:{english:"Acceptable Use Policy",translated:"Sera ya Matumizi Yanayokubalika"},com_login_page_privacy_policy:{english:"Privacy Policy",translated:"Sera ya Faragha"},com_login_page_subscription_agreement:{english:"Subscription Agreement",translated:"Makubaliano ya Usajili"},com_login_page_agreement_info_start:{english:"Before using iX Hello, you can review Concentrix's ",translated:"Kabla ya kutumia iX Hello, unaweza kupitia "},com_login_page_agreement_info_end:{english:"By signing up and/or entering, you agree to the above terms.",translated:"Kwa kujisajili na/au kuingia, unakubali masharti yaliyo hapo juu."},com_login_page_and:{english:"and ",translated:"na "},com_nav_no_pinned_assistants:{english:"No pinned assistants",translated:"Hakuna wasaidizi waliowekwa"},com_nav_pinned_assistants:{english:"Pinned assistants",translated:"Wasaidizi waliowekwa"},com_ui_loading:{english:"Loading...",translated:"Inapakia..."},com_ui_unpin:{english:"Unpin",translated:"Ondoa"},com_ui_assistant_unpin_success:{english:"Assistant unpinned successfully",translated:"Msaidizi ameondolewa kwa mafanikio"},com_ui_assistant_unpin_error:{english:"Error unpinning assistant",translated:"Hitilafu ya kuondoa pini ya msaidizi"},com_ui_assistant_pin_success:{english:"Assistant pinned successfully",translated:"Msaidizi amepinwa kwa mafanikio"},com_ui_assistant_pin_unpin_error:{english:"Error pinning/unpinning assistant",translated:"Hitilafu ya kupin/kuondoa pini ya msaidizi"},com_ui_pin:{english:"Pin",translated:"Pini"},come_create_assistant:{english:"Create Assistant",translated:"Unda Msaidizi"},come_edit_assistant:{english:"Edit Assistant",translated:"Hariri Msaidizi"},com_ui_edit_assistant_confirm:{english:"Are you sure you want to proceed? This will result in the loss of any changes made to the Assistant you are currently editing or creating. This action cannot be undone.",translated:"Una uhakika unataka kuendelea? Hii itasababisha kupoteza mabadiliko yoyote uliyofanya kwa Msaidizi unayehariri au kuunda sasa. Hatua hii haiwezi kubatilishwa."},com_ui_assistant_not_found:{english:"Assistant with id {0} was not found.",translated:"Msaidizi mwenye kitambulisho {0} hakupatikana."},com_ui_speech_recognition_browser_support_error:{english:"Browser does not support SpeechRecognition",translated:"Kivinjari hakina msaada wa Utambuzi wa Sauti"},com_ui_microphone_permission_error:{english:"Microphone permission not granted",translated:"Ruhusa ya kipaza sauti haijatolewa"},com_ui_starting_recording_error:{english:"Error starting recording: {0}",translated:"Hitilafu ya kuanza kurekodi: {0}"},com_ui_media_recorder_error:{english:"MediaRecorder is not recording",translated:"MediaRecorder hairekodi"},com_ui_media_recorder_browser_support_error:{english:"MediaRecorder is not supported in this browser",translated:"MediaRecorder haijatolewa msaada katika kivinjari hiki"},com_ui_chat_personal_information_error:{english:"Your message contains personal information and could not be sent. Please remove any personal information.",translated:"Ujumbe wako una taarifa za kibinafsi na haukuweza kutumwa. Tafadhali ondoa taarifa zozote za kibinafsi."},com_ui_conversation_rename_error:{english:"Failed to rename conversation",translated:"Imeshindikana kubadilisha jina la mazungumzo"},com_ui_remaining_tokens:{english:"You have {0} of your allocated tokens remaining.",translated:"Una {0} ya tokeni zako zilizotengwa zilizobaki."},com_ui_footer_disclaimer:{english:"iX Hello can make mistakes. Please review all outputs for quality and accuracy. All inputs are logged for compliance.",translated:"iX Hello inaweza kufanya makosa. Tafadhali kagua matokeo yote kwa ubora na usahihi. Ingizo zote zimeandikwa kwa ajili ya kufuata sheria."},com_ui_assistant_group_by:{english:"Group by",translated:"Panga kwa"},com_ui_assistant_category:{english:"Category",translated:"Kategoria"},com_ui_assistant_team:{english:"Team",translated:"Timu"},com_ui_assistant_CX:{english:"CX",translated:"CX"},com_ui_assistant_engineering:{english:"Engineering",translated:"Uhandisi"},com_ui_assistant_intelligence:{english:"Intelligence",translated:"Ujasusi"},com_ui_assistant_marketing:{english:"Marketing",translated:"Masoko"},com_ui_assistant_operations:{english:"Operations",translated:"Operesheni"},com_ui_assistant_sales:{english:"Sales",translated:"Mauzo"},com_ui_assistant_strategy:{english:"Strategy",translated:"Mkakati"},com_ui_assistant_studio_assistance:{english:"Studio Assistants",translated:"Msaada wa Studio"},com_ui_avatar_upload_instructions:{english:"Upload an avatar image (PNG or JPG < 2MB)",translated:"Pakia picha ya avatar (PNG au JPG < 2MB)"},com_ui_assistant_tools_search_online:{english:"Searching the web",translated:"Tafuta Mtandaoni"},com_ui_assistant_tools_browse_website:{english:"Browsing website",translated:"Vinjari Tovuti"},com_ui_assistant_tools_generate_images:{english:"Generating images",translated:"Tengeneza Picha"},com_ui_assistant_tools_calculate_math:{english:"Calculating",translated:"Hesabu Hisabati"},com_ui_assistant_tools_default:{english:"Running tool",translated:"Chombo Chaguo-msingi"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_timeout:{english:"The file upload is taking longer than expected. Please try again.",translated:"Upakiaji wa faili unachukua muda mrefu kuliko ilivyotarajiwa. Tafadhali jaribu tena."},com_ui_assistant_pin_error:{english:"Error pinning assistant",translated:"Hitilafu katika kuweka msaidizi"},com_ui_share_delete_error:{english:"There was an error deleting the shared link",translated:"Kulikuwa na hitilafu katika kufuta kiungo kilichoshirikiwa"},com_ui_dan:{english:"DAN",translated:"DAN"},com_ui_dan_template:{english:"DAN Template",translated:"Kiolezo cha DAN"},com_endpoint_preset_default_none_HIDDEN:{english:"No default preset active.",translated:"Hakuna kiolezo chaguo-msingi kinachofanya kazi."},com_ui_drag_drop_title:{english:"Add anything",translated:"Ongeza chochote"},com_ui_drag_drop_description:{english:"Drop any file here to add it to the conversation",translated:"Achia faili yoyote hapa ili kuongeza kwenye mazungumzo"},com_ui_analyzing:{english:"Analyzing",translated:"Inachambua"},com_ui_finished_analyzing:{english:"Finished analyzing",translated:"Imemaliza kuchambua"},com_ui_warning:{english:"Warning",translated:"Onyo"},com_ui_proceed:{english:"Proceed",translated:"Endelea"},com_ui_file_upload_warning:{english:"Files uploaded to the assistant are used for conversational purposes only. Users can access the content of these files by asking relevant questions, but direct download of the files are not permitted.",translated:"Faili zilizopakuliwa kwa msaidizi zinatumika kwa madhumuni ya mazungumzo pekee. Watumiaji wanaweza kufikia maudhui ya faili hizi kwa kuuliza maswali husika, lakini upakuaji wa moja kwa moja wa faili hauruhusiwi."},com_endpoint_preset_name_placeholder:{english:"Set a custom name for this preset",translated:"Weka jina maalum kwa kiolezo hiki"},com_endpoint_example_input_placeholder:{english:"Set example input. Example is ignored if empty.",translated:"Weka mfano wa ingizo. Mfano unapuuzwa ikiwa tupu."},com_endpoint_example_output_placeholder:{english:"Set example output. Example is ignored if empty.",translated:"Weka mfano wa matokeo. Mfano unapuuzwa ikiwa tupu."},com_nav_export_select_type:{english:"Select a file type",translated:"Chagua aina ya faili"},com_nav_export_type_screenshot:{english:"screenshot (.png)",translated:"picha ya skrini (.png)"},com_nav_export_type_text:{english:"text (.txt)",translated:"maandishi (.txt)"},com_nav_export_type_markdown:{english:"markdown (.md)",translated:"markdown (.md)"},com_nav_export_type_json:{english:"json (.json)",translated:"json (.json)"},com_nav_export_type_csv:{english:"csv (.csv)",translated:"csv (.csv)"},com_ui_error_empty_agent_response:{english:"No response was received. Please try sending your message again. If the issue persists after reloading the page and retrying, please contact support.",translated:"Hakuna majibu yaliyopokelewa. Tafadhali jaribu kutuma ujumbe wako tena. Ikiwa tatizo litaendelea baada ya kupakia upya ukurasa na kujaribu tena, tafadhali wasiliana na msaada."},com_ui_back_to_chat:{english:"Back to Chat",translated:"Rudi kwenye Gumzo"},com_assistants_guardrail_moderation:{english:"Guardrail Moderation",translated:"Udhibiti wa Guardrail"},com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_enabled_info:{english:"Guardrail moderation is enabled for this assistant. Content will be checked against moderation policies.",translated:"Udhibiti wa guardrail umewezeshwa kwa msaidizi huyu. Yaliyomo yatakaguliwa dhidi ya sera za udhibiti."},com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_disabled_info:{english:"Disabling guardrail moderation removes content moderation checks for this assistant. You are responsible for complying with your organization’s content policies. Activity is fully logged and monitored.",translated:"Kuzima udhibiti wa guardrail kunaondoa ukaguzi wa udhibiti wa yaliyomo kwa msaidizi huyu. Unawajibika kwa kufuata sera za yaliyomo za shirika lako. Shughuli zote zinarekodiwa na kufuatiliwa."},com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_off_reason_placeholder:{english:"Please explain your business justification for disabling guardrail moderation (required).",translated:"Tafadhali eleza sababu ya kibiashara ya kuzima udhibiti wa guardrail (inahitajika)."},com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_reason_required:{english:"Please provide a justification for disabling guardrail moderation.",translated:"Tafadhali toa sababu ya kuzima udhibiti wa guardrail."},com_assistants_allow_model_switching:{english:"Allow users to change model in chat",translated:"Ruhusu watumiaji kubadilisha modeli katika mazungumzo"},com_ui_feedback_good:{english:"Good response",translated:"Jibu zuri"},com_ui_feedback_bad:{english:"Poor response",translated:"Jibu baya"},com_ui_feedback_comments:{english:"Comments",translated:"Maoni"},com_ui_feedback_comments_optional:{english:"Comments (optional)",translated:"Maoni (ya hiari)"},com_ui_feedback_placeholder:{english:"Tell us more about your experience...",translated:"Tuambie zaidi kuhusu uzoefu wako..."},com_ui_feedback_submit:{english:"Submit",translated:"Wasilisha"},com_ui_feedback_error:{english:"We couldn't send your feedback",translated:"Hatukuweza kutuma maoni yako"},com_ui_feedback_reason_incorrect:{english:"Incorrect",translated:"Si sahihi"},com_ui_feedback_reason_not_relevant:{english:"Not relevant",translated:"Haihusu"},com_ui_feedback_reason_outdated:{english:"Outdated",translated:"Imepitwa na wakati"},com_ui_feedback_reason_not_enough_detail:{english:"Not enough detail",translated:"Maelezo hayatoshi"},com_ui_feedback_reason_other:{english:"Other",translated:"Nyingine"},com_ui_model_recommended:{english:"Recommended",translated:"Inapendekezwa"},com_ui_model_legacy:{english:"Legacy — please update",translated:"Urithi — tafadhali sasisha"},com_ui_model_legacy_invalid:{english:"This model is no longer supported. Please select a current model.",translated:"Mfano huu hauungwi mkono tena. Tafadhali chagua mfano wa sasa."},com_nav_setting_memory:{english:"Memory",translated:"Kumbukumbu"},com_nav_memory_description:{english:"Manage the personal facts the assistant remembers across your conversations.",translated:"Dhibiti ukweli binafsi ambao msaidizi anakumbuka katika mazungumzo yako."},com_nav_memory_add_placeholder:{english:"Add a new memory…",translated:"Ongeza kumbukumbu mpya…"},com_nav_memory_add_button:{english:"Add memory",translated:"Ongeza kumbukumbu"},com_nav_memory_category:{english:"Category",translated:"Kategoria"},com_nav_memory_category_preference:{english:"Preference",translated:"Upendeleo"},com_nav_memory_category_identity:{english:"Identity",translated:"Utambulisho"},com_nav_memory_category_context:{english:"Context",translated:"Muktadha"},com_nav_memory_category_project:{english:"Project",translated:"Mradi"},com_nav_memory_empty_title:{english:"No memories yet",translated:"Hakuna kumbukumbu bado"},com_nav_memory_empty_description:{english:"Memories you save will appear here and help personalize future conversations.",translated:"Kumbukumbu unazohifadhi zitaonekana hapa na kusaidia kubinafsisha mazungumzo yajayo."},com_nav_memory_load_error:{english:"Could not load memories. Please try again.",translated:"Imeshindikana kupakia kumbukumbu. Tafadhali jaribu tena."},com_nav_memory_retry:{english:"Retry",translated:"Jaribu tena"},com_nav_memory_add_error:{english:"Could not add memory. Please try again.",translated:"Imeshindikana kuongeza kumbukumbu. Tafadhali jaribu tena."},com_nav_memory_update_error:{english:"Could not update memory. Please try again.",translated:"Imeshindikana kusasisha kumbukumbu. Tafadhali jaribu tena."},com_nav_memory_delete_error:{english:"Could not delete memory. Please try again.",translated:"Imeshindikana kufuta kumbukumbu. Tafadhali jaribu tena."},com_nav_memory_delete_confirm:{english:"Delete this memory?",translated:"Futa kumbukumbu hii?"},com_nav_memory_delete_button:{english:"Delete",translated:"Futa"},com_nav_memory_edit_aria:{english:"Edit memory",translated:"Hariri kumbukumbu"},com_nav_memory_delete_aria:{english:"Delete memory",translated:"Futa kumbukumbu"},com_nav_memory_save:{english:"Save",translated:"Hifadhi"},com_nav_memory_cancel:{english:"Cancel",translated:"Ghairi"},com_nav_memory_saved_at:{english:"Saved {0}",translated:"Imehifadhiwa {0}"},"modelConfig.gpt55.description":{english:"GPT-5.5 — latest GPT-5 thinking model with frontier intelligence.",translated:"GPT-5.5 — mfano wa hivi karibuni wa kufikiri wa GPT-5 wenye akili ya kisasa."},"modelConfig.gpt54Mini.description":{english:"GPT-5.4 Mini — compact and cost-efficient GPT-5.4 variant.",translated:"GPT-5.4 Mini — toleo dogo na la gharama nafuu la GPT-5.4."},"modelConfig.gpt54.description":{english:"GPT-5.4 — latest GPT-5 generation model.",translated:"GPT-5.4 — mfano wa kizazi cha hivi karibuni cha GPT-5."},"modelConfig.claudeOpus46.description":{english:"Latest Opus — frontier intelligence for coding agents and enterprise workflows.",translated:"Opus ya hivi karibuni — akili ya mbele kwa mawakala wa usimbaji na mtiririko wa kazi wa biashara."},"modelConfig.claudeOpus47.description":{english:"Latest Opus — frontier intelligence for coding agents and enterprise workflows.",translated:"Opus ya hivi karibuni — akili ya mbele kwa mawakala wa usimbaji na mtiririko wa kazi wa biashara."},"modelConfig.claudeSonnet46.description":{english:"Enhanced Sonnet with improved reasoning and instruction following.",translated:"Sonnet iliyoboreshwa na ufuatiliaji wa hoja na maagizo ulioboreshwa."},"modelConfig.claudeOpus45.description":{english:"Anthropic's most powerful model for complex, multi-step tasks.",translated:"Mfano wenye nguvu zaidi wa Anthropic kwa kazi ngumu, za hatua nyingi."},"modelConfig.claudeSonnet45.description":{english:"Balanced intelligence and speed for a wide range of tasks.",translated:"Akili na kasi iliyosawazishwa kwa kazi mbalimbali."},"modelConfig.claudeHaiku45.description":{english:"Fastest and most compact Claude model — ideal for high-throughput tasks.",translated:"Mfano wa Claude wa haraka na mdogo zaidi — bora kwa kazi za mtiririko wa juu."},"modelConfig.gpt53Chat.description":{english:"GPT-5.3 — enhanced reasoning and multimodal capabilities.",translated:"GPT-5.3 — ufuatiliaji wa hoja na uwezo wa multimodal ulioboreshwa."},"modelConfig.gpt5.description":{english:"OpenAI's flagship next-generation model.",translated:"Mfano mkuu wa kizazi kijacho wa OpenAI."},"modelConfig.gpt5Mini.description":{english:"Lightweight GPT-5 — efficient and fast for everyday tasks.",translated:"GPT-5 nyepesi — yenye ufanisi na haraka kwa kazi za kila siku."},"modelConfig.gpt41.description":{english:"OpenAI GPT-4.1 — improved instruction following and reasoning.",translated:"OpenAI GPT-4.1 — ufuatiliaji wa maagizo na hoja ulioboreshwa."},"modelConfig.gpt41Mini.description":{english:"Compact GPT-4.1 — faster and cheaper for simpler tasks.",translated:"GPT-4.1 ndogo — haraka na nafuu kwa kazi rahisi."},"modelConfig.gpt4o.description":{english:"Most capable GPT-4 model, optimised for speed and cost.",translated:"Mfano wa GPT-4 wenye uwezo zaidi, ulioboreshwa kwa kasi na gharama."},"modelConfig.gpt4oMini.description":{english:"Lightweight GPT-4o — faster and cheaper for simpler tasks.",translated:"GPT-4o nyepesi — haraka na nafuu kwa kazi rahisi."},"modelConfig.gemini31Pro.description":{english:"Google Gemini 3.1 Pro (Preview) — most capable Gemini model with 1M context.",translated:"Google Gemini 3.1 Pro (Hakiki) — mfano wenye uwezo zaidi wa Gemini na muktadha wa 1M."},"modelConfig.gemini3Flash.description":{english:"Google Gemini 3 Flash (Preview) — fast and efficient with 1M context.",translated:"Google Gemini 3 Flash (Hakiki) — haraka na ufanisi na muktadha wa 1M."},"modelConfig.gemini31FlashLite.description":{english:"Google Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite — lightweight, low-latency model with 1M context.",translated:"Google Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite — mfano mwepesi wenye uchelewaji mdogo na muktadha wa 1M."},"modelConfig.voiceworx.description":{english:"Internal voice-optimised assistant model.",translated:"Mfano wa msaidizi ulioboreshwa kwa sauti wa ndani."},"modelConfig.auto.description":{english:"Auto selects the best model for your request based on capacity and performance.",translated:"Auto huchagua mfano bora kwa ombi lako kulingana na uwezo na utendaji."},com_ui_model_coming_soon:{english:"Coming Soon",translated:"Inakuja Hivi Karibuni"},com_assistants_owners:{english:"Owners",translated:"Owners"},com_assistants_owner_added:{english:"Owner added successfully",translated:"Owner added successfully"},com_assistants_owner_removed:{english:"Owner removed successfully",translated:"Owner removed successfully"},com_assistants_owner_last_owner_error:{english:"Cannot remove the last owner of an assistant",translated:"Cannot remove the last owner of an assistant"},com_assistants_owner_email_placeholder:{english:"Add owner by email",translated:"Add owner by email"},com_ui_add:{english:"Add",translated:"Add"},com_ui_you:{english:"you",translated:"you"},com_assistants_owner_discard_warning:{english:"You have unsaved owner changes. Are you sure you want to discard them?",translated:"Unsaved changes will be discarded. Are you sure?"},com_ui_discard:{english:"Discard",translated:"Discard"},com_ui_keep_editing:{english:"Keep editing",translated:"Keep editing"},com_assistants_auto_weight_title:{english:"Auto routing preferences",translated:"Mapendeleo ya uelekezaji wa kiotomatiki"},com_assistants_auto_weight_description:{english:"Tune how the Auto router balances cost, accuracy, and speed when picking a model for each turn. A higher slider value means a stronger preference for that factor — for example, raising Cost selects cheaper models more often. Sliders are relative; values do not need to sum to 100.",translated:"Rekebisha jinsi kipanga njia cha Kiotomatiki kinavyosawazisha mabadilishano wakati wa kuchagua modeli kwa kila zamu. Uzani husawazishwa — uwiano wa kiasi ndio muhimu."},com_assistants_auto_weight_cost:{english:"Cost / token usage",translated:"Gharama"},com_assistants_auto_weight_cost_helper:{english:"Favor cheaper models with lower token cost. Move higher to prioritize cost over capability and latency.",translated:"Pendelea modeli za bei nafuu zenye gharama ndogo ya tokeni."},com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy:{english:"Accuracy",translated:"Usahihi"},com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy_helper:{english:"Favor stronger models for complex reasoning.",translated:"Pendelea modeli zenye uwezo zaidi kwa hoja changamani."},com_assistants_auto_weight_speed:{english:"Speed",translated:"Kasi"},com_assistants_auto_weight_speed_helper:{english:"Favor faster, lower-latency models.",translated:"Pendelea modeli za haraka zenye ucheleweshaji mdogo."},com_assistants_auto_weight_reset:{english:"Reset to defaults",translated:"Rejesha chaguo-msingi"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_timeout_error:{english:"File upload timed out. Please try again in a few minutes.",translated:"Upakiaji wa faili umechukua muda mrefu sana. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache."},com_error_assistant_not_available:{english:"Something went wrong. Here's the specific error message we encountered: An error occurred while processing your request. The assistant is no longer available. Please contact the Admin.",translated:"Hitilafu fulani imetokea. Huu ndio ujumbe mahususi wa hitilafu tuliokutana nao: Hitilafu ilitokea wakati wa kuchakata ombi lako. Msaidizi hapatikani tena. Tafadhali wasiliana na Msimamizi."},com_ui_code:{english:"Code",translated:"Msimbo"},com_ui_assistant_share:{english:"Share",translated:"Shiriki"},com_ui_assistant_share_link_copied:{english:"Link copied",translated:"Kiungo kimenakiliwa"},com_ui_assistant_no_access:{english:"You don't have access to this assistant",translated:"Huna ufikiaji wa msaidizi huyu"},com_ui_copy_to_clipboard_error:{english:"Failed to copy link to clipboard",translated:"Imeshindwa kunakili kiungo kwenye ubao wa kunakili"},com_ui_preview_incomplete:{english:"Preview not available — content generation was not completed.",translated:"Hakuna hakikisho — utengenezaji wa maudhui haujakamilika."},com_ui_view_code:{english:"View code",translated:"Tazama msimbo"},com_ui_preview_invalid:{english:"Preview not available — content is invalid.",translated:"Hakikisho halipatikani — maudhui si sahihi."},com_assistants_pii_entity_phone:{english:"Phone Number",translated:"Nambari ya Simu"},com_assistants_pii_entity_email:{english:"Email Address",translated:"Anwani ya Barua Pepe"},com_assistants_pii_entity_credit_card:{english:"Credit Card",translated:"Kadi ya Mkopo"},com_assistants_pii_entity_ssn:{english:"SSN",translated:"SSN"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_timeout_retrying:{english:"Upload is taking longer than expected - retrying ({0}/{1})...",translated:"Upakiaji unachukua muda mrefu kuliko ilivyotarajiwa - inajaribu tena ({0}/{1})..."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_connection_retrying:{english:"Connection issue - retrying ({0}/{1})...",translated:"Tatizo la muunganisho - inajaribu tena ({0}/{1})..."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_connection_failed:{english:"Upload failed - please check your connection and try again",translated:"Upakiaji umeshindikana - tafadhali angalia muunganisho wako na ujaribu tena"},com_assistants_memory_enabled:{english:"Memory",translated:"Kumbukumbu"},com_assistants_memory_enabled_info:{english:"Memory is enabled for this assistant. The assistant can store and recall facts across conversations.",translated:"Kumbukumbu imewezeshwa kwa msaidizi huyu. Msaidizi anaweza kuhifadhi na kukumbuka taarifa katika mazungumzo mbalimbali."},com_assistants_memory_disabled_info:{english:"Memory is disabled for this assistant. No facts will be stored or recalled across conversations.",translated:"Kumbukumbu imezimwa kwa msaidizi huyu. Hakuna taarifa zitakazohifadhiwa au kukumbukwa katika mazungumzo mbalimbali."},com_assistants_memory_enabled_off_reason_placeholder:{english:"Please explain your business justification for disabling memory (required).",translated:"Tafadhali eleza sababu yako ya kibiashara ya kuzima kumbukumbu (inahitajika)."},com_assistants_memory_enabled_reason_required:{english:"Please provide a justification for disabling memory.",translated:"Tafadhali toa sababu ya kuzima kumbukumbu."},com_nav_memory_team_disabled:{english:"Memory is disabled for your team. You can view and delete existing memories, but cannot add or edit new ones.",translated:"Kumbukumbu imezimwa kwa timu yako. Unaweza kuona na kufuta kumbukumbu zilizopo, lakini huwezi kuongeza au kuhariri mpya."},com_ui_assistant_tools_codeexecutor:{english:"Running your code",translated:"Inaendesha msimbo wako"},com_ui_assistant_tools_rag_query:{english:"Searching the knowledge base",translated:"Inatafuta kwenye msingi wa maarifa"},com_ui_assistant_tools_voiceworx:{english:"Processing voice",translated:"Inachakata sauti"},com_ui_assistant_tools_memory_store:{english:"Saving to memory",translated:"Inahifadhi kwenye kumbukumbu"},com_ui_assistant_tools_memory_delete:{english:"Removing from memory",translated:"Inaondoa kutoka kumbukumbu"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_search_online:{english:"Finished searching the web",translated:"Imemaliza kutafuta kwenye wavuti"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_browse_website:{english:"Finished reviewing the webpage",translated:"Imemaliza kukagua ukurasa wa wavuti"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_generate_image:{english:"Image generated",translated:"Picha imetengenezwa"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_calculate_math:{english:"Finished calculating",translated:"Imemaliza kukokotoa"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_codeexecutor:{english:"Finished running your code",translated:"Imemaliza kuendesha msimbo wako"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_rag_query:{english:"Finished searching the knowledge base",translated:"Imemaliza kutafuta kwenye msingi wa maarifa"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_voiceworx:{english:"Finished processing voice input",translated:"Imemaliza kuchakata ingizo la sauti"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_memory_store:{english:"Saved to memory",translated:"Imehifadhiwa kwenye kumbukumbu"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_memory_delete:{english:"Removed from memory",translated:"Imeondolewa kutoka kumbukumbu"},com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_fallback:{english:"Finished: {0}",translated:"Imemaliza: {0}"},com_ui_still_working:{english:"still working...",translated:"bado inafanya kazi..."},com_ui_file_ready:{english:"{0} is ready",translated:"{0} iko tayari"},com_ui_file_ready_fallback:{english:"File is ready",translated:"Faili iko tayari"},com_ui_file_processing_failed:{english:"{0} could not be processed",translated:"{0} haikuweza kuchakatwa"},com_ui_file_processing_failed_fallback:{english:"File could not be processed",translated:"Faili haikuweza kuchakatwa"},com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload:{english:"{0} could not be processed. Please re-upload the file.",translated:"{0} haikuweza kuchakatwa. Tafadhali pakia faili tena."},com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload_fallback:{english:"File could not be processed. Please re-upload the file.",translated:"Faili haikuweza kuchakatwa. Tafadhali pakia faili tena."},com_ui_file_processing:{english:"Processing...",translated:"Inachakata..."},com_ui_file_processing_failed_status:{english:"Processing failed",translated:"Uchakataji umeshindikana"},com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload_required:{english:"Failed - re-upload required",translated:"Imeshindikana - pakia tena inahitajika"},com_ui_file_retry:{english:"Retry",translated:"Jaribu tena"},com_ui_file_retry_in:{english:"Retry in {0}s",translated:"Jaribu tena baada ya {0}s"},com_ui_file_indexing_retrying:{english:"Retrying file indexing...",translated:"Inajaribu tena kuorodhesha faili..."},com_ui_file_retry_wait:{english:"Please wait {0}s before retrying",translated:"Tafadhali subiri {0}s kabla ya kujaribu tena"},com_ui_file_retries_exhausted_reupload:{english:"Maximum retries reached. Please re-upload the file.",translated:"Idadi ya juu ya majaribio imefikiwa. Tafadhali pakia faili tena."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_invalid_json:{english:"Invalid JSON file. File content does not match the expected format.",translated:"Faili ya JSON si sahihi. Maudhui ya faili hayalingani na muundo unaotarajiwa."}},tb=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,comparisons:ab,default:eb},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),nb={com_error_moderation:"சமர்ப்பிக்கப்பட்ட உள்ளடக்கம் எங்கள் சமூக வழிகாட்டுதல்களுக்கு இணங்கவில்லை என எங்கள் மிதவை அமைப்பு குறித்துள்ளது. இந்த குறிப்பிட்ட தலைப்பில் தொடர முடியவில்லை. உங்களிடம் வேறு கேள்விகள் அல்லது ஆராய விரும்பும் தலைப்புகள் இருந்தால், உங்கள் செய்தியைத் திருத்தவும் அல்லது புதிய உரையாடலை உருவாக்கவும்.",com_error_no_user_key:"முக்கியம் இல்லை. தயவுசெய்து ஒரு முக்கியத்தை வழங்கி மீண்டும் முயற்சிக்கவும்.",com_error_no_base_url:"அடிப்படை URL இல்லை. தயவுசெய்து ஒன்றை வழங்கி மீண்டும் முயற்சிக்கவும்.",com_error_invalid_user_key:"தவறான முக்கியம் வழங்கப்பட்டுள்ளது. தயவுசெய்து ஒரு முக்கியத்தை வழங்கி மீண்டும் முயற்சிக்கவும்.",com_error_expired_user_key:"{0} க்கான வழங்கப்பட்ட முக்கியம் {1} அன்று காலாவதியானது. தயவுசெய்து ஒரு முக்கியத்தை வழங்கி மீண்டும் முயற்சிக்கவும்.",com_error_token_balance_exceeded:"உங்கள் மாதாந்திர பயன்பாட்டு வரம்பை அடைந்துவிட்டீர்கள். உதவிக்கு குழு நிர்வாகியை தொடர்பு கொள்ளவும்.",com_error_token_balance_exceeded_license:"உங்கள் உரிமத்திற்கு அதிகபட்ச டோக்கன்களை அடைந்துவிட்டீர்கள். மேலும் உதவிக்கு {0} விற்பனை குழுவை தொடர்பு கொள்ளவும்.",com_error_token_balance_percent_used:"உங்களுக்கு ஒதுக்கப்பட்ட டோக்கன்களில் {0}% பயன்படுத்தியுள்ளீர்கள். மேலும் உதவிக்கு {1} ஐ தொடர்பு கொள்ளவும்.",com_error_license_expired:"உங்கள் உரிமம் கிடைக்கவில்லை. மேலும் உதவிக்கு ஆதரவை தொடர்பு கொள்ளவும்.",com_restricted_invalid_ip_format:"IPv6 முகவரிகள் ஆதரிக்கப்படவில்லை. தயவுசெய்து IPv4 இணைப்பைப் பயன்படுத்தவும் அல்லது மேலும் உதவிக்கு ஆதரவை தொடர்பு கொள்ளவும்.",com_error_tool_run:"உங்கள் கோரிக்கையை செயலாக்கும்போது பிழை ஏற்பட்டது. தயவுசெய்து மீண்டும் முயற்சிக்கவும்.",com_files_upload_duplicate_success:"கோப்பு {0} ஏற்கனவே வெற்றிகரமாக பதிவேற்றப்பட்டது",com_files_no_results:"முடிவுகள் இல்லை.",com_files_filter:"கோப்புகளை பெயரால் தேடவும்",com_files_number_selected:"{0} இல் {1} கோப்பு(கள்) தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்டது",com_sidepanel_select_assistant:"உதவியாளரைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்",com_sidepanel_parameters:"அளவுருக்கள்",com_ui_create_assistant:"உதவியாளரை உருவாக்கவும்",com_ui_create_assistant_permission_needed:"உதவியாளரை உருவாக்க பயனர் அனுமதிகள் தேவை",com_sidepanel_assistant_builder:"உதவியாளர்கள்",com_sidepanel_attach_files:"கோப்பு மேலாளர்",com_sidepanel_manage_files:"கோப்புகளை நிர்வகிக்கவும்",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_title:"ஒப்புதல்",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_1:"இந்த உதவியாளரை பிற குழு உறுப்பினர்களுடன் பகிர உள்ளீர்கள். இந்த உதவியாளரை பகிர்வதற்கு முன், கீழே உள்ள முக்கிய அம்சங்களை பரிசீலிக்கவும்:",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_2:"தொடர்வதன் மூலம், நீங்கள் இந்த விதிமுறைகளை புரிந்து, ஏற்றுக்கொள்கிறீர்கள் என்பதை உறுதிப்படுத்துகிறீர்கள்.",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_1:"பகிரப்பட்ட உதவியாளர் நுணுக்கமான அல்லது ரகசிய தரவுகளை கொண்டிருக்கக்கூடாது.",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_2:"பகிரப்பட்ட உதவியாளர்கள் நுணுக்கமான அல்லது ரகசிய தரவுகளை செயலாக்கக்கூடாது.",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_3:"பகிர்வு உள்ளடக்கத்திற்கும் அணுகலுக்கும் பொறுப்பும் பொறுப்பும் குறிக்கிறது.",com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_4:"அனைவருடனும் பகிர்வதைவிட குறிப்பிட்ட குழுவோடு அல்லது மூடப்பட்ட குழுவோடு பகிர்வதை பரிந்துரைக்கப்படுகிறது.",com_button_accept:"ஏற்கவும்",com_button_decline:"நிராகரிக்கவும்",com_assistants_capabilities:"அறிவக்களம்",com_assistants_file_search:"கோப்பு தேடல்",com_assistants_file_search_description:"உங்கள் உதவியாளர் கேள்விகளுக்கு பதிலளிக்கும்போது தேட வேண்டிய கோப்புகளை இங்கே சேர்க்கவும்.",com_assistants_file_search_supported_label:"ஆதரவு:",com_assistants_file_search_supported:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts.",com_assistants_file_search_tips_label:"குறிப்பு:",com_assistants_file_search_tips:"பயனர்களுக்கு பதிலளிக்கும் போது 'கோப்பு தேடல் கருவி'யைப் பயன்படுத்த உங்கள் உதவியாளரிடம் கேளுங்கள்.",com_assistants_file_search_info:"கோப்பு தேடலுக்கான வெக்டர் கடைகள் இணைப்பதற்கு ஆதரவு இல்லை. நீங்கள் அவற்றை வழங்குநர் விளையாட்டரங்கத்திலிருந்து இணைக்கலாம் அல்லது கோப்புகளைத் த thread அடிப்படையில் இணைக்கலாம்.",com_assistants_file_search_fetch_error:"வெக்டர் கடைகளிலிருந்து கோப்புகளை பெறும்போது ஏதோ தவறு ஏற்பட்டது.",com_assistants_knowledge:"அறிவக்களம்",com_assistants_knowledge_info:"உங்கள் உதவியாளருக்கு கேள்விகளுக்கு பதிலளிக்க கோப்புகளை பதிவேற்றவும் (எ.கா. CXNGPT பயனர் வழிகாட்டி)",com_assistants_knowledge_disabled:"உங்கள் உதவியாளரைச் சேமிக்க உருவாக்கத்தை கிளிக் செய்து, பின்னர் உங்கள் கோப்புகளைப் பதிவேற்றவும், சேமிக்க கிளிக் செய்யவும்.",com_assistants_image_vision:"படக்காட்சி",com_assistants_code_interpreter:"குறியீட்டு மொழிபெயர்ப்பாளர்",com_assistants_code_interpreter_description:"ஒவ்வொரு உரையாடலுக்கும் தரவுகளை பகுப்பாய்வு செய்ய அல்லது மாற்ற உங்களின் உதவியாளருக்கு தேவையான கோப்புகளை இங்கே சேர்க்கவும்.",com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported_label:"ஆதரவு:",com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts, csv, jpeg, jpg, gif, png, tar, xlsx, xml, zip.",com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips_label:"குறிப்புகள்:",com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips:"பயனர்களுக்கு பதிலளிக்கும் போது 'குறியீட்டு மொழிபெயர்ப்பாளர் கருவி'யைப் பயன்படுத்த உங்கள் உதவியாளரிடம் கேளுங்கள்.",com_assistants_code_interpreter_files_counter:"{0} இல் {1} கோப்புகள் பதிவேற்றப்பட்டன",com_assistants_code_interpreter_files:"கோடு மொழிபெயர்ப்பாளருக்கு மட்டும் கிடைக்கும் கோப்புகள்:",com_assistants_retrieval:"மீட்டல்",com_assistants_search_name:"பெயரால் உதவியாளர்களை தேடவும்",com_assistants_tools:"கருவிகள்",com_assistants_actions:"செயல்கள்",com_assistants_add_tools:"கருவிகளை சேர்க்கவும்",com_assistants_add_actions:"செயல்களை சேர்க்கவும்",com_assistants_non_retrieval_model:"இந்த மாதிரியில் கோப்பு தேடல் இயலாது. மற்றொரு மாதிரியைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.",com_assistants_available_actions:"கிடைக்கக்கூடிய செயல்கள்",com_assistants_running_action:"செயல் இயங்குகிறது",com_assistants_completed_action:"{0} உடன் பேசப்பட்டது",com_assistants_completed_function:"{0} இயங்கியது",com_assistants_completed_with_file_search:"கோப்பு தேடலைப் பயன்படுத்தியது",com_assistants_function_use:"உதவியாளர் {0} பயன்படுத்தினார்",com_assistants_function_browsewbsite_error_100:"[கருவி செயலாக்க பிழை] கொடுக்கப்பட்ட இணையதளத்தின் உள்ளடக்கத்தை பெற முடியவில்லை. [100]",com_assistants_function_browsewbsite_error_101:"[கருவி செயலாக்க பிழை] கொடுக்கப்பட்ட இணையதளத்தின் உள்ளடக்கத்தை பெற முடியவில்லை. [101]",com_assistants_domain_info:"உதவியாளர் இந்த தகவலை {0} க்கு அனுப்பினார்",com_assistants_delete_permission_title:"தனியார் உதவியாளர்களுடன் மட்டுமே நீக்க அனுமதி",com_assistants_delete_actions_success:"செயலை உதவியாளரிடமிருந்து வெற்றிகரமாக நீக்கப்பட்டது",com_assistants_update_actions_success:"செயல் வெற்றிகரமாக உருவாக்கப்பட்டது அல்லது புதுப்பிக்கப்பட்டது",com_assistants_update_actions_error:"செயலை உருவாக்க அல்லது புதுப்பிக்க பிழை ஏற்பட்டது.",com_assistants_delete_actions_error:"செயலை நீக்க பிழை ஏற்பட்டது.",com_assistants_actions_info:"உங்கள் உதவியாளர் API களைப் பயன்படுத்தி தகவல்களை மீட்டெடுக்க அல்லது செயல்களை எடுக்க அனுமதிக்கவும்",com_assistants_name_placeholder:"உங்கள் உதவியாளருக்கு பெயரிடவும் (எ.கா. மின்னஞ்சல் ஜெனரேட்டர்)",com_assistants_instructions_placeholder:"உங்கள் உதவியாளருக்கு அதன் நடத்தை வழிநடத்த குறிப்பான, விரிவான, முழுமையான வழிகாட்டுதல்களை வழங்கவும் (உதாரணம்: இலக்கு, பங்கு, செயல்கள், பார்வையாளர், பாணி, விதிகள், பணி, வார்ப்புரு, உதாரணம்)",com_assistants_description_placeholder:"உங்கள் உதவியாளர் என்ன செய்ய முடியும் என்பதை சுருக்கமாக விவரிக்கவும் (உதாரணம்: வார்ப்புருவிலிருந்து மின்னஞ்சல்களை உருவாக்கவும்)",com_assistants_actions_disabled:"செயல்களைச் சேர்க்க முன் நீங்கள் ஒரு உதவியாளரை உருவாக்க வேண்டும்.",com_assistants_update_success:"வெற்றிகரமாக புதுப்பிக்கப்பட்டது",com_assistants_update_error:"உங்கள் உதவியாளரை புதுப்பிக்கும்போது பிழை ஏற்பட்டது.",com_assistants_create_success:"வெற்றிகரமாக உருவாக்கப்பட்டது",com_assistants_create_error:"உங்கள் உதவியாளரை உருவாக்கும்போது பிழை ஏற்பட்டது.",com_assistants_loading:"உதவியாளர்கள் ஏற்றப்படுகிறது...",com_assistants_pii_redaction_reason_required:"PII-ஐ இயக்க காரணத்தை வழங்கவும்.",com_assistants_settings_and_privacy:"அமைப்புகள் & தனியுரிமை",com_assistants_pii_redaction:"PII திருத்தம்",com_assistants_pii_redaction_enabled_info:"இந்த உதவியாளரின் மாதிரி அழைப்புகளுக்கு இயல்பாக PII திருத்தம் இயக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது.",com_assistants_pii_redaction_disabled_info:"PII-ஐ அனுமதிப்பது இந்த உதவியாளரின் மாதிரி அழைப்புகளுக்கு திருத்தத்தை முடக்குகிறது. உங்கள் நிறுவனத்தின் தரவுக் கொள்கைகளைப் பின்பற்ற நீங்கள் பொறுப்பாக இருக்கிறீர்கள். செயல்பாடு முழுமையாக பதிவு செய்யப்படுகிறது மற்றும் கண்காணிக்கப்படுகிறது.",com_assistants_pii_redaction_off_reason_placeholder:"PII-ஐ இயக்க உங்கள் காரணத்தை விளக்கவும் (தேவை).",com_ui_min_length_error:"குறைந்தபட்ச நீளம் {0} எழுத்துகள்.",com_ui_max_length_error:"அதிகபட்ச நீளம் {0} எழுத்துகள்.",com_ui_date_today:"இன்று",com_ui_date_yesterday:"நேற்று",com_ui_date_previous_7_days:"முந்தைய 7 நாட்கள்",com_ui_date_previous_30_days:"முந்தைய 30 நாட்கள்",com_ui_date_january:"ஜனவரி",com_ui_date_february:"பிப்ரவரி",com_ui_date_march:"மார்ச்",com_ui_date_april:"ஏப்ரல்",com_ui_date_may:"மே",com_ui_date_june:"ஜூன்",com_ui_date_july:"ஜூலை",com_ui_date_august:"ஆகஸ்ட்",com_ui_date_september:"செப்டம்பர்",com_ui_date_october:"அக்டோபர்",com_ui_date_november:"நவம்பர்",com_ui_date_december:"டிசம்பர்",com_ui_field_required:"இந்த புலம் தேவை",com_ui_download_error:"கோப்பை பதிவிறக்குவதில் பிழை. கோப்பு நீக்கப்பட்டிருக்கலாம்.",com_ui_attach_error_type:"இறுதிநிலைக்கு ஆதரிக்கப்படாத கோப்பு வகை:",com_ui_attach_error_openai:"உதவியாளர் கோப்புகளை பிற இறுதிநிலைகளுக்கு இணைக்க முடியாது",com_ui_attach_error_size:"இறுதிநிலைக்கு கோப்பு அளவு வரம்பு மீறப்பட்டது:",com_ui_attach_error:"கோப்பை இணைக்க முடியாது. உரையாடலை உருவாக்கவும் அல்லது தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும், அல்லது பக்கத்தை புதுப்பிக்க முயற்சிக்கவும்.",com_ui_examples:"உதாரணங்கள்",com_ui_new_chat:"புதிய உரையாடல்",com_ui_conversations:"உரையாடல்கள்",com_ui_conversations_placeholder:"ஒரு உரையாடலைத் தொடங்கவும்...",com_ui_new_conversation:"புதிய உரையாடல்",com_ui_assistant_library:"உதவியாளர் நூலகம்",com_ui_kbot_assistants:"அறிவு",com_ui_assistant_search:"உதவியாளரைத் தேடுங்கள்",com_ui_assistant_default_category:"பொது",com_ui_assistant_featured:"சிறப்பு",com_ui_assistant_no_matches:"தேடல் நிபந்தனைகளை ஏற்ற உதவியாளர்கள் இல்லை.",com_ui_assistant_empty_results:"உதவியாளர்கள் எதுவும் கிடைக்கவில்லை.",com_ui_example_quantum_computing:"குவாண்டம் கணினியை எளிய முறையில் விளக்கவும்",com_ui_example_10_year_old_b_day:"10 வயது குழந்தையின் பிறந்த நாளுக்கு படைப்பாற்றலான யோசனைகள் உள்ளதா?",com_ui_example_http_in_js:"ஜாவாஸ்கிரிப்டில் HTTP கோரிக்கையை எப்படி செய்வது?",com_ui_category_placeholder:"ஒரு வகையைத் தேடவும்",com_ui_tool_placeholder:"ஒரு கருவியைத் தேடவும்",com_ui_capabilities:"திறன்கள்",com_ui_capability_remember:"பயனர் முந்தைய உரையாடலில் சொன்னதை நினைவில் கொள்கிறது",com_ui_capability_correction:"பயனர் திருத்தங்களை வழங்க அனுமதிக்கிறது",com_ui_capability_decline_requests:"தகுதியற்ற கோரிக்கைகளை நிராகரிக்க பயிற்சியளிக்கப்பட்டது",com_ui_limitations:"வரம்புகள்",com_ui_limitation_incorrect_info:"சில நேரங்களில் தவறான தகவல்களை உருவாக்கலாம்",com_ui_limitation_harmful_biased:"சில நேரங்களில் தீங்கான வழிமுறைகள் அல்லது பாகுபாடான உள்ளடக்கத்தை உருவாக்கலாம்",com_ui_limitation_limited_2021:"2021க்குப் பிறகான உலகம் மற்றும் நிகழ்வுகள் குறித்த வரையறுக்கப்பட்ட அறிவு",com_ui_on:"ஆன்",com_ui_off:"ஆஃப்",com_ui_yes:"ஆம்",com_ui_no:"இல்லை",com_ui_ascending:"ஏறுவரிசை",com_ui_descending:"இறங்குவரிசை",com_ui_show_all:"அனைத்தையும் காட்டு",com_ui_name:"பெயர்",com_ui_date:"தேதி",com_ui_storage:"சேமிப்பு",com_ui_context:"சூழல்",com_ui_size:"அளவு",com_ui_host:"ஹோஸ்ட்",com_ui_update:"மேம்படுத்து",com_ui_authentication:"அங்கீகாரம்",com_ui_instructions:"வழிமுறைகள்",com_ui_description:"விளக்கம்",com_ui_category:"வகை",com_ui_category_tooltip:"செயல்பாடு மூலம் உதவியாளர்களை வடிகட்ட மற்றும் ஒழுங்குபடுத்த வணிக வகையை ஒதுக்கவும்.",com_ui_error:"பிழை",com_ui_error_connection:"சேவையகத்துடன் இணைக்க பிழை, பக்கத்தை புதுப்பிக்க முயற்சிக்கவும்.",com_ui_select:"தேர்வு செய்",com_ui_select_placeholder:"விருப்பங்களைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்",com_ui_remove:"நீக்கு",com_ui_input:"உள்ளீடு",com_ui_close:"மூடு",com_ui_model:"மாதிரி",com_ui_name_empty_error:"உதவியாளர் பெயர் புலம் காலியாக இருக்க முடியாது. சரியான பெயரை உள்ளிடவும்.",com_ui_smart_prefix_error:"பொது உதவியாளர்களுக்கு ஸ்மார்ட் முன்னொட்டு பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டது, தயவுசெய்து வேறு பெயரைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்.",com_ui_description_empty_error:"விளக்கம் புலம் காலியாக இருக்க முடியாது. சரியான விளக்கத்தை உள்ளிடவும்.",com_ui_instructions_empty_error:"வழிமுறைகள் புலம் காலியாக இருக்க முடியாது. சரியான வழிமுறைகளை உள்ளிடவும்.",com_ui_category_empty_error:"வகை புலம் காலியாக இருக்க முடியாது. ஒரு வகையைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.",com_ui_duplicate_assistant_error:"மீண்டும் ஒரே பெயர் கொண்ட உதவியாளர் கண்டறியப்பட்டது. தனித்துவமான பெயரைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.",com_ui_shared_with_empty_error:"பகிரப்பட்ட புலம் காலியாக இருக்க முடியாது. பகிரப்பட்ட விருப்பத்தைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.",com_ui_shared_with:"பகிரப்பட்டது",com_ui_shared_with_tooltip_1:"தனியார் – இந்த உதவியாளரை நீங்கள் மட்டுமே அணுகி பார்க்க முடியும்.",com_ui_shared_with_tooltip_2:"குழுவுடன் மட்டும் பகிரவும் – இந்த உதவியாளர் உங்கள் குழு உறுப்பினர்களுக்கு தெரியும் மற்றும் அணுகக்கூடியதாக இருக்கும்.",com_ui_shared_with_team:"குழு",com_ui_shared_with_team_tooltip:"இந்த உதவியாளர் எந்தக் குழுவைச் சேர்ந்தவர் என்பதைத் த