 (Awoṣefaaji) — yára àti ṣiṣẹ́ pẹlu ìwé-ìpín 1M.","modelConfig.gemini31FlashLite.description":"Google Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite — awoṣe fẹẹrẹ pẹlu idaduro kekere àti ìwé-ìpín 1M.","modelConfig.voiceworx.description":"Awoṣe oluranlọwọ tó peye fún ohùn.","modelConfig.auto.description":"Auto yan awoṣe ti o dara julọ fun ibeere rẹ da lori agbara ati iṣẹ.",com_ui_model_coming_soon:"Ó ń bọ̀ láìpẹ́",com_assistants_owners:"Owners",com_assistants_owner_added:"Owner added successfully",com_assistants_owner_removed:"Owner removed successfully",com_assistants_owner_last_owner_error:"Cannot remove the last owner of an assistant",com_assistants_owner_email_placeholder:"Add owner by email",com_ui_add:"Add",com_ui_you:"you",com_assistants_add_owners:"Add owners",com_assistants_owner_search_placeholder:"Search by name or email (min. 3 characters)",com_assistants_owner_search_hint:"Type at least 3 characters to search",com_assistants_owner_no_results:"No users found",com_assistants_owner_discard_warning:"Unsaved changes will be discarded. Are you sure?",com_assistants_owners_saved:"Owners updated successfully",com_assistants_save_owners:"Save owners",com_assistants_pending_additions:"Pending additions",com_ui_saving:"Saving...",com_ui_discard:"Discard",com_ui_keep_editing:"Keep editing",com_ui_undo:"Undo",com_assistants_auto_weight_title:"Awọn ayanfẹ ipa-ọna aifọwọyi",com_assistants_auto_weight_description:"Ṣatunṣe bi olulana Aifọwọyi ṣe n dọgbadọgba awọn paṣipaarọ nigba yiyan awoṣe fun iyipo kọọkan. A ṣe deede awọn iwuwo — iwọntunwọnsi ibatan ni o ṣe pataki.",com_assistants_auto_weight_cost:"Iye owo",com_assistants_auto_weight_cost_helper:"Fẹran awọn awoṣe ti o din owo pẹlu iye owo token kekere.",com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy:"Iṣedede",com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy_helper:"Fẹran awọn awoṣe to lagbara fun ironu to nira.",com_assistants_auto_weight_speed:"Iyara",com_assistants_auto_weight_speed_helper:"Fẹran awọn awoṣe to yara, pẹlu idaduro kekere.",com_assistants_auto_weight_