, txt, css, js, ts."},com_assistants_file_search_tips_label:{english:"Tip:",translated:"提示:"},com_assistants_file_search_tips:{english:"Ask your assistant to use the 'File Search Tool' every time it responds to users.",translated:"文件大小不得超过2MB。如果文件过大，可能会导致上传失败。"},com_assistants_file_search_info:{english:"Attaching vector stores for File Search is not yet supported. You can attach them from the Provider Playground or attach files to messages for file search on a thread basis.",translated:"暂不支持为文件搜索附加向量存储。您可以从提供程序游乐场附加它们,或者在线程基础上为文件搜索附加文件。"},com_assistants_non_retrieval_model:{english:"File search is not enabled on this model. Please select another model.",translated:"此模型未启用文件搜索功能。请选择其他模型。"},com_ui_attach_error_openai:{english:"Cannot attach Assistant files to other endpoints",translated:"无法将助手文件附加到其他渠道"},com_ui_assistant_deleted:{english:"Successfully deleted assistant",translated:"助手已成功删除"},com_ui_assistant_delete_error:{english:"There was an error deleting the assistant",translated:"删除助手时出错。"},com_ui_date_october:{english:"October",translated:"十月"},com_ui_date_november:{english:"November",translated:"十一月"},com_ui_date_december:{english:"December",translated:"十二月"},com_ui_copied:{english:"Copied!",translated:"已复制！"},com_ui_copy_code:{english:"Copy code",translated:"复制代码"},com_ui_copy_link:{english:"Copy link",translated:"复制链接"},com_ui_update_link:{english:"Update link",translated:"更新链接"},com_ui_create_link:{english:"Create link",translated:"创建链接"},com_nav_source_chat:{english:"View source chat",translated:"查看源代码对话"},com_ui_date_today:{english:"Today",translated:"今天"},com_ui_date_yesterday:{english:"Yesterday",translated:"昨天"},com_ui_date_previous_7_days:{english:"Previous 7 days",translated:"过去7天"},com_ui_date_previous_30_days:{english:"Previous 30 days",translated:"过去30天"},com_ui_date_january:{english:"January",translated:"一月"},com_ui_date_february:{english:"February",translated:"二月"},com_ui_date_march:{english:"March",translated:"三月"},com_ui_date_april:{english:"April",translated:"四月"},com_ui_date_may:{english:"May",translated:"五月"},com_ui_date_june:{english:"June",translated:"六月"},com_ui_date_july:{english:"July",translated:"七月"},com_ui_date_august:{english:"August",translated:"八月"},com_ui_date_september:{english:"September",translated:"九月"},com_ui_nothing_found:{english:"Nothing found",translated:"未找到任何内容"},com_ui_go_to_conversation:{english:"Go to conversation",translated:"转到对话"},com_error_moderation:{english:"It appears that the content submitted has been flagged by our moderation system for not aligning with our community guidelines. We're unable to proceed with this specific topic. If you have any other questions or topics you'd like to explore, please edit your message, or create a new conversation.",translated:"很抱歉,您提交的内容被我们的审核系统标记为不符合社区指引。我们无法就此特定主题继续交流。如果您有任何其他问题或想探讨的话题,请编辑您的消息或开启新的对话。"},com_error_no_user_key:{english:"No key found. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"没有找到密钥。请提供密钥后重试。"},com_error_no_base_url:{english:"No base URL found. Please provide one and try again.",translated:"未找到基础URL,请提供一个后重试。"},com_error_invalid_user_key:{english:"Invalid key provided. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"提供的密钥无效。请提供有效的密钥后重试。"},com_error_expired_user_key:{english:"Provided key for {0} expired at {1}. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"您提供的 {0} 密钥已于 {1} 过期。请提供新的密钥并重试。"},com_error_token_balance_exceeded:{english:"You've reached your monthly usage limit. Please contact the team admin for assistance.",translated:"您已达到每月使用限制。请联系团队管理员以获取帮助。"},com_sidepanel_parameters:{english:"Parameters",translated:"参数"},com_ui_on:{english:"On",translated:"开启"},com_ui_off:{english:"Off",translated:"关闭"},com_ui_yes:{english:"Yes",translated:"是的"},com_ui_no:{english:"No",translated:"否"},com_ui_none_selected:{english:"None selected",translated:"未选择任何项目"},com_ui_mention:{english:"Mention an endpoint, assistant, or preset to quickly switch to it",translated:"提及一个端点、助手或预设以快速切换到它"},com_ui_import_conversation_file_type_error:{english:"Unsupported import type",translated:"不支持的导入类型"},com_ui_min_tags:{english:"Cannot remove more values, a minimum of {0} are required.",translated:"无法再移除更多值,至少需要保留{0}个。"},com_ui_max_tags:{english:"Maximum number allowed is {0}, using latest values.",translated:"最多允许{0}个,使用最新值。"},com_endpoint_messages:{english:"Messages",translated:"消息"},com_endpoint_context_tokens:{english:"Max Context Tokens",translated:"最大上下文词元数"},com_endpoint_context_info:{english:`The maximum number of tokens that can be used for context. Use this for control of how many tokens are sent per request.
  If unspecified, will use system defaults based on known models' context size. Setting higher values may result in errors and/or higher token cost.`,translated:"可用于上下文的最大词元数。用于控制每个请求发送的词元数量。如果未指定,将根据已知模型的上下文大小使用系统默认值。设置较高的值可能会导致错误和/或更高的词元成本。"},com_endpoint_stop:{english:"Stop Sequences",translated:"停止序列"},com_endpoint_stop_placeholder:{english:"Separate values by pressing `Enter`",translated:"按Enter键分隔多个值"},com_endpoint_openai_max_tokens:{english:"Optional `max_tokens` field, representing the maximum number of tokens that can be generated in the chat completion.\n    \n    The total length of input tokens and generated tokens is limited by the models context length. You may experience errors if this number exceeds the max context tokens.",translated:"可选的`max_tokens`字段,表示在聊天补全中可生成的最大token数量。\n\n输入token和生成token的总长度受模型上下文长度的限制。如果该数值超过最大上下文token数,您可能会遇到错误。"},com_endpoint_openai_stop:{english:"Up to 4 sequences where the API will stop generating further tokens.",translated:"最多4个序列,API将停止生成更多词元。"},com_nav_language:{english:"Language",translated:"语言"},com_nav_lang_auto:{english:"Auto detect",translated:"自动检测语言"},com_error_token_balance_exceeded_license:{english:"You've reached the maximum tokens for your license. Please contact sales at {0} for further assistance.",translated:"您已达到许可证的最大令牌数。请联系销售：{0}以获得进一步帮助。"},com_error_token_balance_percent_used:{english:"You have used {0}% of your allotted tokens. Please contact {1} for further assistance.",translated:"您已使用{0}%的分配令牌。请联系{1}以获得进一步帮助。"},com_error_license_expired:{english:"Your License is not available. Please contact support for further assistance.",translated:"您的许可证不可用。请联系支持以获得进一步帮助。"},com_restricted_invalid_ip_format:{english:"IPv6 addresses are not supported. Please use an IPv4 connection or contact support for further assistance.",translated:"不支持IPv6地址。请使用IPv4连接或联系支持以获得进一步帮助。"},com_error_tool_run:{english:"An error occurred while processing your request. Please try again.",translated:"处理您的请求时出错。请重试。"},com_files_upload_duplicate_success:{english:"File {0} was already uploaded successfully",translated:"文件{0}已成功上传"},com_ui_create_assistant:{english:"Create Assistant",translated:"创建助手"},com_ui_create_assistant_permission_needed:{english:"User needs create permissions to create an Assistant",translated:"用户需要创建权限才能创建助手"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_title:{english:"Consent",translated:"同意"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_1:{english:"You are about to share this assistant with other team members. Before sharing this assistant, please review the key points below:",translated:"您即将与其他团队成员共享此助手。在共享此助手之前，请查看以下要点："},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_2:{english:"By proceeding, you confirm that you understand and accept these terms.",translated:"继续操作即表示您确认理解并接受这些条款。"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_1:{english:"Shared assistant should not contain sensitive or confidential data.",translated:"共享助手不应包含敏感或机密数据。"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_2:{english:"Shared assistants must not process sensitive or confidential data.",translated:"共享助手不得处理敏感或机密数据。"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_3:{english:"Sharing implies accountability and responsibility for the content and access.",translated:"共享意味着对内容和访问的责任和义务。"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_4:{english:" It is recommended to share with a specific team or closed group instead of everyone.",translated:"建议与特定团队或封闭小组共享，而不是与所有人共享。"},com_button_accept:{english:"Accept",translated:"接受"},com_button_decline:{english:"Decline",translated:"拒绝"},com_assistants_file_search_fetch_error:{english:"Something went wrong when fetching files from the vector stores.",translated:"从向量存储中获取文件时出错。"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_files_counter:{english:"{0} of {1} files uploaded",translated:"{0}个文件已上传，共{1}个"},com_assistants_delete_permission_title:{english:"Deleting only allowed with private Assistants",translated:"仅允许删除私人助手"},com_assistants_loading:{english:"Loading assistants...",translated:"加载助手中..."},com_assistants_pii_redaction_reason_required:{english:"Please provide a reason for enabling PII.",translated:"请提供启用PII的原因。"},com_assistants_settings_and_privacy:{english:"Settings & Privacy",translated:"设置与隐私"},com_assistants_pii_redaction:{english:"PII Redaction",translated:"PII编辑"},com_assistants_pii_redaction_enabled_info:{english:"PII redaction is enabled for this assistant's model calls by default.",translated:"默认情况下，此助手的模型调用启用了PII编辑。"},com_assistants_pii_redaction_disabled_info:{english:"Allowing PII disables redaction for this assistant’s model calls. You are responsible for complying with your organization’s data policies. Activity is fully logged and monitored.",translated:"允许PII会禁用此助手模型调用的编辑。您需负责遵守组织的数据政策。活动会被完整记录和监控。"},com_assistants_pii_redaction_off_reason_placeholder:{english:"Please explain your reason for enabling PII (required).",translated:"请说明启用PII的原因（必填）。"},com_ui_min_length_error:{english:"Minimum length is {0} characters.",translated:"最小长度为{0}个字符。"},com_ui_max_length_error:{english:"Maximum length is {0} characters.",translated:"最大长度为{0}个字符。"},com_ui_kbot_assistants:{english:"Knowledge",translated:"知识"},com_ui_assistant_default_category:{english:"General",translated:"常规"},com_ui_assistant_featured:{english:"Featured",translated:"精选"},com_ui_assistant_no_matches:{english:"No assistants match the search criteria.",translated:"没有符合搜索条件的助手。"},com_ui_assistant_empty_results:{english:"No assistants found.",translated:"未找到助手。"},com_ui_category_placeholder:{english:"Search a category",translated:"搜索类别"},com_ui_tool_placeholder:{english:"Search a tool",translated:"搜索工具"},com_ui_error_connection:{english:"Error connecting to server, try refreshing the page.",translated:"连接服务器出错，请尝试刷新页面。"},com_ui_select_placeholder:{english:"Select options",translated:"选择选项"},com_ui_remove:{english:"Remove",translated:"移除"},com_ui_thinking:{english:"Thinking",translated:"思考中"},com_ui_analyzing_request:{english:"Understanding your question",translated:"分析您的请求"},com_ui_processing:{english:"Putting it together",translated:"处理中"},com_ui_working_on_it:{english:"Almost ready",translated:"正在处理"},com_ui_read_aloud:{english:"Read aloud",translated:"朗读"},com_ui_assistant_duplicate_file_upload:{english:"Duplicate file detected.",translated:"检测到重复文件。"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_error:{english:"An error occurred while uploading the file.",translated:"上传文件时出错。"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_endpoint_undefined:{english:"An error occurred while uploading the file: Endpoint is undefined",translated:"上传文件时出错：端点未定义"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_not_empty:{english:"Empty files are not allowed.",translated:"不允许空文件。"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_count_error:{english:"You can only upload up to {0} files at a time.",translated:"一次最多上传{0}个文件。"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_section_count_error:{english:"You can only upload up to {0} files in this section.",translated:"此部分最多上传{0}个文件。"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_section_response_error:{english:"The upload limit has been reached for {0}",translated:"{0}的上传限制已达到"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_type_unknown:{english:"Unable to determine file type for: {0}",translated:"无法确定文件类型: {0}"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_unsupported_type:{english:"File type not supported. Please upload a supported file format.",translated:"不支持的文件类型。请上传支持的文件格式。"},com_ui_assistant_image_failed_load:{english:"Failed to load image",translated:"加载图像失败"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_supported_type:{english:"Currently, only JPEG, JPG, PNG, and WEBP files are supported.",translated:"当前仅支持JPEG、JPG、PNG和WEBP文件。"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_size_limit:{english:"File size exceeds {0} MB.",translated:"文件大小超过{0} MB。"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_total_size_limit:{english:"The total size of the files cannot exceed {0} MB.",translated:"文件总大小不能超过{0} MB。"},com_ui_assistant_file_validation_error:{english:"An error occurred while validating the file.",translated:"验证文件时发生错误。"},com_ui_assistant_file_processing_error:{english:"An error occurred while processing the file.",translated:"处理文件时发生错误。"},com_ui_assistants_category_ix_customer:{english:"Studio Assistance",translated:"工作室协助"},com_ui_assistants_category_kbot:{english:"Knowledge",translated:"知识"},com_ui_assistants_uncategorized:{english:"Uncategorized",translated:"未分类"},com_ui_use_micrphone:{english:"Use microphone",translated:"使用麦克风"},com_endpoint_export_share:{english:"Export/Share",translated:"导出/分享"},com_nav_text_to_speech:{english:"Text to Speech",translated:"文本转语音"},com_nav_automatic_playback:{english:"Autoplay Latest Message",translated:"自动播放最新消息"},com_nav_speech_to_text:{english:"Speech to Text",translated:"语音转文本"},com_nav_user_guide:{english:"User Guide",translated:"用户指南"},com_nav_auto_send_text:{english:"Auto send text (after 3 sec)",translated:"自动发送文本（3秒后）"},com_nav_audio_play_error:{english:"Error playing audio: {0}",translated:"播放音频错误: {0}"},com_nav_audio_process_error:{english:"Error processing audio: {0}",translated:"处理音频错误: {0}"},com_nav_engine:{english:"Engine",translated:"引擎"},com_nav_browser:{english:"Browser",translated:"浏览器"},com_nav_external:{english:"External",translated:"外部"},com_nav_delete_cache_storage:{english:"Delete cache storage",translated:"删除缓存存储"},com_nav_voice_select:{english:"Voice",translated:"语音"},com_nav_setting_speech:{english:"Speech",translated:"语音设置"},com_page_not_found:{english:"Page not found",translated:"页面未找到"},com_something_went_wrong_error:{english:"Something went wrong",translated:"出现错误"},com_unauthorized_access:{english:"Unauthorized access",translated:"未授权访问"},com_domain_restricted_access:{english:"Unauthorized access. Access is restricted to specific domains.",translated:"未授权访问。访问仅限特定域。"},com_temporarily_banned:{english:"Your account has been temporarily banned due to violations of our service",translated:"由于违反服务条款，您的账户已被暂时禁止"},com_temporarily_restricted:{english:"You are restricted to access the app outside of network!",translated:"您被限制在网络外访问应用！"},com_support_ticket_text:{english:"Support Ticket",translated:"支持工单"},com_help_dialog_Header:{english:"Need assistance?",translated:"需要帮助？"},com_help_dialog_text_1_1:{english:"Click",translated:"点击"},com_help_dialog_text_1_2:{english:"for detailed instructions",translated:"查看详细说明"},com_help_dialog_text_here:{english:"here",translated:"这里"},com_help_dialog_text_2:{english:"For issues, fill out a",translated:"如有问题，请填写"},com_help_dialog_text_non_concentrix:{english:"For issues, contact",translated:"如有问题，请联系"},com_help_dialog_text_ticket:{english:"ticket",translated:"工单"},com_help_dialog_text_3:{english:"Find the steps",translated:"查看步骤"},com_status_ind_none:{english:"Operational",translated:"正常运行"},com_status_ind_minor:{english:"Minor Issues",translated:"轻微问题"},com_status_ind_major:{english:"Major Issues",translated:"重大问题"},com_status_ind_critical:{english:"Critical",translated:"严重"},com_status_ind_error:{english:"Error Fetching",translated:"获取错误"},com_chat_conversation_history_restricted:{english:"Please note that when you leave a chat or start a new chat, you will lose your conversation history.",translated:"请注意，当您离开聊天或开始新聊天时，您将失去对话历史。"},com_forbidden_access:{english:"Forbidden access",translated:"禁止访问"},com_login_page_use_policy:{english:"Acceptable Use Policy",translated:"可接受使用政策"},com_login_page_privacy_policy:{english:"Privacy Policy",translated:"隐私政策"},com_login_page_subscription_agreement:{english:"Subscription Agreement",translated:"订阅协议"},com_login_page_agreement_info_start:{english:"Before using iX Hello, you can review Concentrix's ",translated:"在使用iX Hello之前，您可以查看Concentrix的"},com_login_page_agreement_info_end:{english:"By signing up and/or entering, you agree to the above terms.",translated:"注册和/或进入即表示您同意上述条款。"},com_login_page_and:{english:"and ",translated:"和"},com_nav_no_pinned_assistants:{english:"No pinned assistants",translated:"没有固定的助手"},com_nav_pinned_assistants:{english:"Pinned assistants",translated:"固定的助手"},com_ui_loading:{english:"Loading...",translated:"加载中..."},com_ui_unpin:{english:"Unpin",translated:"取消固定"},com_ui_assistant_unpin_success:{english:"Assistant unpinned successfully",translated:"助手取消固定成功"},com_ui_assistant_unpin_error:{english:"Error unpinning assistant",translated:"取消固定助手时出错"},com_ui_assistant_pin_success:{english:"Assistant pinned successfully",translated:"助手固定成功"},com_ui_assistant_pin_unpin_error:{english:"Error pinning/unpinning assistant",translated:"固定/取消固定助手时出错"},com_ui_pin:{english:"Pin",translated:"固定"},come_create_assistant:{english:"Create Assistant",translated:"创建助手"},come_edit_assistant:{english:"Edit Assistant",translated:"编辑助手"},com_ui_edit_assistant_confirm:{english:"Are you sure you want to proceed? This will result in the loss of any changes made to the Assistant you are currently editing or creating. This action cannot be undone.",translated:"您确定要继续吗？这将导致丢失您当前正在编辑或创建的助手的任何更改。此操作无法撤销。"},com_ui_assistant_not_found:{english:"Assistant with id {0} was not found.",translated:"未找到ID为{0}的助手。"},com_ui_speech_recognition_browser_support_error:{english:"Browser does not support SpeechRecognition",translated:"浏览器不支持语音识别"},com_ui_microphone_permission_error:{english:"Microphone permission not granted",translated:"未授予麦克风权限"},com_ui_starting_recording_error:{english:"Error starting recording: {0}",translated:"开始录音时出错：{0}"},com_ui_media_recorder_error:{english:"MediaRecorder is not recording",translated:"MediaRecorder未在录音"},com_ui_media_recorder_browser_support_error:{english:"MediaRecorder is not supported in this browser",translated:"此浏览器不支持MediaRecorder"},com_ui_chat_personal_information_error:{english:"Your message contains personal information and could not be sent. Please remove any personal information.",translated:"您的消息包含个人信息，无法发送。请删除任何个人信息。"},com_ui_conversation_rename_error:{english:"Failed to rename conversation",translated:"重命名对话失败"},com_ui_remaining_tokens:{english:"You have {0} of your allocated tokens remaining.",translated:"您还有{0}个分配的代币。"},com_ui_footer_disclaimer:{english:"iX Hello can make mistakes. Please review all outputs for quality and accuracy. All inputs are logged for compliance.",translated:"iX Hello可能会出错。请检查所有输出的质量和准确性。所有输入均记录以确保合规。"},com_ui_assistant_group_by:{english:"Group by",translated:"分组依据"},com_ui_assistant_category:{english:"Category",translated:"类别"},com_ui_assistant_team:{english:"Team",translated:"团队"},com_ui_assistant_CX:{english:"CX",translated:"客户体验"},com_ui_assistant_engineering:{english:"Engineering",translated:"工程"},com_ui_assistant_intelligence:{english:"Intelligence",translated:"智能"},com_ui_assistant_marketing:{english:"Marketing",translated:"市场营销"},com_ui_assistant_operations:{english:"Operations",translated:"运营"},com_ui_assistant_sales:{english:"Sales",translated:"销售"},com_ui_assistant_strategy:{english:"Strategy",translated:"战略"},com_ui_assistant_studio_assistance:{english:"Studio Assistants",translated:"工作室助手"},com_ui_avatar_upload_instructions:{english:"Upload an avatar image (PNG or JPG < 2MB)",translated:"上传头像图片（PNG或JPG < 2MB）"},com_ui_assistant_tools_search_online:{english:"Searching the web",translated:"在线搜索"},com_ui_assistant_tools_browse_website:{english:"Browsing website",translated:"浏览网站"},com_ui_assistant_tools_generate_images:{english:"Generating images",translated:"生成图像"},com_ui_assistant_tools_calculate_math:{english:"Calculating",translated:"计算数学"},com_ui_assistant_tools_default:{english:"Running tool",translated:"默认工具"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_timeout:{english:"The file upload is taking longer than expected. Please try again.",translated:"文件上传时间超出预期。请重试。"},com_ui_assistant_pin_error:{english:"Error pinning assistant",translated:"固定助手时出错"},com_ui_share_delete_error:{english:"There was an error deleting the shared link",translated:"删除共享链接时出错"},com_ui_dan:{english:"DAN",translated:"DAN"},com_ui_dan_template:{english:"DAN Template",translated:"DAN模板"},com_endpoint_preset_default_none_HIDDEN:{english:"No default preset active.",translated:"无默认预设激活。"},com_ui_drag_drop_title:{english:"Add anything",translated:"添加任何内容"},com_ui_drag_drop_description:{english:"Drop any file here to add it to the conversation",translated:"将任何文件拖放到此处以添加到对话中"},com_ui_analyzing:{english:"Analyzing",translated:"分析中"},com_ui_finished_analyzing:{english:"Finished analyzing",translated:"分析完成"},com_ui_warning:{english:"Warning",translated:"警告"},com_ui_proceed:{english:"Proceed",translated:"继续"},com_ui_file_upload_warning:{english:"Files uploaded to the assistant are used for conversational purposes only. Users can access the content of these files by asking relevant questions, but direct download of the files are not permitted.",translated:"上传到助手的文件仅用于对话目的。用户可以通过相关问题访问这些文件的内容，但不允许直接下载文件。"},com_endpoint_preset_name_placeholder:{english:"Set a custom name for this preset",translated:"为此预设设置自定义名称"},com_endpoint_example_input_placeholder:{english:"Set example input. Example is ignored if empty.",translated:"设置示例输入。示例为空时将被忽略。"},com_endpoint_example_output_placeholder:{english:"Set example output. Example is ignored if empty.",translated:"设置示例输出。示例为空时将被忽略。"},com_nav_export_select_type:{english:"Select a file type",translated:"选择文件类型"},com_nav_export_type_screenshot:{english:"screenshot (.png)",translated:"截图 (.png)"},com_nav_export_type_text:{english:"text (.txt)",translated:"文本 (.txt)"},com_nav_export_type_markdown:{english:"markdown (.md)",translated:"Markdown (.md)"},com_nav_export_type_json:{english:"json (.json)",translated:"JSON (.json)"},com_nav_export_type_csv:{english:"csv (.csv)",translated:"CSV (.csv)"},com_ui_error_empty_agent_response:{english:"No response was received. Please try sending your message again. If the issue persists after reloading the page and retrying, please contact support.",translated:"未收到响应。请重试发送消息。如果重新加载页面并重试后问题仍然存在，请联系支持。"},com_ui_back_to_chat:{english:"Back to Chat",translated:"返回聊天"},com_assistants_guardrail_moderation:{english:"Guardrail Moderation",translated:"护栏审核"},com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_enabled_info:{english:"Guardrail moderation is enabled for this assistant. Content will be checked against moderation policies.",translated:"此助手已启用护栏审核。内容将根据审核政策进行检查。"},com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_disabled_info:{english:"Disabling guardrail moderation removes content moderation checks for this assistant. You are responsible for complying with your organization’s content policies. Activity is fully logged and monitored.",translated:"禁用护栏审核将移除此助手的内容审核检查。您需负责遵守组织的内容政策。活动将被完整记录和监控。"},com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_off_reason_placeholder:{english:"Please explain your business justification for disabling guardrail moderation (required).",translated:"请说明禁用护栏审核的业务理由（必填）。"},com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_reason_required:{english:"Please provide a justification for disabling guardrail moderation.",translated:"请提供禁用护栏审核的理由。"},com_assistants_allow_model_switching:{english:"Allow users to change model in chat",translated:"允许用户在聊天中切换模型"},com_ui_feedback_good:{english:"Good response",translated:"良好回复"},com_ui_feedback_bad:{english:"Poor response",translated:"不良回复"},com_ui_feedback_comments:{english:"Comments",translated:"评论"},com_ui_feedback_comments_optional:{english:"Comments (optional)",translated:"评论（可选）"},com_ui_feedback_placeholder:{english:"Tell us more about your experience...",translated:"请告诉我们您的体验..."},com_ui_feedback_submit:{english:"Submit",translated:"提交"},com_ui_feedback_error:{english:"We couldn't send your feedback",translated:"无法发送您的反馈"},com_ui_feedback_reason_incorrect:{english:"Incorrect",translated:"不正确"},com_ui_feedback_reason_not_relevant:{english:"Not relevant",translated:"不相关"},com_ui_feedback_reason_outdated:{english:"Outdated",translated:"已过时"},com_ui_feedback_reason_not_enough_detail:{english:"Not enough detail",translated:"详情不足"},com_ui_feedback_reason_other:{english:"Other",translated:"其他"},com_ui_model_recommended:{english:"Recommended",translated:"推荐"},com_ui_model_legacy:{english:"Legacy — please update",translated:"旧版 — 请更新"},com_ui_model_legacy_invalid:{english:"This model is no longer supported. Please select a current model.",translated:"此模型不再支持。请选择当前模型。"},com_nav_setting_memory:{english:"Memory",translated:"记忆"},com_nav_memory_description:{english:"Manage the personal facts the assistant remembers across your conversations.",translated:"管理助手在对话中记住的个人信息。"},com_nav_memory_add_placeholder:{english:"Add a new memory…",translated:"添加新记忆…"},com_nav_memory_add_button:{english:"Add memory",translated:"添加记忆"},com_nav_memory_category:{english:"Category",translated:"类别"},com_nav_memory_category_preference:{english:"Preference",translated:"偏好"},com_nav_memory_category_identity:{english:"Identity",translated:"身份"},com_nav_memory_category_context:{english:"Context",translated:"上下文"},com_nav_memory_category_project:{english:"Project",translated:"项目"},com_nav_memory_empty_title:{english:"No memories yet",translated:"暂无记忆"},com_nav_memory_empty_description:{english:"Memories you save will appear here and help personalize future conversations.",translated:"您保存的记忆将显示在此处，并帮助个性化未来的对话。"},com_nav_memory_load_error:{english:"Could not load memories. Please try again.",translated:"无法加载记忆。请重试。"},com_nav_memory_retry:{english:"Retry",translated:"重试"},com_nav_memory_add_error:{english:"Could not add memory. Please try again.",translated:"无法添加记忆。请重试。"},com_nav_memory_update_error:{english:"Could not update memory. Please try again.",translated:"无法更新记忆。请重试。"},com_nav_memory_delete_error:{english:"Could not delete memory. Please try again.",translated:"无法删除记忆。请重试。"},com_nav_memory_delete_confirm:{english:"Delete this memory?",translated:"删除此记忆？"},com_nav_memory_delete_button:{english:"Delete",translated:"删除"},com_nav_memory_edit_aria:{english:"Edit memory",translated:"编辑记忆"},com_nav_memory_delete_aria:{english:"Delete memory",translated:"删除记忆"},com_nav_memory_save:{english:"Save",translated:"保存"},com_nav_memory_cancel:{english:"Cancel",translated:"取消"},com_nav_memory_saved_at:{english:"Saved {0}",translated:"已保存 {0}"},"modelConfig.gpt55.description":{english:"GPT-5.5 — latest GPT-5 thinking model with frontier intelligence.",translated:"GPT-5.5 — 最新 GPT-5 推理模型，具备前沿智能。"},"modelConfig.gpt54Mini.description":{english:"GPT-5.4 Mini — compact and cost-efficient GPT-5.4 variant.",translated:"GPT-5.4 Mini — 紧凑且经济的GPT-5.4版本。"},"modelConfig.gpt54.description":{english:"GPT-5.4 — latest GPT-5 generation model.",translated:"GPT-5.4 — 最新的GPT-5代模型。"},"modelConfig.claudeOpus46.description":{english:"Latest Opus — frontier intelligence for coding agents and enterprise workflows.",translated:"最新的Opus — 为编码代理和企业工作流提供前沿智能。"},"modelConfig.claudeOpus47.description":{english:"Latest Opus — frontier intelligence for coding agents and enterprise workflows.",translated:"最新的Opus — 为编码代理和企业工作流提供前沿智能。"},"modelConfig.claudeSonnet46.description":{english:"Enhanced Sonnet with improved reasoning and instruction following.",translated:"增强版Sonnet，改进了推理和指令遵循。"},"modelConfig.claudeOpus45.description":{english:"Anthropic's most powerful model for complex, multi-step tasks.",translated:"Anthropic最强大的模型，适用于复杂的多步骤任务。"},"modelConfig.claudeSonnet45.description":{english:"Balanced intelligence and speed for a wide range of tasks.",translated:"智能与速度的平衡，适用于广泛的任务。"},"modelConfig.claudeHaiku45.description":{english:"Fastest and most compact Claude model — ideal for high-throughput tasks.",translated:"最快且最紧凑的Claude模型 — 适合高吞吐量任务。"},"modelConfig.gpt53Chat.description":{english:"GPT-5.3 — enhanced reasoning and multimodal capabilities.",translated:"GPT-5.3 — 增强的推理和多模态能力。"},"modelConfig.gpt5.description":{english:"OpenAI's flagship next-generation model.",translated:"OpenAI的旗舰下一代模型。"},"modelConfig.gpt5Mini.description":{english:"Lightweight GPT-5 — efficient and fast for everyday tasks.",translated:"轻量级GPT-5 — 高效快速，适合日常任务。"},"modelConfig.gpt41.description":{english:"OpenAI GPT-4.1 — improved instruction following and reasoning.",translated:"OpenAI GPT-4.1 — 改进的指令遵循和推理。"},"modelConfig.gpt41Mini.description":{english:"Compact GPT-4.1 — faster and cheaper for simpler tasks.",translated:"紧凑的GPT-4.1 — 更快且更便宜，适合简单任务。"},"modelConfig.gpt4o.description":{english:"Most capable GPT-4 model, optimised for speed and cost.",translated:"最强大的GPT-4模型，优化了速度和成本。"},"modelConfig.gpt4oMini.description":{english:"Lightweight GPT-4o — faster and cheaper for simpler tasks.",translated:"轻量级GPT-4o — 更快且更便宜，适合简单任务。"},"modelConfig.gemini31Pro.description":{english:"Google Gemini 3.1 Pro (Preview) — most capable Gemini model with 1M context.",translated:"Google Gemini 3.1 Pro（预览）— 功能最强大的 Gemini 模型，支持 1M 上下文。"},"modelConfig.gemini3Flash.description":{english:"Google Gemini 3 Flash (Preview) — fast and efficient with 1M context.",translated:"Google Gemini 3 Flash（预览）— 快速高效，支持 1M 上下文。"},"modelConfig.gemini31FlashLite.description":{english:"Google Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite — lightweight, low-latency model with 1M context.",translated:"Google Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite — 轻量低延迟模型，支持 1M 上下文。"},"modelConfig.voiceworx.description":{english:"Internal voice-optimised assistant model.",translated:"内部语音优化助手模型。"},"modelConfig.auto.description":{english:"Auto selects the best model for your request based on capacity and performance.",translated:"Auto 根据容量和性能，自动为您的请求选择最佳模型。"},com_ui_model_coming_soon:{english:"Coming Soon",translated:"即将推出"},com_assistants_owners:{english:"Owners",translated:"Owners"},com_assistants_owner_added:{english:"Owner added successfully",translated:"Owner added successfully"},com_assistants_owner_removed:{english:"Owner removed successfully",translated:"Owner removed successfully"},com_assistants_owner_last_owner_error:{english:"Cannot remove the last owner of an assistant",translated:"Cannot remove the last owner of an assistant"},com_assistants_owner_email_placeholder:{english:"Add owner by email",translated:"Add owner by email"},com_ui_add:{english:"Add",translated:"Add"},com_ui_you:{english:"you",translated:"you"},com_assistants_owner_discard_warning:{english:"You have unsaved owner changes. Are you sure you want to discard them?",translated:"Unsaved changes will be discarded. Are you sure?"},com_ui_discard:{english:"Discard",translated:"Discard"},com_ui_keep_editing:{english:"Keep editing",translated:"Keep editing"},com_assistants_auto_weight_title:{english:"Auto routing preferences",translated:"自动路由偏好"},com_assistants_auto_weight_description:{english:"Tune how the Auto router balances cost, accuracy, and speed when picking a model for each turn. A higher slider value means a stronger preference for that factor — for example, raising Cost selects cheaper models more often. Sliders are relative; values do not need to sum to 100.",translated:"调整自动路由器在为每轮选择模型时如何权衡取舍。权重会被归一化——重要的是相对平衡。"},com_assistants_auto_weight_cost:{english:"Cost / token usage",translated:"成本"},com_assistants_auto_weight_cost_helper:{english:"Favor cheaper models with lower token cost. Move higher to prioritize cost over capability and latency.",translated:"优先选择令牌成本更低的便宜模型。"},com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy:{english:"Accuracy",translated:"准确性"},com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy_helper:{english:"Favor stronger models for complex reasoning.",translated:"优先选择更适合复杂推理的强大模型。"},com_assistants_auto_weight_speed:{english:"Speed",translated:"速度"},com_assistants_auto_weight_speed_helper:{english:"Favor faster, lower-latency models.",translated:"优先选择更快、延迟更低的模型。"},com_assistants_auto_weight_reset:{english:"Reset to defaults",translated:"恢复默认"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_timeout_error:{english:"File upload timed out. Please try again in a few minutes.",translated:"文件上传超时。请几分钟后重试。"},com_error_assistant_not_available:{english:"Something went wrong. Here's the specific error message we encountered: An error occurred while processing your request. The assistant is no longer available. Please contact the Admin.",translated:"出了点问题。以下是我们遇到的具体错误信息：处理您的请求时发生错误。该助手已不可用。请联系管理员。"},com_ui_code:{english:"Code",translated:"代码"},com_ui_assistant_share:{english:"Share",translated:"分享"},com_ui_assistant_share_link_copied:{english:"Link copied",translated:"链接已复制"},com_ui_assistant_no_access:{english:"You don't have access to this assistant",translated:"你无权访问此助手"},com_ui_copy_to_clipboard_error:{english:"Failed to copy link to clipboard",translated:"复制链接到剪贴板失败"},com_ui_preview_incomplete:{english:"Preview not available — content generation was not completed.",translated:"预览不可用—内容生成未完成。"},com_ui_view_code:{english:"View code",translated:"查看代码"},com_ui_preview_invalid:{english:"Preview not available — content is invalid.",translated:"无法预览 — 内容无效。"},com_assistants_pii_entity_phone:{english:"Phone Number",translated:"电话号码"},com_assistants_pii_entity_email:{english:"Email Address",translated:"电子邮件地址"},com_assistants_pii_entity_credit_card:{english:"Credit Card",translated:"信用卡"},com_assistants_pii_entity_ssn:{english:"SSN",translated:"社会安全号码"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_timeout_retrying:{english:"Upload is taking longer than expected - retrying ({0}/{1})...",translated:"上传时间超出预期 - 正在重试（{0}/{1}）..."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_connection_retrying:{english:"Connection issue - retrying ({0}/{1})...",translated:"连接出现问题 - 正在重试（{0}/{1}）..."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_connection_failed:{english:"Upload failed - please check your connection and try again",translated:"上传失败 - 请检查网络连接后重试"},com_assistants_memory_enabled:{english:"Memory",translated:"记忆"},com_assistants_memory_enabled_info:{english:"Memory is enabled for this assistant. The assistant can store and recall facts across conversations.",translated:"此助手已启用记忆。助手可跨对话存储并调用事实信息。"},com_assistants_memory_disabled_info:{english:"Memory is disabled for this assistant. No facts will be stored or recalled across conversations.",translated:"此助手已禁用记忆。不会跨对话存储或调用任何事实信息。"},com_assistants_memory_enabled_off_reason_placeholder:{english:"Please explain your business justification for disabling memory (required).",translated:"请说明禁用记忆的业务理由（必填）。"},com_assistants_memory_enabled_reason_required:{english:"Please provide a justification for disabling memory.",translated:"请提供禁用记忆的理由。"},com_nav_memory_team_disabled:{english:"Memory is disabled for your team. 