and cheaper for simpler tasks.",translated:"輕量級 GPT-4o — 更快且更便宜，適合簡單任務。"},"modelConfig.gemini31Pro.description":{english:"Google Gemini 3.1 Pro (Preview) — most capable Gemini model with 1M context.",translated:"Google Gemini 3.1 Pro（預覽）— 功能最強大的 Gemini 模型，支援 1M 上下文。"},"modelConfig.gemini3Flash.description":{english:"Google Gemini 3 Flash (Preview) — fast and efficient with 1M context.",translated:"Google Gemini 3 Flash（預覽）— 快速高效，支援 1M 上下文。"},"modelConfig.gemini31FlashLite.description":{english:"Google Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite — lightweight, low-latency model with 1M context.",translated:"Google Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite — 輕量低延遲模型，支援 1M 上下文。"},"modelConfig.voiceworx.description":{english:"Internal voice-optimised assistant model.",translated:"內部語音優化助手模型。"},"modelConfig.auto.description":{english:"Auto selects the best model for your request based on capacity and performance.",translated:"Auto 根據容量和效能，自動為您的要求選擇最佳模型。"},com_ui_model_coming_soon:{english:"Coming Soon",translated:"即將推出"},com_assistants_owners:{english:"Owners",translated:"Owners"},com_assistants_owner_added:{english:"Owner added successfully",translated:"Owner added successfully"},com_assistants_owner_removed:{english:"Owner removed successfully",translated:"Owner removed successfully"},com_assistants_owner_last_owner_error:{english:"Cannot remove the last owner of an assistant",translated:"Cannot remove the last owner of an assistant"},com_assistants_owner_email_placeholder:{english:"Add owner by email",translated:"Add owner by email"},com_ui_add:{english:"Add",translated:"Add"},com_ui_you:{english:"you",translated:"you"},com_assistants_owner_discard_warning:{english:"You have unsaved owner changes. Are you sure you want to discard them?",translated:"Unsaved changes will be discarded. Are you sure?"},com_ui_discard:{english:"Discard",translated:"Discard"},com_ui_keep_editing:{english:"Keep editing",translated:"Keep editing"},com_assistants_auto_weight_title:{english:"Auto routing preferences",translated:"自動路由偏好設定"},com_assistants_auto_weight_description:{english:"Tune how the Auto router balances cost, accuracy, and speed when picking a model for each turn. A higher slider value means a stronger preference for that factor — for example, raising Cost selects cheaper models more often. Sliders are relative; values do not need to sum to 100.",translated:"調整自動路由器在每次選擇模型時如何權衡取捨。權重會標準化——重要的是相對平衡。"},com_assistants_auto_weight_cost:{english:"Cost / token usage",translated:"成本"},com_assistants_auto_weight_cost_helper:{english:"Favor cheaper models with lower token cost. Move higher to prioritize cost over capability and latency.",translated:"偏好 token 成本較低的便宜模型。"},com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy:{english:"Accuracy",translated:"準確性"},com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy_helper:{english:"Favor stronger models for complex reasoning.",translated:"偏好更適合複雜推理的強大模型。"},com_assistants_auto_weight_speed:{english:"Speed",translated:"速度"},com_assistants_auto_weight_speed_helper:{english:"Favor faster, lower-latency models.",translated:"偏好更快、延遲更低的模型。"},com_assistants_auto_weight_reset:{english:"Reset to defaults",translated:"重設為預設值"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_timeout_error:{english:"File upload timed out. Please try again in a few minutes.",translated:"檔案上傳逾時。請在幾分鐘後再試一次。"},com_error_assistant_not_available:{english:"Something went wrong. Here's the specific error message we encountered: An error occurred while processing your request. The assistant is no longer available. Please contact the Admin.",translated:"發生錯誤。以下是我們遇到的具體錯誤訊息：處理您的請求時發生錯誤。此助理已無法使用。請聯絡管理員。"},com_ui_code:{english:"Code",translated:"程式碼"},com_ui_assistant_share:{english:"Share",translated:"分享"},com_ui_assistant_share_link_copied:{english:"Link copied",translated:"連結已複製"},com_ui_assistant_no_access:{english:"You don't have access to this assistant",translated:"您沒有權限存取此助理"},com_ui_copy_to_clipboard_error:{english:"Failed to copy link to clipboard",translated:"無法將連結複製到剪貼簿"},com_ui_preview_incomplete:{english:"Preview not avai