  Uma kungacacisiwe, kuzosebenzisa okuzenzakalelayo kwesistimu ngokusekelwe kosayizi wesiqubulo samamodeli aziwayo. Ukusetha amanani aphezulu kungaholela kumaphutha kanye/noma izindleko eziphezulu zamathokheni.`,com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_placeholder:"Setha imiyalo yangokwezifiso noma uhlaka. Kunganakwa uma kungenalutho.",com_endpoint_instructions_assistants_placeholder:"Kudlula imiyalelo ye-assistant. Lokhu kuyasiza ekuguquleni ukuziphatha ngokusekelwe ekusebenzeni ngakunye.",com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_assistants_placeholder:"Beka imiyalelo eyengeziwe noma umongo ngaphezu kwemiyalelo eyinhloko ye-Assistant. Kuyahoxiswa uma kungenalutho.",com_endpoint_custom_name:"Igama Elenziwe Ngokwezifiso",com_endpoint_prompt_prefix:"Imiyalelo Ngokwezifiso",com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_assistants:"Imiyalelo Eyengeziwe",com_endpoint_instructions_assistants:"Dlula Imiyalelo",com_endpoint_temperature:"Izinga Lokushisa",com_endpoint_default:"okuzenzakalelayo",com_endpoint_top_p:"I-Top P",com_endpoint_top_k:"I-Top K",com_endpoint_max_output_tokens:"Inani Eliphezulu Lama-Output Tokens",com_endpoint_stop:"Misa Iziqu",com_endpoint_stop_placeholder:"Hlukanisa amanani ngokucindezela `Enter`",com_endpoint_openai_max_tokens:"Inkambu yokuzikhethela `max_tokens`, emelela inani eliphezulu lama-tokens angakhiqizwa ekuphothulweni kwengxoxo.\n\nUbude obuphelele bama-tokens wokufaka nama-tokens akhiqiziwe bukhawulwe ubude bomongo bemodeli. Ungase uhlangabezane namaphutha uma leli nani lidlula ama-tokens omongo omkhulu.",com_endpoint_openai_temp:"Amanani aphezulu = angahleliwe kakhulu, kanti amanani aphansi = agxile kakhulu futhi anqume. Sincoma ukuguqula lokhu noma i-Top P kodwa hhayi kokubili.",com_endpoint_openai_max:"Ama-tokens aphezulu okuzikhiqiza. Ubude obuphelele bama-tokens wokufaka nama-tokens akhiqiziwe bukhawulwe ubude bomongo bemodeli.",com_endpoint_openai_topp:"Enye indlela yokusampula nge-temperature, ebizwa ngokuthi i-nucleus sampling, lapho imodeli icabangela imiphumela yama-tokens anomthamo we-top_p probability. Ngakho 0.1 kusho ukuthi kuphela ama-tokens ahlanganisa ama-10% probability mass aphezulu acatshangelwa. Sincoma ukuguqula lokhu noma izinga lokushisa kodwa hhayi kokubili.",com_endpoint_openai_freq:"Inombolo phakathi kuka-0 no-2.0. Amanani amahle ahlulela ama-tokens amasha ngokusekelwe ekubeni khona kwawo embhalweni kuze kube manje, anciphisa amathuba emodeli okuphinda umugqa ofanayo.",com_endpoint_openai_pres:"Inombolo phakathi kuka-0 no-2.0. Amanani amahle ahlulela ama-tokens amasha ngokusekelwe ekubonakaleni kwawo embhalweni kuze kube manje, andisa amathuba emodeli okukhuluma ngezihloko ezintsha.",com_endpoint_openai_resend_files:"Thumela kabusha wonke amafayela anamathelwe ngaphambili. Qaphela: lokhu kuzokwandisa izindleko zama-tokens futhi ungase uhlangabezane namaphutha ngokunamathela okuningi.",com_endpoint_openai_detail:'Isinqumo sezicelo ze-Vision. "Low" ishibhile futhi iyashesha, "High" inemininingwane eningi futhi ibiza kakhulu, kanti "Auto" izokhetha ngokuzenzakalelayo phakathi kwalokhu okubili ngokusekelwe kusinqumo sesithombe.',com_endpoint_openai_stop:"Kuze kufike ku-4 iziqu lapho i-API izoyeka ukukhiqiza ama-tokens engeziwe.",com_endpoint_openai_custom_name_placeholder:"Beka igama elenziwe ngokwezifiso le-iXHello",com_endpoint_openai_prompt_prefix_placeholder:"Beka imiyalelo eyenziwe ngokwezifiso okufanele ifakwe kuMlayezo Wesistimu. Okuzenzakalelayo: akukho",com_endpoint_frequency_penalty:"Isijeziso Sokuphindaphinda",com_endpoint_presence_penalty:"Isijeziso Sobukhona",com_endpoint_plug_use_functions:"Sebenzisa Imisebenzi",com_endpoint_plug_resend_files:"Thumela Kabusha Amafayela",com_endpoint_plug_image_detail:"Imininingwane Yesithombe",com_endpoint_plug_skip_completion:"Dlula Ukuqeda",com_endpoint_plug_set_custom_instructions_for_gpt_placeholder:"Setha imiyalelo yangokwezifiso yokufaka kuMlayezo Wesistimu. Okuzenzakalelayo: akukho",com_endpoint_import:"Ngenisa",com_endpoint_set_custom_name:"Setha igama elenziwe ngokwezifiso, uma ungathola le preset",com_endpoint_preset_delete_confirm:"Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukususa le preset?",com_endpoint_preset_import:"I-Preset Ingenisiwe!",com_endpoint_preset_import_error:"Kube nephutha ekungeniseni i-preset yakho. Sicela uzame futhi.",com_endpoint_preset_save_error:"Kube nephutha ekulondolozeni i-preset yakho. Sicela uzame futhi.",com_endpoint_preset_delete_error:"Kube nephutha ekusuleni i-preset yakho. Sicela uzame futhi.",com_endpoint_preset_default_removed:"akuseyona i-preset ezenzakalelayo.",com_endpoint_preset_default_item:"Okuzenzakalelayo:",com_endpoint_preset_default_none:"Ayikho i-preset ezenzakalelayo esebenzayo.",com_endpoint_preset_title:"I-Preset",com_endpoint_preset_saved:"Kulondoloziwe!",com_endpoint_preset_default:"manje iyipreset ezenzakalelayo.",com_endpoint_preset:"ipreset",com_endpoint_presets:"amapreset",com_endpoint_preset_selected_title:"Isebenzayo!",com_endpoint_preset_name:"Igama Le-Preset",com_endpoint:"I-Endpoint",com_endpoint_examples:"Amapreset",com_endpoint_export:"Thumela",com_endpoint_export_share:"Thumela/Yabelana",com_endpoint_assistant:"Umxhumanisi",com_endpoint_use_active_assistant:"Sebenzisa Umxhumanisi Osebenzayo",com_endpoint_save_as_preset:"Londoloza Njenge-Preset",com_endpoint_presets_clear_warning:"Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukususa wonke ama-preset? Lokhu akuguquki.",com_endpoint_no_presets:"Awekho ama-preset okwamanje, sebenzisa inkinobho yezilungiselelo ukudala eyodwa",com_endpoint_my_preset:"I-Preset Yami",com_endpoint_agent_model:"Imodeli Ye-Agent (Kunconyiwe: GPT-3.5)",com_endpoint_completion_model:"Imodeli Yokuphelelisa (Kunconyiwe: GPT-4)",com_endpoint_func_hover:"Vumela ukusetshenziswa kweziqeshana njengezisebenzi ze-OpenAI",com_endpoint_skip_hover:"Vumela ukweqa isinyathelo sokuphelelisa, esibuyekeza impendulo yokugcina nezinyathelo ezikhiqiziwe",com_endpoint_assistant_placeholder:"Sicela ukhethe Umxhumanisi bese uqala ingxoxo entsha",com_endpoint_config_placeholder:"Setha Ukhiye wakho kumen