Kuhlaziywa",com_ui_finished_analyzing:"Kuqediwe ukuhlaziya",com_ui_warning:"Isixwayiso",com_ui_proceed:"Qhubeka",com_ui_file_upload_warning:"Amafayela alayishiwe kumsebenzi asetshenziselwa izinhloso zengxoxo kuphela. Abasebenzisi bangathola okuqukethwe kwalawa mafayela ngokubuza imibuzo efanele, kodwa ukulanda ngqo amafayela akuvunyelwe.",com_endpoint_preset_name_placeholder:"Setha igama elenziwe ngokwezifiso lesi sethenjwa",com_endpoint_example_input_placeholder:"Setha isibonelo sokufaka. Isibonelo siyashiywa uma singekho.",com_endpoint_example_output_placeholder:"Setha isibonelo sokukhipha. Isibonelo siyashiywa uma singekho.",com_nav_export_select_type:"Khetha uhlobo lwefayela",com_nav_export_type_screenshot:"isithombe-skrini (.png)",com_nav_export_type_text:"umbhalo (.txt)",com_nav_export_type_markdown:"markdown (.md)",com_nav_export_type_json:"json (.json)",com_nav_export_type_csv:"csv (.csv)",com_ui_error_empty_agent_response:"Ayikho impendulo etholakele. Sicela uzame ukuthumela umlayezo wakho futhi. Uma inkinga iqhubeka ngemuva kokulayisha kabusha ikhasi nokuzama futhi, sicela uthinte ukwesekwa.",com_ui_back_to_chat:"Buyela kuChat",com_assistants_guardrail_moderation:"Ukulawula Okuphakathi",com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_enabled_info:"Ukulawula okuphakathi kusebenze kule assistant. Okuqukethwe kuzohlolwa ngokumelene nezinqubomgomo zokulawula.",com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_disabled_info:"Ukukhubaza ukulawula okuphakathi kususa ukuhlolwa kokuqukethwe kule assistant. Unesibopho sokuhambisana nezinqubomgomo zokuqukethwe zenhlangano yakho. Umsebenzi uqoshwa ngokuphelele futhi uyalandelwa.",com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_off_reason_placeholder:"Sicela uchaze isizathu sakho sebhizinisi sokukhubaza ukulawula okuphakathi (kuyadingeka).",com_assistants_guardrail_moderation_reason_required:"Sicela unikeze isizathu sokukhubaza ukulawula okuphakathi.",com_assistants_allow_model_switching:"Vumela abasebenzisi ukushintsha imodeli engxoxweni",com_ui_feedback_good:"Impendulo enhle",com_ui_feedback_bad:"Impendulo embi",com_ui_feedback_comments:"Amazwana",com_ui_feedback_comments_optional:"Amazwana (kuzikhetha)",com_ui_feedback_placeholder:"Sitshele kabanzi ngokuhlangatshezwa kwakho...",com_ui_feedback_submit:"Thumela",com_ui_feedback_error:"Besingakwazi ukuthumela impendulo yakho",com_ui_feedback_reason_incorrect:"Akuyiqiniso",com_ui_feedback_reason_not_relevant:"Akuhlobene",com_ui_feedback_reason_outdated:"Sekwedlule isikhathi",com_ui_feedback_reason_not_enough_detail:"Imininingwane ayenele",com_ui_feedback_reason_other:"Okunye",com_ui_model_recommended:"Kunconyiwe",com_ui_model_legacy:"Indabuko — sicela ubuyekeze",com_ui_model_legacy_invalid:"Lo modeli awusekelwa. Sicela ukhethe imodeli yamanje.",com_nav_setting_memory:"Inkumbulo",com_nav_memory_description:"Phatha amaqiniso omuntu siqu umsizi awakhumbulayo ezingxoxweni zakho.",com_nav_memory_add_placeholder:"Engeza inkumbulo entsha…",com_nav_memory_add_button:"Engeza inkumbulo",com_nav_memory_category:"Isigaba",com_nav_memory_category_preference:"Okuncanyelwayo",com_nav_memory_category_identity:"Ubunikazi",com_nav_memory_category_context:"Uhlaka",com_nav_memory_category_project:"Iphrojekthi",com_nav_memory_empty_title:"Azikho izinkumbulo okwamanje",com_nav_memory_empty_description:"Izinkumbulo ozilondolozayo zizovela lapha futhi zisize ukwenza izingxoxo zesikhathi esizayo zibe ngokwakho.",com_nav_memory_load_error:"Kwehlulekile ukulayisha izinkumbulo. Sicela uzame futhi.",com_nav_memory_retry:"Zama futhi",com_nav_memory_add_error:"Kwehlulekile ukwengeza inkumbulo. Sicela uzame futhi.",com_nav_memory_update_error:"Kwehlulekile ukuvuselela inkumbulo. Sicela uzame futhi.",com_nav_memory_delete_error:"Kwehlulekile ukususa inkumbulo. Sicela uzame futhi.",com_nav_memory_delete_confirm:"Susa le nkumbulo?",com_nav_memory_delete_button:"Susa",com_nav_memory_edit_aria:"Hlela inkumbulo",com_nav_memory_delete_aria:"Susa inkumbulo",com_nav_memory_save:"Londoloza",com_nav_memory_cancel:"Khansela",com_nav_memory_saved_at:"Kulondolozwe {0}","modelConfig.gpt55.description":"GPT-5.5 — imodeli yakamuva yokucabanga ye-GPT-5 enenhlalo-bulimede entsha.","modelConfig.gpt54Mini.description":"GPT-5.4 Mini — uhlobo oluncane nolonga izindleko lwe-GPT-5.4.","modelConfig.gpt54.description":"GPT-5.4 — imodeli yakamuva ye-GPT-5.","modelConfig.claudeOpus46.description":"Opus yakamuva — ubuhlakani obuphambili bokuhlela ama-ejenti nezinhlelo zebhizinisi.","modelConfig.claudeOpus47.description":"Opus yakamuva — ubuhlakani obuphambili bokuhlela ama-ejenti nezinhlelo zebhizinisi.","modelConfig.claudeSonnet46.description":"I-Sonnet ethuthukisiwe enokucabanga okungcono nokulandela imiyalelo.","modelConfig.claudeOpus45.description":"Imodeli enamandla ka-Anthropic yemisebenzi eyinkimbinkimbi, enezinyathelo eziningi.","modelConfig.claudeSonnet45.description":"Ubuhlakani obulinganiselayo nesivinini semisebenzi ehlukahlukene.","modelConfig.claudeHaiku45.description":"Imodeli ye-Claude esheshayo futhi encane kakhulu — ilungele imisebenzi enezinga eliphezulu.","modelConfig.gpt53Chat.description":"GPT-5.3 — ukucabanga okuthuthukisiwe namakhono amaningi.","modelConfig.gpt5.description":"Imodeli yesizukulwane esilandelayo ye-OpenAI.","modelConfig.gpt5Mini.description":"I-GPT-5 elula — esebenza kahle futhi esheshayo yemisebenzi yansuku zonke.","modelConfig.gpt41.description":"I-OpenAI GPT-4.1 — ukulandela imiyalelo nokucabanga okuthuthukisiwe.","modelConfig.gpt41Mini.description":"I-GPT-4.1 encane — esheshayo futhi eshibhile yemisebenzi elula.","modelConfig.gpt4o.description":"Imodeli ye-GPT-4 ekwazi kakhulu, eyenziwe kahle ngesivinini nezindleko.","modelConfig.gpt4oMini.description":"I-GPT-4o elula — esheshayo futhi eshibhile yemisebenzi elula.","modelConfig.gemini31Pro.description":"Google Gemini 3.1 Pro (Ukubona Kwangaphambilini) — imodeli ye-Gemini enamandla kakhulu nge-1M context.","modelConfig.gemini3Flash.description":"Google Gemini 3 Flash (Ukubona Kwangaphambilini) — isheshayo futhi isebenza kahle nge-1M context.","modelConfig.gemini31FlashLite.description":"Google Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite — imodeli elula enokuconsa okuncane nge-1M context.","modelConfig.voiceworx.description":"Imodeli yomxhumanisi yangaphakathi eyenziwe kahle ngezwi.","modelConfig.auto.description":"I-Auto ikhetha imodeli engcono kakhulu yesicelo sakho ngokusekelwe kwizinga namandla.",com_ui_model_coming_soon:"Kuyeza maduze",com_assistants_owners:"Owners",com_assistants_owner_added:"Owner added successfully",com_assistants_owner_removed:"Owner removed successfully",com_assistants_owner_last_owner_error:"Cannot remove the last owner of an assistant",com_assistants_owner_email_placeholder:"Add owner by email",com_ui_add:"Add",com_ui_you:"you",com_assistants_add_owners:"Add owners",com_assistants_owner_search_placeholder:"Search by name or email (min. 3 characters)",com_assistants_owner_search_hint:"Type at least 3 characters to search",com_assistants_owner_no_results:"No users found",com_assistants_owner_discard_warning:"Unsaved changes will be discarded. Are you sure?",com_assistants_owners_saved:"Owners updated successfully",com_assistants_save_owners:"Save owners",com_assistants_pending_additions:"Pending additions",com_ui_saving:"Saving...",com_ui_discard:"Discard",com_ui_keep_editing:"Keep editing",com_ui_undo:"Undo",com_assistants_auto_weight_title:"Okuncanyelwayo komzila ozenzakalelayo",com_assistants_auto_weight_description:"Lungisa indlela umzila ozenzakalelayo olinganisa ngayo ukuhwebelana lapho ukhetha imodeli emjikelezweni ngamunye. Izisindo ziyalinganiswa — okubalulekile ibhalansi ehlobene.",com_assistants_auto_weight_cost:"Izindleko",com_assistants_auto_weight_cost_helper:"Ncika kumamodeli ashibhile anezindleko eziphansi zamathokheni.",com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy:"Ukunemba",com_assistants_auto_weight_accuracy_helper:"Ncika kumamodeli anamandla okucabanga okuyinkimbinkimbi.",com_assistants_auto_weight_speed:"Isivinini",com_assistants_auto_weight_speed_helper:"Ncika kumamodeli asheshayo anokubambezeleka okuphansi.",com_assistants_auto_weight_reset:"Setha kabusha kokumisiwe",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_timeout_error:"Ukulayishwa kwefayela kuphelelwe isikhathi. Sicela uzame futhi emizuzwini embalwa.",com_error_assistant_not_available:"Kukhona okungahambanga kahle. Nawu umlayezo wephutha othile esihlangabezane nawo: Kube nephutha ngenkathi kucutshungulwa isicelo sakho. Umsizi akasatholakali. Sicela uxhumane noMlawuli.",com_ui_code:"Ikhodi",com_ui_assistant_share:"Yabelana",com_ui_assistant_share_link_copied:"Isixhumanisi sikopishiwe",com_ui_assistant_no_access:"Awunakho ukufinyelela kulo msizi",com_ui_copy_to_clipboard_error:"Kwehlulekile ukukopisha isixhumanisi ebhodini lokunamathisela",com_ui_preview_incomplete:"Ukubuka kuqala akutholakali — ukudalwa kokuqukethwe akuphelanga.",com_ui_view_code:"Buka ikhodi",com_ui_preview_invalid:"Ukubuka kuqala akutholakali — okuqukethwe akuvumelekile.",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_timeout_retrying:"Ukulayisha kuthatha isikhathi eside kunokulindelekile - kuzanywa futhi ({0}/{1})...",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_connection_retrying:"Inkinga yoxhumano - kuzanywa futhi ({0}/{1})...",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_connection_failed:"Ukulayisha kwehlulekile - sicela uhlole uxhumano lwakho bese uzama futhi",com_ui_assistant_tools_codeexecutor:"Kusetshenziswa ikhodi yakho",com_ui_assistant_tools_rag_query:"Kuseshwa isizindalwazi solwazi",com_ui_assistant_tools_voiceworx:"Kucutshungulwa izwi",com_ui_assistant_tools_memory_store:"Kulondolozwa enkumbulweni",com_ui_assistant_tools_memory_delete:"Kususwa enkumbulweni",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_search_online:"Kuqediwe ukusesha iwebhu",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_browse_website:"Kuqediwe ukubuyekeza ikhasi lewebhu",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_generate_image:"Isithombe sikhiqiziwe",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_calculate_math:"Kuqediwe ukubala",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_codeexecutor:"Kuqediwe ukusebenzisa ikhodi yakho",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_rag_query:"Kuqediwe ukusesha isizindalwazi solwazi",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_voiceworx:"Kuqediwe ukucutshungulwa kokufakwa kwezwi",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_memory_store:"Kulondolozwe enkumbulweni",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_memory_delete:"Kususwe enkumbulweni",com_ui_assistant_tools_completed_fallback:"Kuqediwe: {0}",com_ui_still_working:"kusasebenza...",com_assistants_pii_entity_phone:"Inombolo Yocingo",com_assistants_pii_entity_email:"Ikheli Le-imeyili",com_assistants_pii_entity_credit_card:"Ikhadi Lesikweletu",com_assistants_pii_entity_ssn:"Inombolo Yokuzazisa",com_assistants_memory_enabled:"Inkumbulo",com_assistants_memory_enabled_info:"Inkumbulo ivuliwe kulo msizi. Umsizi angagcina futhi akhumbule amaqiniso ezingxoxweni ezahlukene.",com_assistants_memory_disabled_info:"Inkumbulo ivaliwe kulo msizi. Awekho amaqiniso azogcinwa noma akhunjulwe ezingxoxweni ezahlukene.",com_assistants_memory_enabled_off_reason_placeholder:"Sicela uchaze isizathu sebhizinisi sokukhubaza inkumbulo (kuyadingeka).",com_assistants_memory_enabled_reason_required:"Sicela unikeze isizathu sokukhubaza inkumbulo.",com_nav_memory_team_disabled:"Inkumbulo ivaliwe eqenjini lakho. Ungabuka futhi ususe izinkumbulo ezikhona, kodwa awukwazi ukwengeza noma ukuhlela ezintsha.",com_ui_file_ready:"{0} isilungile",com_ui_file_ready_fallback:"Ifayela selilungile",com_ui_file_processing_failed:"{0} ayikwazanga ukucutshungulwa",com_ui_file_processing_failed_fallback:"Ifayela alikwazanga ukucutshungulwa",com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload:"{0} ayikwazanga ukucutshungulwa. Sicela ulayishe kabusha ifayela.",com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload_fallback:"Ifayela alikwazanga ukucutshungulwa. Sicela ulayishe kabusha ifayela.",com_ui_file_processing:"Iyacutshungulwa...",com_ui_file_processing_failed_status:"Ukucutshungulwa kwehlulekile",com_ui_file_processing_failed_reupload_required:"Kwehlulekile - kudingeka ulayishe futhi",com_ui_file_retry:"Zama futhi",com_ui_file_retry_in:"Zama futhi emizuzwaneni engu-{0}",com_ui_file_indexing_retrying:"Kuzanywa futhi ukuhlelwa kwefayela...",com_ui_file_retry_wait:"Sicela ulinde imizuzwana engu-{0} ngaphambi kokuzama futhi",com_ui_file_retries_exhausted_reupload:"Inani eliphezulu lokuzama futhi lifinyelelwe. Sicela ulayishe ifayela futhi.",com_ui_assistant_file_upload_invalid_json:"Ifayela le-JSON elingavumelekile. Okuqukethwe kwefayela akuhambisani nesakhiwo esilindelekile."},Ob={com_error_moderation:{english:"It appears that the content submitted has been flagged by our moderation system for not aligning with our community guidelines. We're unable to proceed with this specific topic. If you have any other questions or topics you'd like to explore, please edit your message, or create a new conversation.",translated:"Kubukeka sengathi okuqukethwe okuthunyelwe kubonwe uhlelo lwethu lokuhlola ngenxa yokungahambisani nemigomo yomphakathi wethu. Asikwazi ukuqhubeka nalesi sihloko esithile. Uma uneminye imibuzo noma izihloko ofuna ukuzihlola, sicela uhlele umlayezo wakho, noma wenze ingxoxo entsha."},com_error_no_user_key:{english:"No key found. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"Akukho okhiye otholiwe. Sicela unikeze okhiye bese uzama futhi."},com_error_no_base_url:{english:"No base URL found. Please provide one and try again.",translated:"Akukho i-URL eyisisekelo etholakele. Sicela unikeze eyodwa bese uzama futhi."},com_error_invalid_user_key:{english:"Invalid key provided. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"Okhiye onikeziwe awuvumelekile. Sicela unikeze okhiye bese uzama futhi."},com_error_expired_user_key:{english:"Provided key for {0} expired at {1}. Please provide a key and try again.",translated:"Okhiye onikezwe ku-{0} uphelelwe yisikhathi ngo-{1}. Sicela unikeze okhiye bese uzama futhi."},com_error_token_balance_exceeded:{english:"You've reached your monthly usage limit. Please contact the team admin for assistance.",translated:"Ufinyelele umkhawulo wakho wokusetshenziswa kwenyanga. Sicela uxhumane nomphathi weqembu ukuze uthole usizo."},com_error_token_balance_exceeded_license:{english:"You've reached the maximum tokens for your license. Please contact sales at {0} for further assistance.",translated:"Ufinyelele inani eliphezulu lamathokheni elayisensi yakho. Sicela uxhumane nabadayisi ku-{0} ukuze uthole usizo."},com_error_token_balance_percent_used:{english:"You have used {0}% of your allotted tokens. Please contact {1} for further assistance.",translated:"Usebenzise u-{0}% wamathokheni akho anikeziwe. Sicela uxhumane no-{1} ukuze uthole usizo."},com_error_license_expired:{english:"Your License is not available. Please contact support for further assistance.",translated:"Ilayisensi yakho ayitholakali. Sicela uxhumane nokwesekwa ukuze uthole usizo."},com_restricted_invalid_ip_format:{english:"IPv6 addresses are not supported. Please use an IPv4 connection or contact support for further assistance.",translated:"Amakheli e-IPv6 awasekelwa. Sicela usebenzise uxhumano lwe-IPv4 noma uxhumane nokwesekwa ukuze uthole usizo."},com_error_tool_run:{english:"An error occurred while processing your request. Please try again.",translated:"Kube nephutha ngenkathi kucutshungulwa isicelo sakho. Sicela uzame futhi."},com_files_upload_duplicate_success:{english:"File {0} was already uploaded successfully",translated:"Ifayela {0} selivele lilayishiwe ngempumelelo"},com_files_no_results:{english:"No results.",translated:"Azikho iziphumo."},com_files_filter:{english:"Search files by name",translated:"Sesha amafayela ngegama"},com_files_number_selected:{english:"{0} of {1} file(s) selected",translated:"{0} kwama-{1} ifayela(i) elikhethiwe"},com_sidepanel_select_assistant:{english:"Select an Assistant",translated:"Khetha Umsizi"},com_sidepanel_parameters:{english:"Parameters",translated:"Amapharamitha"},com_ui_create_assistant:{english:"Create Assistant",translated:"Dala Umsizi"},com_ui_create_assistant_permission_needed:{english:"User needs create permissions to create an Assistant",translated:"Umsebenzisi udinga izimvume zokudala ukuze adale Umsizi"},com_sidepanel_assistant_builder:{english:"Assistants",translated:"Abasizi"},com_sidepanel_attach_files:{english:"File Manager",translated:"Uphathimafayela"},com_sidepanel_manage_files:{english:"Manage Files",translated:"Phatha Amafayela"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_title:{english:"Consent",translated:"Imvume"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_1:{english:"You are about to share this assistant with other team members. Before sharing this assistant, please review the key points below:",translated:"Usuzokwenza lo msizi utholakale kwamanye amalungu eqembu. Ngaphambi kokwabelana ngalo msizi, sicela ubuyekeze amaphuzu abalulekile ngezansi:"},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_description_2:{english:"By proceeding, you confirm that you understand and accept these terms.",translated:"Ngokuqhubeka, uyaqinisekisa ukuthi uyakuqonda futhi uyayamukela le migomo."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_1:{english:"Shared assistant should not contain sensitive or confidential data.",translated:"Umsebenzi ohlanganyelwe akufanele uqukathe idatha ebucayi noma eyimfihlo."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_2:{english:"Shared assistants must not process sensitive or confidential data.",translated:"Abasizi ababelwe akufanele basebenze idatha ebucayi noma eyimfihlo."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_3:{english:"Sharing implies accountability and responsibility for the content and access.",translated:"Ukwabelana kusho isibopho nokuqondisa ngokuqukethwe nokufinyelela."},com_assistants_shared_with_consent_bullet_4:{english:" It is recommended to share with a specific team or closed group instead of everyone.",translated:"Kunconywa ukwabelana neqembu elithile noma iqembu elivaliwe kunokuthi wonke umuntu."},com_button_accept:{english:"Accept",translated:"Yamukela"},com_button_decline:{english:"Decline",translated:"Nqaba"},com_assistants_capabilities:{english:"Knowledgebase",translated:"Ulwazi"},com_assistants_file_search:{english:"File Search",translated:"Ukusesha Amafayela"},com_assistants_file_search_description:{english:"Add files you need your assistant to search from when responding to questions in chat.",translated:"Faka lapha amafayela ofuna umsizi wakho awaseshe uma ephendula imibuzo engxoxweni."},com_assistants_file_search_supported_label:{english:"Supported:",translated:"Kusekelwa:"},com_assistants_file_search_supported:{english:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts.",translated:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts."},com_assistants_file_search_tips_label:{english:"Tip:",translated:"Iseluleko:"},com_assistants_file_search_tips:{english:"Ask your assistant to use the 'File Search Tool' every time it responds to users.",translated:"Cela umsizi wakho ukuthi asebenzise 'Ithuluzi Lokusesha Amafayela' njalo uma ephendula abasebenzisi."},com_assistants_file_search_info:{english:"Attaching vector stores for File Search is not yet supported. You can attach them from the Provider Playground or attach files to messages for file search on a thread basis.",translated:"Ukuxhuma izitolo ze-vector zokusesha amafayela akusekelwa okwamanje. Ungazixhuma ku-Provider Playground noma unamathisele amafayela emilayezweni ukuze useshe amafayela ngokusekelwe kuthreada."},com_assistants_file_search_fetch_error:{english:"Something went wrong when fetching files from the vector stores.",translated:"Kukhona okungahambi kahle ekutholeni amafayela ezitolo ze-vector."},com_assistants_knowledge:{english:"Knowledgebase",translated:"Ulwazi"},com_assistants_knowledge_info:{english:"Upload files to your assistant, so it can use them to answer questions (i.e. CXNGPT User Guide)",translated:"Layisha amafayela kumsebenzi wakho ukuze akwazi ukuwasebenzisa ukuphendula imibuzo (isb. Umhlahlandlela Womsebenzisi we-CXNGPT)."},com_assistants_knowledge_disabled:{english:"Click Create to save your Assistant, then upload your files, and click Save.",translated:"Chofoza Dala ukuze ulondoloze Umsizi wakho, bese ulayisha amafayela akho, bese uchofoza Londoloza."},com_assistants_image_vision:{english:"Image Vision",translated:"Umbono Wesithombe"},com_assistants_code_interpreter:{english:"Code Interpreter",translated:"Umhumushi Wekhowudi"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_description:{english:"Add files you need your assistant to use to analyze or transform data for every chat.",translated:"Faka lapha amafayela ofuna umsizi wakho awasebenzise ukuhlaziya noma ukuguqula idatha kuyo yonke ingxoxo."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported_label:{english:"Supported:",translated:"Kusekelwa:"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_supported:{english:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts, csv, jpeg, jpg, gif, png, tar, xlsx, xml, zip.",translated:"c, cpp, docx, html, java, json, md, pdf, php, pptx, py, rb, tex, txt, css, js, ts, csv, jpeg, jpg, gif, png, tar, xlsx, xml, zip."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips_label:{english:"Tips:",translated:"Izinyathelo:"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_tips:{english:"Ask your assistant to use the 'Code Interpreter Tool' every time it responds to users.",translated:"Cela umsizi wakho ukuthi asebenzise 'Ithuluzi Lomhumushi Wekhowudi' njalo uma ephendula abasebenzisi."},com_assistants_code_interpreter_files_counter:{english:"{0} of {1} files uploaded",translated:"{0} kwe-{1} amafayela alayishiwe"},com_assistants_code_interpreter_files:{english:"The following files are only available for Code Interpreter:",translated:"Lawa mafayela alandelayo atholakala kuphela ku-Code Interpreter:"},com_assistants_retrieval:{english:"Retrieval",translated:"Ukuthola"},com_assistants_search_name:{english:"Search assistants by name",translated:"Sesha abasizi ngegama"},com_assistants_tools:{english:"Tools",translated:"Amathuluzi"},com_assistants_actions:{english:"Actions",translated:"Izenzo"},com_assistants_add_tools:{english:"Add Tools",translated:"Engeza Amathuluzi"},com_assistants_add_actions:{english:"Add Actions",translated:"Engeza Izenzo"},com_assistants_non_retrieval_model:{english:"File search is not enabled on this model. Please select another model.",translated:"Ukusesha amafayela akuvunyelwe kule modeli. Sicela ukhethe enye imodeli."},com_assistants_available_actions:{english:"Available Actions",translated:"Izenzo Ezitholakalayo"},com_assistants_running_action:{english:"Running action",translated:"Izenzo eziqhubekayo"},com_assistants_completed_action:{english:"Talked to {0}",translated:"Ukukhuluma no-{0}"},com_assistants_completed_function:{english:"Ran {0}",translated:"Kwenziwe {0}"},com_assistants_completed_with_file_search:{english:"Used File Search",translated:"Kusetshenziswe Ukusesha Amafayela"},com_assistants_function_use:{english:"Assistant used {0}",translated:"Umsizi usebenzise {0}"},com_assistants_function_browsewbsite_error_100:{english:"[error processing tool] Failed to fetch the contents of the given website. [100]",translated:"[iphutha lokucubungula ithuluzi] Yehlulekile ukuthola okuqukethwe kwewebhusayithi enikeziwe. [100]"},com_assistants_function_browsewbsite_error_101:{english:"[error processing tool] Failed to fetch the contents of the given website. [101]",translated:"[iphutha lokucubungula ithuluzi] Yehlulekile ukuthola okuqukethwe kwewebhusayithi enikeziwe. [101]"},com_assistants_domain_info:{english:"Assistant sent this info to {0}",translated:"Umsizi uthumele lolu lwazi ku-{0}"},com_assistants_delete_permission_title:{english:"Deleting only allowed with private Assistants",translated:"Ukususa kuvunyelwe kuphela kubasizi abazimele"},com_assistants_delete_actions_success:{english:"Successfully deleted Action from Assistant",translated:"Impumelelo ukususa Isenzo kuMsizi"},com_assistants_update_actions_success:{english:"Successfully created or updated Action",translated:"Impumelelo ukudala noma ukuvuselela Isenzo"},com_assistants_update_actions_error:{english:"There was an error creating or updating the action.",translated:"Kube nephutha ekudaleni noma ekuvuseleleni isenzo."},com_assistants_delete_actions_error:{english:"There was an error deleting the action.",translated:"Kube nephutha ekususeni isenzo."},com_assistants_actions_info:{english:"Let your Assistant retrieve information or take actions via API's",translated:"Vumela Umsizi wakho athole ulwazi noma enze izenzo nge-API's"},com_assistants_name_placeholder:{english:"Name your assistant (i.e. Email Generator)",translated:"Qamba umsizi wakho (isb. Umakhi We-imeyili)"},com_assistants_instructions_placeholder:{english:"Provide your assistant with specific, detailed, comprehensive guidelines to direct its behavior (i.e. Goal, Role, Actions, Audience, Style, Rules, Task, Template, Example)",translated:"Nikeza umyalo wakho ngemiyalelo ecacile, eningiliziwe, ebanzi yokuyiqondisa (isb. Umgomo, Indima, Izenzo, Izithameli, Isitayela, Imithetho, Umsebenzi, Isifanekiso, Isibonelo)"},com_assistants_description_placeholder:{english:"Describe concisely what your assistant can do (i.e. Generate emails from template)",translated:"Chaza kafushane okwenziwa umyalo wakho (isb. Dala ama-imeyili kusuka kusifanekiso)"},com_assistants_actions_disabled:{english:"You need to create an assistant before adding actions.",translated:"Udinga ukudala umyalo ngaphambi kokwengeza izenzo."},com_assistants_update_success:{english:"Successfully updated",translated:"Kubuyekezwe ngempumelelo"},com_assistants_update_error:{english:"There was an error updating your assistant.",translated:"Kube nephutha ekubuyekezeni umyalo wakho."},com_assistants_create_success:{english:"Successfully created",translated:"Kudaliwe ngempumelelo"},com_assistants_create_error:{english:"There was an error creating your assistant.",translated:"Kube nephutha ekudaleni umyalo wakho."},com_assistants_loading:{english:"Loading assistants...",translated:"Kulayishwa abeluleki..."},com_assistants_pii_redaction_reason_required:{english:"Please provide a reason for enabling PII.",translated:"Sicela unikeze isizathu sokuvumela i-PII."},com_assistants_settings_and_privacy:{english:"Settings & Privacy",translated:"Izilungiselelo & Ubumfihlo"},com_assistants_pii_redaction:{english:"PII Redaction",translated:"Ukususwa kwe-PII"},com_assistants_pii_redaction_enabled_info:{english:"PII redaction is enabled for this assistant's model calls by default.",translated:"Ukususwa kwe-PII kuvunyelwe ngokuzenzakalelayo kumamodeli omyalo."},com_assistants_pii_redaction_disabled_info:{english:"Allowing PII disables redaction for this assistant’s model calls. You are responsible for complying with your organization’s data policies. Activity is fully logged and monitored.",translated:"Ukuvumela i-PII kususa ukususwa kumamodeli omyalo. Unomthwalo wokuhambisana nezinqubomgomo zedatha zenhlangano yakho. Umsebenzi uqoshwa futhi ulandelwa ngokuphelele."},com_assistants_pii_redaction_off_reason_placeholder:{english:"Please explain your reason for enabling PII (required).",translated:"Sicela uchaze isizathu sokuvumela i-PII (kuyadingeka)."},com_ui_min_length_error:{english:"Minimum length is {0} characters.",translated:"Ubude obuncane bungu-{0} izinhlamvu."},com_ui_max_length_error:{english:"Maximum length is {0} characters.",translated:"Ubude obukhulu bungu-{0} izinhlamvu."},com_ui_date_today:{english:"Today",translated:"Namuhla"},com_ui_date_yesterday:{english:"Yesterday",translated:"Izolo"},com_ui_date_previous_7_days:{english:"Previous 7 days",translated:"Izinsuku ezi-7 ezedlule"},com_ui_date_previous_30_days:{english:"Previous 30 days",translated:"Izinsuku ezi-30 ezedlule"},com_ui_date_january:{english:"January",translated:"Januwari"},com_ui_date_february:{english:"February",translated:"Febhuwari"},com_ui_date_march:{english:"March",translated:"Mashi"},com_ui_date_april:{english:"April",translated:"Apreli"},com_ui_date_may:{english:"May",translated:"Meyi"},com_ui_date_june:{english:"June",translated:"Juni"},com_ui_date_july:{english:"July",translated:"Julayi"},com_ui_date_august:{english:"August",translated:"Agasti"},com_ui_date_september:{english:"September",translated:"Septhemba"},com_ui_date_october:{english:"October",translated:"Okthoba"},com_ui_date_november:{english:"November",translated:"Novemba"},com_ui_date_december:{english:"December",translated:"Disemba"},com_ui_field_required:{english:"This field is required",translated:"Le nkambu iyadingeka"},com_ui_download_error:{english:"Error downloading file. The file may have been deleted.",translated:"Iphutha ekulandeni ifayela. Ifayela kungenzeka selisusiwe."},com_ui_attach_error_type:{english:"Unsupported file type for endpoint:",translated:"Uhlobo lwefayela alusekelwa kuleli phoyinti:"},com_ui_attach_error_openai:{english:"Cannot attach Assistant files to other endpoints",translated:"Awukwazi ukunamathisela amafayela e-Assistant kwamanye amaphoyinti"},com_ui_attach_error_size:{english:"File size limit exceeded for endpoint:",translated:"Umkhawulo wesayizi yefayela udluliwe kuleli phoyinti:"},com_ui_attach_error:{english:"Cannot attach file. Create or select a conversation, or try refreshing the page.",translated:"Awukwazi ukunamathisela ifayela. Dala noma ukhethe ingxoxo, noma zama ukuvuselela ikhasi."},com_ui_examples:{english:"Examples",translated:"Izibonelo"},com_ui_new_chat:{english:"New chat",translated:"Ingxoxo entsha"},com_ui_conversations:{english:"Chats",translated:"Izingxoxo"},com_ui_conversations_placeholder:{english:"Start a conversation...",translated:"Qala ingxoxo..."},com_ui_new_conversation:{english:"New Chat",translated:"Ingxoxo Entsha"},com_ui_assistant_library:{english:"Assistant Library",translated:"Umthala we-Assistant"},com_ui_kbot_assistants:{english:"Knowledge",translated:"Ulwazi"},com_ui_assistant_search:{english:"Search for an assistant",translated:"Sesha i-Assistant"},com_ui_assistant_default_category:{english:"General",translated:"Okuvamile"},com_ui_assistant_featured:{english:"Featured",translated:"Okufakiwe"},com_ui_assistant_no_matches:{english:"No assistants match the search criteria.",translated:"Azikho i-Assistant ezihambisana nemibandela yokusesha."},com_ui_assistant_empty_results:{english:"No assistants found.",translated:"Azikho i-Assistant ezitholakele."},com_ui_example_quantum_computing:{english:"Explain quantum computing in simple terms",translated:"Chaza i-quantum computing kalula"},com_ui_example_10_year_old_b_day:{english:"Got any creative ideas for a 10 year old's birthday?",translated:"Unazo yini izimvo zokudala zomhla wokuzalwa womntwana oneminyaka eyi-10?"},com_ui_example_http_in_js:{english:"How do I make an HTTP request in Javascript?",translated:"Ngingayenza kanjani isicelo se-HTTP ku-Javascript?"},com_ui_category_placeholder:{english:"Search a category",translated:"Sesha isigaba"},com_ui_tool_placeholder:{english:"Search a tool",translated:"Sesha ithuluzi"},com_ui_capabilities:{english:"Capabilities",translated:"Amandla"},com_ui_capability_remember:{english:"Remembers what user said earlier in the conversation",translated:"Iyakukhumbula okushiwo umsebenzisi ekuqaleni kwengxoxo"},com_ui_capability_correction:{english:"Allows user to provide follow-up corrections",translated:"Ivumela umsebenzisi ukuthi anikeze izilungiso ezilandelayo"},com_ui_capability_decline_requests:{english:"Trained to decline inappropriate requests",translated:"Iqeqeshelwe ukwenqaba izicelo ezingafanele"},com_ui_limitations:{english:"Limitations",translated:"Imikhawulo"},com_ui_limitation_incorrect_info:{english:"May occasionally generate incorrect information",translated:"Kungenzeka ngezinye izikhathi ikhiqize ulwazi olungalungile"},com_ui_limitation_harmful_biased:{english:"May occasionally produce harmful instructions or biased content",translated:"Kungenzeka ngezinye izikhathi ikhiqize imiyalelo eyingozi noma okuqukethwe okucwasayo"},com_ui_limitation_limited_2021:{english:"Limited knowledge of world and events after 2021",translated:"Ulwazi olulinganiselwe ngomhlaba nezikhathi ngemuva kuka-2021"},com_ui_on:{english:"On",translated:"Vuliwe"},com_ui_off:{english:"Off",translated:"Cishiwe"},com_ui_yes:{english:"Yes",translated:"Yebo"},com_ui_no:{english:"No",translated:"Cha"},com_ui_ascending:{english:"Asc",translated:"Ukukhuphuka"},com_ui_descending:{english:"Desc",translated:"Ukwehla"},com_ui_show_all:{english:"Show All",translated:"Bonisa Konke"},com_ui_name:{english:"Name",translated:"Igama"},com_ui_date:{english:"Date",translated:"Usuku"},com_ui_storage:{english:"Storage",translated:"Isitoreji"},com_ui_context:{english:"Context",translated:"Uhlaka"},com_ui_size:{english:"Size",translated:"Usayizi"},com_ui_host:{english:"Host",translated:"Umphathi"},com_ui_update:{english:"Update",translated:"Buyekeza"},com_ui_authentication:{english:"Authentication",translated:"Ukuqinisekiswa"},com_ui_instructions:{english:"Instructions",translated:"Imiyalelo"},com_ui_description:{english:"Description",translated:"Incazelo"},com_ui_category:{english:"Category",translated:"Isigaba"},com_ui_category_tooltip:{english:"Assign a business category to help filter and organize assistants by function.",translated:"Nika isigaba sebhizinisi ukusiza ukuhlunga nokuhlela abasizi ngomsebenzi."},com_ui_error:{english:"Error",translated:"Iphutha"},com_ui_error_connection:{english:"Error connecting to server, try refreshing the page.",translated:"Iphutha lokuxhuma kuseva, zama ukuvuselela ikhasi."},com_ui_select:{english:"Select",translated:"Khetha"},com_ui_select_placeholder:{english:"Select options",translated:"Khetha izinketho"},com_ui_remove:{english:"Remove",translated:"Susa"},com_ui_input:{english:"Input",translated:"Faka"},com_ui_close:{english:"Close",translated:"Vala"},com_ui_model:{english:"Model",translated:"Imodeli"},com_ui_name_empty_error:{english:"The assistant name field cannot be empty. Please enter a valid name.",translated:"Igama lomsizi alinakuba lingenalutho. Sicela ufake igama elivumelekile."},com_ui_smart_prefix_error:{english:"Smart Prefix was used for General Assistants, Please use a different name.",translated:"I-Smart Prefix isetshenziswe kuma-General Assistants, Sicela usebenzise elinye igama."},com_ui_description_empty_error:{english:"The description field cannot be empty. Please enter a valid description.",translated:"Inkambu yencazelo ayinakuba lingenalutho. Sicela ufake incazelo evumelekile."},com_ui_instructions_empty_error:{english:"The instructions field cannot be empty. Please enter valid instructions.",translated:"Inkambu yemiyalelo ayinakuba lingenalutho. Sicela ufake imiyalelo evumelekile."},com_ui_category_empty_error:{english:"The category field cannot be empty. Please select a category.",translated:"Inkambu yesigaba ayinakuba lingenalutho. Sicela ukhethe isigaba."},com_ui_duplicate_assistant_error:{english:"A duplicate assistant name has been detected. Please choose a unique name.",translated:"Kutholakale igama lomsizi eliphindaphindiwe. Sicela ukhethe igama elihlukile."},com_ui_shared_with_empty_error:{english:"The shared with field cannot be empty. Please select a shared with option.",translated:"Inkambu yokwabelana ayinakuba lingenalutho. Sicela ukhethe inketho yokwabelana."},com_ui_shared_with:{english:"Shared With",translated:"Kuhlanganyelwe Nabo"},com_ui_shared_with_tooltip_1:{english:"Private – Only you can access and view this assistant.",translated:"Ngasese – Wena kuphela ongathola futhi ubuke lo msizi."},com_ui_shared_with_tooltip_2:{english:"Share only with Team – This assistant will be visible and accessible to your team members.",translated:"Yabelana kuphela neqembu – Lo msizi uzobonakala futhi utholakale kumalungu eqembu lakho."},com_ui_shared_with_team:{english:"Team",translated:"Ithimba"},com_ui_shared_with_team_tooltip:{english:"Select the team this assistant belongs to. Only teams you are a member of will appear here.",translated:"Khetha ithimba leli siza elingokwalona. Kutholakala kuphela amathimba ongumhlanganyeli kuwo."},com_ui_shared_with_team_empty_error:{english:"The team field cannot be empty. Please select a team.",translated:"Inkambu yethimba ayinakuba ningenalutho. Sicela ukhethe ithimba."},com_assistants_team_shared_locked:{english:"This assistant is locked for editing because it is team-shared.",translated:"Lo msizi ukhiyiwe ekushintsheni ngoba wabiwe nethimba."},com_ui_share_retrieve_error:{english:"Error loading shared links.",translated:"Iphutha ekulayisheni izixhumanisi ezabiwe."},com_ui_name_profanity_error:{english:"Your Assistant name contains offensive words and could not be sent. Please update your Assistant name.",translated:"Igama leSiza lakho liqukethe amagama ahlambalazayo futhi alikwazanga ukuthunyelwa. Sicela ulungise igama leSiza lakho."},com_ui_description_profanity_error:{english:"Your Description contains offensive words and could not be sent. Please update your Description.",translated:"Incazelo yakho iqukethe amagama ahlambalazayo futhi ayikwazanga ukuthunyelwa. Sicela ulungise Incazelo yakho."},com_ui_instructions_profanity_error:{english:"Your Instructions contains offensive words and could not be sent. Please update your Instructions.",translated:"Imiyalelo yakho iqukethe amagama ahlambalazayo futhi ayikwazanga ukuthunyelwa. Sicela ulungise Imiyalelo yakho."},com_ui_select_search_model:{english:"Search model by name",translated:"Sesha imodeli ngegama"},com_ui_select_search_plugin:{english:"Search plugin by name",translated:"Sesha isandiso ngegama"},com_ui_use_prompt:{english:"Use prompt",translated:"Sebenzisa isikhumbuzo"},com_ui_prev:{english:"Prev",translated:"Ngaphambilini"},com_ui_next:{english:"Next",translated:"Olandelayo"},com_ui_stop:{english:"Stop",translated:"Misa"},com_ui_upload_files:{english:"Upload files",translated:"Layisha amafayela"},com_ui_prompt_templates:{english:"Prompt Templates",translated:"Izifanekiso Zesikhumbuzo"},com_ui_hide_prompt_templates:{english:"Hide Prompt Templates",translated:"Fihla Izifanekiso Zesikhumbuzo"},com_ui_showing:{english:"Showing",translated:"Kubonisa"},com_ui_of:{english:"of",translated:"kwesika"},com_ui_entries:{english:"Entries",translated:"Okufakiwe"},com_ui_none_selected:{english:"None selected",translated:"Akukho okukhethiwe"},com_ui_upload_success:{english:"Successfully uploaded file",translated:"Ifayela lilayishwe ngempumelelo"},com_ui_upload_error:{english:"There was an error uploading your file",translated:"Kube nephutha ekulayisheni ifayela lakho"},com_ui_upload_invalid:{english:"Invalid file for upload. Must be an image not exceeding 2 MB",translated:"Ifayela elingavumelekile ukulayisha. Kufanele kube isithombe esingadluli ku-2 MB"},com_ui_thinking:{english:"Thinking",translated:"Ucabangela"},com_ui_analyzing_request:{english:"Understanding your question",translated:"Ukuhlaziya isicelo sakho"},com_ui_processing:{english:"Putting it together",translated:"Kuyacutshungulwa"},com_ui_working_on_it:{english:"Almost ready",translated:"Kuyasetshenzwa"},com_ui_cancel:{english:"Cancel",translated:"Khansela"},com_ui_save:{english:"Save",translated:"Londoloza"},com_user_message:{english:"You",translated:"Wena"},com_ui_read_aloud:{english:"Read aloud",translated:"Funda ngokuzwakalayo"},com_ui_copied:{english:"Copied!",translated:"Kukopishiwe!"},com_ui_copy_code:{english:"Copy code",translated:"Kopisha ikhodi"},com_ui_copy_to_clipboard:{english:"Copy to clipboard",translated:"Kopisha ebhodini"},com_ui_copied_to_clipboard:{english:"Copied to clipboard",translated:"Kukopishiwe ebhodini"},com_ui_mention:{english:"Mention an endpoint, assistant, or preset to quickly switch to it",translated:"Shono indawo, umsizi, noma isethaphu ukuze ushintshe masisha"},com_ui_regenerate:{english:"Regenerate",translated:"Phinda"},com_ui_edit:{english:"Edit",translated:"Hlela"},com_ui_all:{english:"all",translated:"konke"},com_ui_clear:{english:"Clear",translated:"Sula"},com_ui_import_conversation:{english:"Import",translated:"Ngenisa"},com_ui_nothing_found:{english:"Nothing found",translated:"Akukho okutholiwe"},com_ui_go_to_conversation:{english:"Go to conversation",translated:"Iya engxoxweni"},com_ui_import_conversation_info:{english:"Import conversations from a JSON file",translated:"Ngenisa izingxoxo kufayela le-JSON"},com_ui_import_conversation_success:{english:"Conversations imported successfully",translated:"Izingxoxo zingenisiwe ngempumelelo"},com_ui_import_conversation_error:{english:"There was an error importing your conversations",translated:"Kube nephutha ekungeniseni izingxoxo zakho"},com_ui_import_conversation_file_type_error:{english:"Unsupported import type",translated:"Uhlobo lokungenisa alusekelwa"},com_ui_confirm_action:{english:"Confirm Action",translated:"Qinisekisa Isenzo"},com_ui_avatar:{english:"Avatar",translated:"I-avatar"},com_ui_unknown:{english:"Unknown",translated:"Okungaziwa"},com_ui_result:{english:"Result",translated:"Umphumela"},com_ui_image_gen:{english:"Image Gen",translated:"Ukudala Isithombe"},com_ui_assistant:{english:"Assistant",translated:"Umsekeli"},com_ui_assistant_deleted:{english:"Successfully deleted assistant",translated:"Umsekeli ususiwe ngempumelelo"},com_ui_assistant_delete_error:{english:"There was an error deleting the assistant",translated:"Kube nephutha ekususeni umsekeli"},com_ui_assistant_duplicate_file_upload:{english:"Duplicate file detected.",translated:"Ifayela eliphindaphindiwe litholakele."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_error:{english:"An error occurred while uploading the file.",translated:"Kube nephutha ekulayisheni ifayela."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_endpoint_undefined:{english:"An error occurred while uploading the file: Endpoint is undefined",translated:"Kube nephutha ekulayisheni ifayela: I-Endpoint ayichazwanga"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_not_empty:{english:"Empty files are not allowed.",translated:"Amafayela angenalutho awavunyelwe."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_count_error:{english:"You can only upload up to {0} files at a time.",translated:"Ungalayisha kuphela kufika ku-{0} amafayela ngesikhathi esisodwa."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_section_count_error:{english:"You can only upload up to {0} files in this section.",translated:"Ungalayisha kuphela kufika ku-{0} amafayela kulesi sigaba."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_section_response_error:{english:"The upload limit has been reached for {0}",translated:"Umkhawulo wokulayisha usufinyelelwe ku-{0}"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_type_unknown:{english:"Unable to determine file type for: {0}",translated:"Ayikwazi ukunquma uhlobo lwefayela: {0}"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_unsupported_type:{english:"File type not supported. Please upload a supported file format.",translated:"Uhlobo lwefayela alusekelwe. Sicela ulayishe ifomethi yefayela esekelwa."},com_ui_assistant_image_failed_load:{english:"Failed to load image",translated:"Yehlulekile ukulayisha isithombe"},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_supported_type:{english:"Currently, only JPEG, JPG, PNG, and WEBP files are supported.",translated:"Okwamanje, amafayela e-JPEG, JPG, PNG, ne-WEBP kuphela asekelwa."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_size_limit:{english:"File size exceeds {0} MB.",translated:"Usayizi wefayela udlula {0} MB."},com_ui_assistant_file_upload_total_size_limit:{english:"The total size of the files cannot exceed {0} MB.",translated:"Usayizi ophelele wamafayela awukwazi ukudlula {0} MB."},com_ui_assistant_file_validation_error:{english:"An error occurred while validating the file.",translated:"Kube nephutha ekuqinisekiseni ifayela."},com_ui_assistant_file_processing_error:{english:"An error occurred while processing the file.",translated:"Kube nephutha ekucubunguleni ifayela."},com_ui_assistants:{english:"Assistants",translated:"Abasekeli"},com_ui_assistants_category_ix_customer:{english:"Studio Assistance",translated:"Usizo LweStudio"},com_ui_assistants_category_kbot:{english:"Knowledge",translated:"Ulwazi"},com_ui_assistants_uncategorized:{english:"Uncategorized",translated:"Akukahlukaniswa"},com_ui_attachment:{english:"Attachment",translated:"Isixhumi"},com_ui_assistants_output:{english:"Assistants Output",translated:"Okuphuma Kwabasizi"},com_ui_delete:{english:"Delete",translated:"Susa"},com_ui_create:{english:"Create",translated:"Dala"},com_ui_share:{english:"Share",translated:"Yabelana"},com_ui_copy_link:{english:"Copy link",translated:"Kopisha isixhumanisi"},com_ui_update_link:{english:"Update link",translated:"Buyekeza isixhumanisi"},com_ui_create_link:{english:"Create link",translated:"Dala isixhumanisi"},com_ui_share_link_to_chat:{english:"Share link to chat",translated:"Yabelana ngesixhumanisi kwi-chat"},com_ui_share_error:{english:"There was an error sharing the chat link",translated:"Kube nephutha ekwabelaneni ngesixhumanisi se-chat"},com_ui_share_create_message:{english:"Your name and any messages you add after sharing stay private.",translated:"Igama lakho nemiyalezo oyengeza ngemva kokwabelana kuhlala kuyimfihlo."},com_ui_share_created_message:{english:"A public link to your chat has been created. Manage previously shared chats at any time via Settings.",translated:"Isixhumanisi somphakathi se-chat yakho sidaliwe. Phatha izingxoxo ezabelwe ngaphambilini nganoma yisiphi isikhathi kuzilungiselelo."},com_ui_share_update_message:{english:"Your name, custom instructions, and any messages you add after sharing stay private.",translated:"Igama lakho, imiyalelo yangokwezifiso, nemiyalezo oyengeza ngemva kokwabelana kuhlala kuyimfihlo."},com_ui_share_updated_message:{english:"A public link to your chat has been updated. Manage previously shared chats at any time via Settings.",translated:"Isixhumanisi somphakathi se-chat yakho sibuyekeziwe. Phatha izingxoxo ezabelwe ngaphambilini nganoma yisiphi isikhathi kuzilungiselelo."},com_ui_shared_link_not_found:{english:"Shared link not found",translated:"Isixhumanisi esabelwe asitholakali"},com_ui_delete_conversation:{english:"Delete chat?",translated:"Susa i-chat?"},com_ui_delete_conversation_confirm:{english:"This will delete",translated:"Lokhu kuzokhipha"},com_ui_delete_assistant_confirm:{english:"Are you sure you want to delete this Assistant? This cannot be undone.",translated:"Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukususa lo Msizi? Lokhu ngeke kubuyiselwe emuva."},com_ui_rename:{english:"Rename",translated:"Qamba kabusha"},com_ui_more_options:{english:"More",translated:"Okunye"},com_ui_preview:{english:"Preview",translated:"Buka kuqala"},com_ui_upload:{english:"Upload",translated:"Layisha"},com_ui_upload_delay:{english:'Uploading "{0}" is taking more time than anticipated. Please wait while the file finishes indexing for retrieval.',translated:'Ukulayisha "{0}" kuthatha isikhathi eside kunalokho obekulindelwe. Sicela ulinde ifayela liqede ukufakwa ukuze litholakale.'},com_ui_privacy_policy:{english:"Privacy policy",translated:"Inqubomgomo yobumfihlo"},com_ui_terms_of_service:{english:"Terms of service",translated:"Imigomo yesevisi"},com_ui_use_micrphone:{english:"Use microphone",translated:"Sebenzisa imakrofoni"},com_ui_min_tags:{english:"Cannot remove more values, a minimum of {0} are required.",translated:"Awukwazi ukususa amanani amaningi, okungenani {0} kuyadingeka."},com_ui_max_tags:{english:"Maximum number allowed is {0}, using latest values.",translated:"Inani eliphezulu elivumelekile ngu-{0}, kusetshenziswa amanani amasha."},com_auth_error_login:{english:"Unable to login with the information provided. Please check your credentials and try again.",translated:"Ayikwazanga ukungena ngemvume ngemininingwane enikeziwe. Sicela uhlole iziqinisekiso zakho uzame futhi."},com_auth_error_login_rl:{english:"You have exceeded the number of allowed login attempts. Please try again in 15 minutes.",translated:"Udlulile inani lezama zokungena ngemvume ezivumelekile. Sicela uzame futhi ngemva kwemizuzu eyi-15."},com_auth_error_login_ban:{english:"Your account has been temporarily banned due to violations of our service.",translated:"I-akhawunti yakho imisiwe okwesikhashana ngenxa yokwephula imigomo yesevisi yethu."},com_auth_error_login_server:{english:"There was an internal server error. Please wait a few moments and try again.",translated:"Kube nephutha lesiphakeli sangaphakathi. Sicela ulinde isikhashana uzame futhi."},com_auth_sign_in:{english:"Login",translated:"Ngena ngemvume"},com_endpoint_system_message:{english:"System Message",translated:"Umlayezo Wesistimu"},com_endpoint_message:{english:"Message",translated:"Umlayezo"},com_endpoint_messages:{english:"Messages",translated:"Imilayezo"},com_endpoint_message_not_appendable:{english:"Edit your message or Regenerate.",translated:"Hlela umlayezo wakho noma Phinda uveze."},com_endpoint_default_blank:{english:"default: blank",translated:"okuzenzakalelayo: okungenalutho"},com_endpoint_default_false:{english:"default: false",translated:"okuzenzakalelayo: amanga"},com_endpoint_default_creative:{english:"default: creative",translated:"okuzenzakalelayo: okudala"},com_endpoint_default_empty:{english:"default: empty",translated:"okuzenzakalelayo: okungenalutho"},com_endpoint_default_with_num:{english:"default: {0}",translated:"okuzenzakalelayo: {0}"},com_endpoint_context:{english:"Context",translated:"Uhlaka"},com_endpoint_tone_style:{english:"Tone Style",translated:"Isitayela Somoya"},com_endpoint_token_count:{english:"Token count",translated:"Inani lamathokheni"},com_endpoint_output:{english:"Output",translated:"Okukhiphayo"},com_endpoint_context_tokens:{english:"Max Context Tokens",translated:"Amathokheni Esiqubulo Esiphezulu"},com_endpoint_context_info:{english:`The maximum number of tokens that can be used for context. Use this for control of how many tokens are sent per request.
  If unspecified, will use system defaults based on known models' context size. Setting higher values may result in errors and/or higher token cost.`,translated:`Inani eliphezulu lamathokheni angasetshenziswa kuhlaka. Sebenzisa lokhu ukulawula ukuthi mangaki amathokheni athunyelwa ngesicelo ngasinye.
  Uma kungacacisiwe, kuzosebenzisa okuzenzakalelayo kwesistimu ngokusekelwe kosayizi wesiqubulo samamodeli aziwayo. Ukusetha amanani aphezulu kungaholela kumaphutha kanye/noma izindleko eziphezulu zamathokheni.`},com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_placeholder:{english:"Set custom instructions or context. Ignored if empty.",translated:"Setha imiyalo yangokwezifiso noma uhlaka. Kunganakwa uma kungenalutho."},com_endpoint_instructions_assistants_placeholder:{english:"Overrides the instructions of the assistant. This is useful for modifying the behavior on a per-run basis.",translated:"Kudlula imiyalelo ye-assistant. Lokhu kuyasiza ekuguquleni ukuziphatha ngokusekelwe ekusebenzeni ngakunye."},com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_assistants_placeholder:{english:"Set additional instructions or context on top of the Assistant's main instructions. Ignored if empty.",translated:"Beka imiyalelo eyengeziwe noma umongo ngaphezu kwemiyalelo eyinhloko ye-Assistant. Kuyahoxiswa uma kungenalutho."},com_endpoint_custom_name:{english:"Custom Name",translated:"Igama Elenziwe Ngokwezifiso"},com_endpoint_prompt_prefix:{english:"Custom Instructions",translated:"Imiyalelo Ngokwezifiso"},com_endpoint_prompt_prefix_assistants:{english:"Additional Instructions",translated:"Imiyalelo Eyengeziwe"},com_endpoint_instructions_assistants:{english:"Override Instructions",translated:"Dlula Imiyalelo"},com_endpoint_temperature:{english:"Temperature",translated:"Izinga Lokushisa"},com_endpoint_default:{english:"default",translated:"okuzenzakalelayo"},com_endpoint_top_p:{english:"Top P",translated:"I-Top P"},com_endpoint_top_k:{english:"Top K",translated:"I-Top K"},com_endpoint_max_output_tokens:{english:"Max Output Tokens",translated:"Inani Eliphezulu Lama-Output Tokens"},com_endpoint_stop:{english:"Stop Sequences",translated:"Misa Iziqu"},com_endpoint_stop_placeholder:{english:"Separate values by pressing `Enter`",translated:"Hlukanisa amanani ngokucindezela `Enter`"},com_endpoint_openai_max_tokens:{english:"Optional `max_tokens` field, representing the maximum number of tokens that can be generated in the chat completion.\n    \n    The total length of input tokens and generated tokens is limited by the models context length. You may experience errors if this number exceeds the max context tokens.",translated:"Inkambu yokuzikhethela `max_tokens`, emelela inani eliphezulu lama-tokens angakhiqizwa ekuphothulweni kwengxoxo.\n\nUbude obuphelele bama-tokens wokufaka nama-tokens akhiqiziwe bukhawulwe ubude bomongo bemodeli. Ungase uhlangabezane namaphutha uma leli nani lidlula ama-tokens omongo omkhulu."},com_endpoint_openai_temp:{english:"Higher values = more random, while lower values = more focused and deterministic. We recommend altering this or Top P but not both.",translated:"Amanani aphezulu = angahleliwe kakhulu, kanti amanani aphansi = agxile kakhulu futhi anqume. Sincoma ukuguqula lokhu noma i-Top P kodwa hhayi kokubili."},com_endpoint_openai_max:{english:"The max tokens to generate. The total length of input tokens and generated tokens is limited by the model's context length.",translated:"Ama-tokens aphezulu okuzikhiqiza. Ubude obuphelele bama-tokens wokufaka nama-tokens akhiqiziwe bukhawulwe ubude bomongo bemodeli."},com_endpoint_openai_topp:{english:"An alternative to sampling with temperature, called nucleus sampling, where the model considers the results of the tokens with top_p probability mass. So 0.1 means only the tokens comprising the top 10% probability mass are considered. We recommend altering this or temperature but not both.",translated:"Enye indlela yokusampula nge-temperature, ebizwa ngokuthi i-nucleus sampling, lapho imodeli icabangela imiphumela yama-tokens anomthamo we-top_p probability. Ngakho 0.1 kusho ukuthi kuphela ama-tokens ahlanganisa ama-10% probability mass aphezulu acatshangelwa. Sincoma ukuguqula lokhu noma izinga lokushisa kodwa hhayi kokubili."},com_endpoint_openai_freq:{english:"Number between 0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on their existing frequency in the text so far, decreasing the model's likelihood to repeat the same line verbatim.",translated:"Inombolo phakathi kuka-0 no-2.0. Amanani amahle ahlulela ama-tokens amasha ngokusekelwe ekubeni khona kwawo embhalweni kuze kube manje, anciphisa amathuba emodeli okuphinda umugqa ofanayo."},com_endpoint_openai_pres:{english:"Number between 0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on whether they appear in the text so far, increasing the model's likelihood to talk about new topics.",translated:"Inombolo phakathi kuka-0 no-2.0. Amanani amahle ahlulela ama-tokens amasha ngokusekelwe ekubonakaleni kwawo embhalweni kuze kube manje, andisa amathuba emodeli okukhuluma ngezihloko ezintsha."},com_endpoint_openai_resend_files:{english:"Resend all previously attached files. Note: this will increase token cost and you may experience errors with many attachments.",translated:"Thumela kabusha wonke amafayela anamathelwe ngaphambili. Qaphela: lokhu kuzokwandisa izindleko zama-tokens futhi ungase uhlangabezane namaphutha ngokunamathela okuningi."},com_endpoint_openai_detail:{english:'The resolution for Vision requests. "Low" is cheaper and faster, "High" is more detailed and expensive, and "Auto" will automatically choose between the two based on the image resolution.',translated:'Isinqumo sezicelo ze-Vision. "Low" ishibhile futhi iyashesha, "High" inemininingwane eningi futhi ibiza kakhulu, kanti "Auto" izokhetha ngokuzenzakalelayo phakathi kwalokhu okubili ngokusekelwe kusinqumo sesithombe.'},com_endpoint_openai_stop:{english:"Up to 4 sequences where the API will stop generating further tokens.",translated:"Kuze kufike ku-4 iziqu lapho i-API izoyeka ukukhiqiza ama-tokens engeziwe."},com_endpoint_openai_custom_name_placeholder:{english:"Set a custom name for iXHello",translated:"Beka igama elenziwe ngokwezifiso le-iXHello"},com_endpoint_openai_prompt_prefix_placeholder:{english:"Set custom instructions to include in System Message. Default: none",translated:"Beka imiyalelo eyenziwe ngokwezifiso okufanele ifakwe kuMlayezo Wesistimu. Okuzenzakalelayo: akukho"},com_endpoint_frequency_penalty:{english:"Frequency Penalty",translated:"Isijeziso Sokuphindaphinda"},com_endpoint_presence_penalty:{english:"Presence Penalty",translated:"Isijeziso Sobukhona"},com_endpoint_plug_use_functions:{english:"Use Functions",translated:"Sebenzisa Imisebenzi"},com_endpoint_plug_resend_files:{english:"Resend Files",translated:"Thumela Kabusha Amafayela"},com_endpoint_plug_image_detail:{english:"Image Detail",translated:"Imininingwane Yesithombe"},com_endpoint_plug_skip_completion:{english:"Skip Completion",translated:"Dlula Ukuqeda"},com_endpoint_plug_set_custom_instructions_for_gpt_placeholder:{english:"Set custom instructions to include in System Message. Default: none",translated:"Setha imiyalelo yangokwezifiso yokufaka kuMlayezo Wesistimu. Okuzenzakalelayo: akukho"},com_endpoint_import:{english:"Import",translated:"Ngenisa"},com_endpoint_set_custom_name:{english:"Set a custom name, in case you can find this preset",translated:"Setha igama elenziwe ngokwezifiso, uma ungathola le preset"},com_endpoint_preset_delete_confirm:{english:"Are you sure you want to delete this preset?",translated:"Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukususa le preset?"},com_endpoint_preset_import:{english:"Preset Imported!",translated:"I-Preset Ingenisiwe!"},com_endpoint_preset_import_error:{english:"There was an error importing your preset. Please try again.",translated:"Kube nephutha ekungeniseni i-preset yakho. Sicela uzame futhi."},com_endpoint_preset_save_error:{english:"There was an error saving your preset. Please try again.",translated:"Kube nephutha ekulondolozeni i-preset yakho. Sicela uzame futhi."},com_endpoint_preset_delete_error:{english:"There was an error deleting your preset. Please try again.",translated:"Kube nephutha ekusuleni i-preset yakho. Sicela uzame futhi."},com_endpoint_preset_default_removed:{english:"is no longer the default preset.",translated:"akuseyona i-preset ezenzakalelayo."},com_endpoint_preset_default_item:{english:"Default:",translated:"Okuzenzakalelayo:"},com_endpoint_preset_default_none:{english:"No default preset active.",translated:"Ayikho i-preset ezenzakalelayo esebenzayo."},com_endpoint_preset_title:{english:"Preset",translated:"I-Preset"},com_endpoint_preset_saved:{english:"Saved!",translated:"Kulondoloziwe!"},com_endpoint_preset_default:{english:"is now the default preset.",translated:"manje iyipreset ezenzakalelayo."},com_endpoint_preset:{english:"preset",translated:"ipreset"},com_endpoint_presets:{english:"presets",translated:"amapreset"},com_endpoint_preset_selected_title:{english:"Active!",translated:"Isebenzayo!"},com_endpoint_preset_name:{english:"Preset Name",translated:"Igama Le-Preset"},com_endpoint:{english:"Endpoint",translated:"I-Endpoint"},com_endpoint_examples:{english:" Presets",translated:"Amapreset"},com_endpoint_export:{english:"Export",translated:"Thumela"},com_endpoint_export_share:{english:"Export/Share",translated:"Thumela/Yabelana"},com_endpoint_assistant:{english:"Assistant",translated:"Umxhumanisi"},com_endpoint_use_active_assistant:{english:"Use Active Assistant",translated:"Sebenzisa Umxhumanisi Osebenzayo"},com_endpoint_save_as_preset:{english:"Save As Preset",translated:"Londoloza Njenge-Preset"},com_endpoint_presets_clear_warning:{english:"Are you sure you want to clear all presets? This is irreversible.",translated:"Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukususa wonke ama-preset? Lokhu akuguquki."},com_endpoint_no_presets:{english:"No presets yet, use the settings button to create one",translated:"Awekho ama-preset okwamanje, sebenzisa inkinobho yezilungiselelo ukudala eyodwa"},com_endpoint_my_preset:{english:"My Preset",translated:"I-Preset Yami"},com_endpoint_agent_model:{english:"Agent Model (Recommended: GPT-3.5)",translated:"Imodeli Ye-Agent (Kunconyiwe: GPT-3.5)"},com_endpoint_completion_model:{english:"Completion Model (Recommended: GPT-4)",tr